const FULL_U01_U24={"U01":[["unite","使聯合；團結","Our goal is to ______ the labor unions to oppose the new policy.","我們的目標是聯合這些勞工團體反對這項新政策。","unify vt. 統整；統一；teamwork n. 團隊合作；in unity 團結一致","v.","unite","Our goal is to unite the labor unions to oppose the new policy.","原書例句"],["unity","一致；團結（不可數）","The plot of the drama lacks ______.","這齣戲的劇情缺乏一致性。","in unity 團結一致","n.","unity","The plot of the drama lacks unity.","原書例句"],["union","工會；聯合","The ______ decided to go on strike due to the low wages.","由於薪資偏低，因此該工會決定罷工。","reunion n. 重聚；團圓；a labor union 工會；a trade union 商會","n.","union","The union decided to go on strike due to the low wages.","原書例句"],["remain","繼續存在；仍是（之後接名詞或形容詞作補語）","No one ______ in the hall soon after the concert was over.","音樂會結束沒多久，大廳裡一個人都不剩了。","remaining a. 剩下的；stay vi. 仍然待著；remain + 形容詞／名詞；remain + V-ing；It remains to be seen + 疑問詞子句","v.","remained","No one remained in the hall soon after the concert was over.","原書例句"],["remains","遺跡；遺體（常用複數）","The writer’s ______ are buried in his hometown.","這位作家的遺體被埋在他的故鄉。","remains 亦可作「遺體」；常用複數","n.","remains","The writer’s remains are buried in his hometown.","原書例句"],["probable","很可能的","It seems ______ that this accident is the result of the driver’s carelessness.","看來意外很可能是因為駕駛的粗心所致。","probably adv. 很可能；或許；likely a. 很可能的；It is / seems probable that...","a.","probable","It seems probable that this accident is the result of the driver’s carelessness.","原書例句"],["probability","可能性","The ______ is that the match will be postponed.","這場比賽很可能會延期。","likelihood n. 可能性","n.","probability","The probability is that the match will be postponed.","原書例句"],["situation","處境；情勢","What would you do in such a ______?","在那種情況下你會怎麼做？","本字常與介詞 in 並用","n.","situation","What would you do in such a situation?","原書例句"],["determine","決定；確定","Lilly ______ to leave for the hospital at once.","莉莉決定馬上動身去醫院。","determination n. 決心；resolve vt. 決定；determine to + V；resolve to + V；make up one's mind to + V","vt.","determined","Lilly determined to leave for the hospital at once.","原書例句"],["determined","有決心的","I’m ______ to quit gambling.","我已下定決心要戒賭。","be determined to + V 決心要……","a.","determined","I’m determined to quit gambling.","原書例句"],["rate","比率；評比為","The ______ of unemployment has been rising in recent years.","近年來的失業率逐漸上升。","at any rate 無論如何；Anyway,...；Anyhow,...；rate sth as...","n. & vt.","rate","The rate of unemployment has been rising in recent years.","原書例句"],["political","政治的","The writer fled abroad seeking ______ asylum.","這位作家逃到國外尋求政治庇護。","politically adv. 政治上地；political asylum 政治庇護","a.","political","The writer fled abroad seeking political asylum.","原書例句"],["politics","政治","Most youngsters are not interested in ______.","多數的年輕人都不熱衷政治。","政治（名詞）","n.","politics","Most youngsters are not interested in politics.","原書例句"],["politician","政客","I’d rather trust a hungry wolf than a ______.","我寧願相信一匹餓狼也不願意相信政客。","政客","n.","politician","I’d rather trust a hungry wolf than a politician.","原書例句"],["process","過程；處理","I’m afraid getting things changed will be a slow ______.","事情要改變恐怕會是一個緩慢的過程。","be in the process of + N/V-ing 正在進行……中；processed foods 加工食品；meat processing 肉類加工","n. & vt.","process","I’m afraid getting things changed will be a slow process.","原書例句"],["majority","大部分","The ______ of residents on the island can only speak their own dialect.","這島上大部分的居民只會說他們自己的方言。","the / a majority of... 大部分的……；major：a. 大部分的／主要的／重要的；vt. 主修；n. 主修科目","n.","majority","The majority of residents on the island can only speak their own dialect.","原書例句"],["property","財產（不可數）；特性（可數）","They lost all their ______ in the fire.","他們在這場大火中失去了所有財產。","possessions n. 財產（通常用複數）；assets n. 資產（通常用複數）；quality n. 特性","n.","property","They lost all their property in the fire.","原書例句"],["opportunity","機會；良機","This trip is a great ______ to broaden your horizons and practice your English.","這趟旅行是個拓展視野以及練習英文的好機會。","chance n. 機會；a golden opportunity 千載難逢的良機","n.","opportunity","This trip is a great opportunity to broaden your horizons and practice your English.","原書例句"],["actually","事實上；實際上（= in fact）","Nick likes to act like a teenager, but ______ he’s more than 30 years old.","尼克喜歡裝作青少年的樣子，但他事實上已經 30 多歲了。","actual a. 真實的；實際的；really adv. 事實上；實際上；in fact 事實上","adv.","actually","Nick likes to act like a teenager, but actually he’s more than 30 years old.","原書例句"],["recognize","認出；承認；認可","After being separated for twenty years, Jack cannot ______ his daughter.","失散 20 年後，傑克認不出他的女兒來了。","recognizable a. 可分辨的／認得出的；unrecognizable a. 認不出來的；recognizably adv. 可辨認地；recognition n. 認出／承認／認可","vt.","recognize","After being separated for twenty years, Jack cannot recognize his daughter.","原書例句"],["enjoyable","愉快的","The party we had last Friday night was really ______.","我們上星期五晚上那場派對實在愉快極了。","enjoy vt. 享受；enjoyment n. 享受；pleasant a. 愉快的；boring a. 令人無聊的","a.","enjoyable","The party we had last Friday night was really enjoyable.","原書例句"],["joyful","喜悅的","We were excited and ______, knowing that our team had won the game.","獲知球隊贏了比賽時，我們既興奮又高興。","joy n. 喜悅；joyfully adv. 喜悅地；joyous a. 快樂的","a.","joyful","We were excited and joyful, knowing that our team had won the game.","原書例句"],["unique","與眾不同的；獨有的","Every person’s fingerprints are ______. No two people’s are alike.","每個人的指紋都是獨一無二的，沒有人是相同的。","be unique to + 地方 為某地所特有；be native to + 地方；be indigenous to + 地方；indigenous a. 土生的／土長的","a.","unique","Every person’s fingerprints are unique. No two people’s are alike.","原書例句"],["terrific","很棒的","The restaurant on the corner serves ______ food.","轉角那間餐廳的餐點棒極了。","excellent a. 極優秀的；fantastic a. 很棒的","a.","terrific","The restaurant on the corner serves terrific food.","原書例句"],["wed","結婚","Ken ______ his lover without his parents’ consent.","肯未經父母同意便娶了他的情人。","wed, wedded / wed, wedded；marry vt. & vi. 結婚；the newlyweds 新婚夫婦","vt. & vi.","wedded","Ken wedded his lover without his parents’ consent.","原書例句"],["tough","堅韌的；嚴厲的；艱苦的；困難的","This meat is too ______, Mom. I think you overcooked it.","媽，這塊肉好硬。我想妳把它煮得太老了。","be tough on sb 對某人很嚴厲；sturdy a. 堅韌的；difficult a. 困難的；harsh a. 嚴厲的","a.","tough","This meat is too tough, Mom. I think you overcooked it.","原書例句"],["hire","僱用；租用","We ______ a consultant to devise a new system for our company.","我們僱用一位顧問來幫公司設計一套新制度。","for hire 可供租用；employ vt. 僱用；rent vt. 租用／n. 租金","vt. & n.","hired","We hired a consultant to devise a new system for our company.","原書例句"],["homesick","思鄉的","I couldn’t help feeling ______ on sleepless nights.","夜晚我睡不著時就忍不住會想家。","nostalgic a. 鄉愁的","a.","homesick","I couldn’t help feeling homesick on sleepless nights.","原書例句"],["invitation","邀請；請帖；邀請卡","Mr. Lee joined the group at the ______ of the government.","李先生應政府的邀請加入這個小組。","invite vt. 邀請／引誘／招致；inviting a. 誘人的；the food looks inviting；at the invitation of sb 應某人之邀","n.","invitation","Mr. Lee joined the group at the invitation of the government.","原書例句"],["jealous","嫉妒的；吃醋的","Why are you so ______ of David’s promotion?","為什麼大衛升遷你會那麼嫉妒？","be jealous of... 嫉妒……；jealousy n. 嫉妒；envy / envious 相關字","a.","jealous","Why are you so jealous of David’s promotion?","原書例句"],["envy","嫉妒；羨慕","Peter’s new cell phone is the ______ of everyone in the office.","彼得的新手機羨煞辦公室內所有人。","be the envy of sb 令某人羨慕；envy sb sth；be envious of...","n. & vt.","envy","Peter’s new cell phone is the envy of everyone in the office.","原書例句"],["fright","驚嚇","Andy looked at the barking dog with ______.","安迪害怕地看著那隻狂吠的狗。","with fright 害怕地；stage fright 怯場；fear / horror / terror 相關字","n.","fright","Andy looked at the barking dog with fright.","原書例句"],["frighten","使驚嚇","You should not let your son watch that movie because it might ______ him.","你不應該讓你的兒子看那部電影，因為那有可能會嚇到他。","be frightened to death 嚇得半死；frighten sb into + V-ing；frightened a. 受到驚嚇的；frightening a. 令人害怕的；scare / terrify vt. 使害怕","vt.","frighten","You should not let your son watch that movie because it might frighten him.","原書例句"],["locate","位於（用於被動語態）；找到……的位置；設置","Our school is ______ in that area.","我們學校位在那個區域。","be located in/on/at... 位於……；be situated in/on/at...；lie in/on/at...；locate + 受詞 找到……的位置","vt.","located","Our school is located in that area.","原書例句"],["location","地點；位置","Please come visit our store at its new ______.","請到我們店的新址參觀。","地點；位置","n.","location","Please come visit our store at its new location.","原書例句"],["costly","昂貴的；代價高的","Money is hard to earn, so I never buy ______ clothes.","錢很難賺，因此我絕不買昂貴的衣服。","cost vt. 花費 & n. 價錢；expensive a. 昂貴的","a.","costly","Money is hard to earn, so I never buy costly clothes.","原書例句"],["mostly","主要地","John succeeded ______ because he worked hard and had great ambition.","約翰能成功主要是因為他努力工作又有強烈的企圖心。","largely adv. 大大地／大部分；mainly adv. 主要地；primarily adv. 主要地","adv.","mostly","John succeeded mostly because he worked hard and had great ambition.","原書例句"],["lately","最近","Have you seen James ______?","你最近見到詹姆士了嗎？","recently adv. 最近；lately 通常用於完成式；中文「最近」若指未來語境，可用 in the near future","adv.","lately","Have you seen James lately?","原書例句"],["besides","除……之外；此外（= additionally）","______ math, Lucy is good at music.","露西除了精通數學以外，也精通音樂。","beside prep. 在……旁邊；Besides,... 此外；besides + N 除……之外","prep. & adv.","Besides","Besides math, Lucy is good at music.","原書例句"],["career","職業（尤指終身職業）；職業的","Ms. Wilson took up photography as her ______.","威爾遜女士以攝影作為她的終身職業。","a career soldier 職業軍人；a career woman 職業婦女","n. & a.","career","Ms. Wilson took up photography as her career.","原書例句"],["painter","畫家；油漆匠","My father used to be a ______ but gave it up later.","我父親曾經是位畫家，不過後來放棄了。","paint n. 繪畫顏料／油漆；painting n. 畫作","n.","painter","My father used to be a painter but gave it up later.","原書例句"],["banker","銀行家","Mr. Emery is a successful ______, but he leads a simple life.","艾默里先生是成功的銀行家，卻過著簡樸的生活。","bank n. 銀行／河邊；banking n. 銀行業務","n.","banker","Mr. Emery is a successful banker, but he leads a simple life.","原書例句"],["captain","船長；機長；連長；隊長","The ______ told the sailors to raise the sails.","船長要水手們將帆升起。","船長；機長；連長；隊長","n.","captain","The captain told the sailors to raise the sails.","原書例句"],["photographer","照相師；攝影記者","The ______ won an award for his photos of war.","這名攝影記者因戰爭照片而獲獎。","cameraman n. 電影攝影師／電視攝影記者","n.","photographer","The photographer won an award for his photos of war.","原書例句"],["producer","生產者；製作人","The firm is one of the main ______ of laptop computers.","這家公司是筆記型電腦的主要製造商之一。","manufacturer n. 廠商／製造業者；maker n. 製造者","n.","producers","The firm is one of the main producers of laptop computers.","原書例句"],["professor","（大學）教授","Mr. Stevens is a ______ of psychology.","史蒂芬先生是心理系的教授。","lecturer n. 講師；associate professor n. 大學副教授","n.","professor","Mr. Stevens is a professor of psychology.","原書例句"]],"U02":[["permit","允許；許可證","We are not ______ to smoke here.","我們不被允許在這裡抽菸。","permitted；permissive a. 許可的；permissible a. 可允許的；permit sb to + V；permit + V-ing；allow vt. 允許；ban vt./n. 禁止；prohibit vt. 禁止","vt. & vi.；n.","permitted","We are not permitted to smoke here.","原書例句"],["permission","許可；允許","You are not allowed to use the machine without my ______.","沒有我的允許，你不可以使用這部機器。","without sb’s permission＝without sb’s consent / agreement 未經某人的同意","n.","permission","You are not allowed to use the machine without my permission.","原書例句"],["volume","音量；量；冊","The ______ of traffic reaches its peak during rush hour.","交通流量在尖峰時間達到最高峰。","turn the volume up / down 把音量開大／關小；a large volume of + 不可數名詞＝a large amount of + 不可數名詞","n.","volume","The volume of traffic reaches its peak during rush hour.","原書例句"],["represent","代表；象徵","George ______ his company at the press conference.","喬治代表他的公司出席記者會。","representation n. 代表；symbolize vt. 象徵；represent sth＝stand for sth 代表某物；be a representation of sth 代表某物","vt.","represented","George represented his company at the press conference.","原書例句"],["representative","代表性的；代表者","The dove is ______ of peace.","鴿子代表和平。","be representative of...＝be a representation of... 代表……","a. & n.","representative","The dove is representative of peace.","原書例句"],["attitude","態度","Tony has a positive ______ towards life.","東尼對人生持積極的態度。","an attitude to / toward(s) sth 對某事的態度","n.","attitude","Tony has a positive attitude towards life.","原書例句"],["reduce","減少；降低","Despite Andy’s pay cut, he won’t ______ his standard of living.","儘管安迪被減薪，他也不願降低生活水準。","reduce sb to + V-ing 使某人淪落到……；reduction n. 減少；decrease vt. & vi. 減少；increase vt. & vi. 增加；bankruptcy n. 破產；bankrupt a. 破產的","vt.","reduce","Despite Andy’s pay cut, he won’t reduce his standard of living.","原書例句"],["fake","假的；假貨；偽造；假裝","Brian was caught using ______ money.","布萊恩被抓到使用假鈔。","genuine a. 真正的","a. & n. & vt.","fake","Brian was caught using fake money.","原書例句"],["religious","宗教的；虔誠的","The rational scientist is very ______.","這位理性的科學家非常虔誠。","religion n. 宗教；a religious belief 宗教信仰；different religious beliefs 不同的宗教信仰","a.","religious","The rational scientist is very religious.","原書例句"],["strength","力量；優點","Operating this machine requires skill more than physical ______.","操作這臺機器需要的技巧比蠻力還多。","strong a. 強壯的；strengthen vt. & vi. 加強","n.","strength","Operating this machine requires skill more than physical strength.","原書例句"],["weakness","虛弱；弱點","You’re not suitable for the job because of your physical ______.","你因為身體虛弱而不適合這份工作。","weak a. 虛弱的；weaken vt. & vi. 使變弱；forte n. 專長；優點：advantage / strong point / strength / forte；缺點：disadvantage / weak point / weakness / shortcoming","n.","weakness","You’re not suitable for the job because of your physical weakness.","原書例句"],["vary","使有變化；變化","The weather here ______ between cool and very hot.","這裡的天氣在涼爽和非常炎熱之間變化。","vary in... 在……方面不同；differ vi. 不同；change vt. & vi. 變化；改變；bore vt. 使厭煩","vt. & vi.","varies","The weather here varies between cool and very hot.","原書例句"],["various","各式各樣的","There have been ______ solutions to this problem.","這個問題有各式各樣的解決方法。","variation n. 變化；variable a. 易變的；invariably adv. 不變地；總是","a.","various","There have been various solutions to this problem.","原書例句"],["variety","多樣性；種類","Peter is a workaholic; his life lacks ______.","彼得是個工作狂；他的生活缺乏變化。","a variety of... 各式各樣的……；workaholic n. 工作狂","n.","variety","Peter is a workaholic; his life lacks variety.","原書例句"],["product","產品；產物","The country’s main ______ is timber.","這個國家的主要產品是木材。","produce n. 農產品 & vt. 生產；出版；producer n. 生產者；製片人；productivity n. 生產力；by-product n. 副產品；timber n. 木材＝lumber n. 木材","n.","product","The country’s main product is timber.","原書例句"],["imagination","想像力","Use your ______ and see if you can come up with a better idea.","發揮你的想像力，看看你能不能想出更好的辦法。","image n. 形象；意象；imagine vt. 想像；imaginative a. 富想像力的；imaginary a. 想像的；虛構的；imaginable a. 可想像的","n.","imagination","Use your imagination and see if you can come up with a better idea.","原書例句"],["prevent","阻止；預防；避免","Robert’s sore legs ______ him from joining the marathon.","羅伯特腿部痠痛，使他無法參加馬拉松。","prevent sb / sth from + N / V-ing / being p.p. 阻止某人／某物……；prevention n. 預防；preventive a. 預防的；avoid vt. 避免；stop vt. 阻止","vt.","prevented","Robert’s sore legs prevented him from joining the marathon.","原書例句"],["response","回應；回答；反應","Has there been any ______ to your letter?","你的信有回音了嗎？","in response to... 對……做出回應；respond vi. 回答／回應／反應（與 to 並用）；responsive a. 反應的；feedback n. 回饋；reply n. & vi. 回答","n.","response","Has there been any response to your letter?","原書例句"],["responsibility","責任","You should take ______ for what you’ve done.","你應該對自己做過的事負責。","take responsibility for + N / V-ing 對……負責；responsible a. 負責的（與 for 並用）；irresponsible a. 不負責任的","n.","responsibility","You should take responsibility for what you’ve done.","原書例句"],["perform","執行；履行；表演；表現","The surgeon has ______ this operation before.","這位外科醫生以前做過這種手術。","performer n. 表演者；perform an operation 施行手術；perform a mission 執行任務；perform one’s duties 履行某人的義務；zest n. 熱忱","vt. & vi.","performed","The surgeon has performed this operation before.","原書例句"],["performance","表演；表現；成績","The famous actress gave a great ______ in the play last night.","這位知名女演員昨晚在戲劇中有精彩的演出。","academic performance 學業表現","n.","performance","The famous actress gave a great performance in the play last night.","原書例句"],["technique","技巧；技術","The artist was highly acclaimed for his painting ______.","這位藝術家的繪畫技巧備受讚揚。","method n. 方法；acclaim vt. 稱讚＝praise vt. 稱讚","n.","techniques","The artist was highly acclaimed for his painting techniques.","原書例句"],["technical","技術的；專門的","Frank studied auto repair at a ______ school.","法蘭克在一所技術學校學汽車修護。","technical term 專門術語","a.","technical","Frank studied auto repair at a technical school.","原書例句"],["normal","正常的","It’s ______ to feel nervous before a test.","考前會感到緊張是正常的。","abnormal a. 不正常的；不規則的","a.","normal","It’s normal to feel nervous before a test.","原書例句"],["committee","委員會","How many members are there on your ______?","你的委員會有多少人？","committee 作集合名詞","n.","committee","How many members are there on your committee?","原書例句"],["achieve","達成；完成","If you work hard, you will eventually ______ your goals.","如果你努力，最後就會達成你的目標。","accomplish vt. 完成；attain vt. & vi. 達到；獲得；obtain vt. 獲得","vt.","achieve","If you work hard, you will eventually achieve your goals.","原書例句"],["achievement","成就","The ______ of computer technology have been incredible.","電腦科技的成就令人難以置信。","accomplishment n. 成就","n.","achievements","The achievements of computer technology have been incredible.","原書例句"],["immediate","立刻的；最接近的；直接的","There was an ______ response to Mary’s request.","瑪麗的要求立刻得到回應。","immediate heir 直系繼承人；heir n. 繼承人","a.","immediate","There was an immediate response to Mary’s request.","原書例句"],["immediately","立刻","I went over ______ after I finished writing the letter.","我寫完信後立刻過去了。","shortly after...＝instantly after... ……後不久；instantly adv. 立刻；shortly / right away / at once 立刻","adv.","immediately","I went over immediately after I finished writing the letter.","原書例句"],["magical","魔術的；神奇的","No medicine is so ______ that it can cure all illnesses.","沒有任何藥物神奇到能治好所有疾病。","magically adv. 神奇地；magic n. 魔術；魔法","a.","magical","No medicine is so magical that it can cure all illnesses.","原書例句"],["magician","魔術師","The ______ took out a rabbit from his hat.","魔術師從帽子裡拿出一隻兔子。","wizard n. 男巫；witch n. 女巫","n.","magician","The magician took out a rabbit from his hat.","原書例句"],["expectation","期待；期望","If you lower your ______, you’ll never be disappointed.","假使你不多作期待，就永遠不會失望。","meet sb’s expectations＝live up to sb’s expectations＝measure up to sb’s expectations 達到某人的期望；expect vt. 期待；預期","n.","expectations","If you lower your expectations, you’ll never be disappointed.","原書例句"],["ongoing","前進的；不斷發展中的","There is an ______ crisis because that infectious disease is spreading quickly.","由於那種傳染病迅速蔓延，因此危機仍持續發展中。","ongoing crisis 持續中的危機；ongoing case 進行中的案件","a.","ongoing","There is an ongoing crisis because that infectious disease is spreading quickly.","原書例句"],["underlying","在下面的；隱含的；根本的","The company drilled into the ground to get to the ______ reservoir of oil.","這家公司鑽入地下以取得下方儲油層中的石油。","underlying reservoir 地下的儲油層；underlying meaning 隱含的意義；underlying causes 根本原因；drill vi. & vt. 鑽；reservoir n. 儲油槽；水庫","a.","underlying","The company drilled into the ground to get to the underlying reservoir of oil.","原書例句"],["semester","學期（分春季班和秋季班）","I’m going to take 13 credits this ______.","我這學期要修 13 個學分。","the spring / fall semester 春／秋季班；term n. 學期","n.","semester","I’m going to take 13 credits this semester.","原書例句"],["pepper","胡椒（不可數）；甜椒（可數）","Please pass me the salt and ______.","請把鹽和胡椒遞給我。","a red pepper 紅椒；a green pepper 青椒","n.","pepper","Please pass me the salt and pepper.","原書例句"],["colorful","富有色彩的；生動的","The artist’s paintings are very ______.","這位藝術家的畫作色彩非常豐富。","vivid a. 生動的；animated a. 生動的；graphic a. 生動的","a.","colorful","The artist’s paintings are very colorful.","原書例句"],["fearful","害怕的","John was ______ of losing his job.","約翰害怕丟掉工作。","be fearful of... 害怕……＝be afraid of...；fear n. 害怕","a.","fearful","John was fearful of losing his job.","原書例句"],["hateful","可恨的；充滿憎恨的","Tom has been a ______ man ever since the accident.","自從那場意外後，湯姆就成了個充滿恨意的人。","hate vt. 憎恨；hatred n. 憎恨","a.","hateful","Tom has been a hateful man ever since the accident.","原書例句"],["hopeful","有希望的；抱有希望的","After watching the film, everyone feels ______ about the future.","看完這部電影後，每個人對未來都充滿希望。","feel hopeful about... 對……抱有希望；hopefully adv. 希望地／但願；optimistic a. 樂觀的；hopeless a. 不抱希望的；絕望的","a.","hopeful","After watching the film, everyone feels hopeful about the future.","原書例句"],["playful","愛玩的；好玩的","Healthy puppies and kittens are very ______ animals.","健康的小狗和小貓是很愛玩的動物。","play n. & v. 玩耍","a.","playful","Healthy puppies and kittens are very playful animals.","原書例句"],["skillful","熟練的；高明的","They are ______ at this game.","他們很擅長這個遊戲。","skillfully adv. 熟練地；unskillful a. 技術不好的","a.","skillful","They are skillful at this game.","原書例句"],["skinny","皮包骨的","Rosie is very ______ because she is an incredibly picky eater.","蘿西非常瘦，因為她挑食得很厲害。","bony a. 骨瘦如柴的；（魚）多刺的；thin a. 瘦的；slim a. 苗條的；微小的","a.","skinny","Rosie is very skinny because she is an incredibly picky eater.","原書例句"],["slender","苗條的；細長的","To have a ______ figure, the fashion model went on a strict diet.","為了擁有苗條的身材，這名模特兒嚴格節食。","slender figure 苗條的身材","a.","slender","To have a slender figure, the fashion model went on a strict diet.","原書例句"],["downtown","市中心的；在市區；往市區","The bank opened a new ______ branch last month.","該銀行上個月開了一家新的市中心分行。","作副詞時前面不加介詞：go downtown；head downtown","a. & adv.","downtown","The bank opened a new downtown branch last month.","原書例句"]],"U03":[["react","反應（與介詞 to 並用）","Ted ______ calmly to the plaintiff’s accusation.","泰德對原告的指控反應冷靜。","react to sth 對某事物有反應","vi.","reacted","Ted reacted calmly to the plaintiff’s accusation.","原書例句"],["reaction","反應（與介詞 to 並用）","What’s Tom’s ______ to my proposal?","湯姆對我的提議有什麼表示？","reaction to... 對……的反應","n.","reaction","What’s Tom’s reaction to my proposal?","原書例句"],["fund","基金；資金（複數）／提供資金","We contributed to the charity ______.","我們捐款給這個慈善基金。","raise funds for... 為……籌募資金；fundraiser n. 籌款人；募款機構；募款活動（如餐會）","n. & vt.","fund","We contributed to the charity fund.","原書例句"],["audience","觀眾（集合名詞，通常不加 s，後接複數動詞）","Because of the rain, the ______ at the concert was small.","由於下雨的緣故，那場音樂會的觀眾很少。","an audience of 5,000 / 10,000；a large / small audience；spectator n. 觀眾（可數名詞，複數需加 s）","n.","audience","Because of the rain, the audience at the concert was small.","原書例句"],["moral","教導明辨是非的；道德的／寓意","The film has a good ______ lesson.","這部影片有個很好的教訓，要我們明辨是非。","morality n. 道德；正義；ethical a. 道德的","a. & n.","moral","The film has a good moral lesson.","原書例句"],["immoral","不道德的","Taking advantage of other people’s misfortune for one’s own gain is ______.","把自己的利益建築在別人的不幸上是不道德的。","wicked a. 邪惡的；misfortune n. 不幸","a.","immoral","Taking advantage of other people’s misfortune for one’s own gain is immoral.","原書例句"],["announce","公布；宣布","John will ______ who will play the characters in the play.","約翰會公布該戲劇中的角色由哪些人擔綱。","declare vt. 宣告；proclaim vt. 聲明；表明","vt.","announce","John will announce who will play the characters in the play.","原書例句"],["announcement","公告；宣布","The ______ of the name of the winner will be made at three o’clock.","這次得獎人的名單將於 3 點鐘公布。","make an announcement that... = announce that... 宣告……","n.","announcement","The announcement of the name of the winner will be made at three o’clock.","原書例句"],["theory","學說；理論","Many scientists believe the ______ that the universe is getting larger.","很多科學家相信宇宙正在變大的這個說法。","in theory 理論上；theoretical a. 理論的；in practice 實際上","n.","theory","Many scientists believe the theory that the universe is getting larger.","原書例句"],["skate","溜冰鞋／溜冰","I’ve worn out these ______. I want to buy a new pair.","這雙溜冰鞋我穿壞了，我要買一雙新的。","go skating 去溜冰","n. & vi.","skates","I’ve worn out these skates. I want to buy a new pair.","原書例句"],["ski","滑雪板／滑雪","That store specializes in imported ______.","那家店專賣進口的滑雪板。","ski, skied, skied；go skiing 去滑雪","n. & vi.","skis","That store specializes in imported skis.","原書例句"],["structure","結構；建築物","The ______ of the poem is very complicated.","這首詩的結構很複雜。","structural a. 結構的；framework n. 架構","n.","structure","The structure of the poem is very complicated.","原書例句"],["staff","（全體）職員（集合名詞，不可數）／為……配備人員（一般用被動）","Our company has a ______ of 500, working in both Canada and Taiwan.","我們公司有 500 名員工，分別在加拿大與臺灣工作。","a staff of 20 / 500；20 / 500 staff members；be staffed with... 配備（有）……人員","n. & vt.","staff","Our company has a staff of 500, working in both Canada and Taiwan.","原書例句"],["crew","（船上或飛機上的）全體工作人員（集合名詞，不可數）","We have a ______ of twenty on our ship.","我們船上共有 20 位工作人員。","a crew of 50；50 位工作人員","n.","crew","We have a crew of twenty on our ship.","原書例句"],["suffer","遭受／受苦","That company ______ a big loss because of poor management.","那家公司由於管理不善蒙受重大損失。","suffer from... 飽受（疾病）之苦，罹患（疾病）","vt. & vi.","suffered","That company suffered a big loss because of poor management.","原書例句"],["spite","怨恨；恨意；儘管（用於下列片語中）","Jason vandalized those cars out of ______.","傑森因怨恨而任意破壞那些車子。","in spite of... 儘管……（之後須接名詞或動名詞作受詞）= despite... = notwithstanding...","n.","spite","Jason vandalized those cars out of spite.","原書例句"],["lifestyle","生活方式","The topic of the magazine this month is living a healthy ______.","這本雜誌這個月的主題談的是如何過健康的生活方式。","—","n.","lifestyle","The topic of the magazine this month is living a healthy lifestyle.","原書例句"],["somehow","不知怎麼的；設法","My blind date was beautiful, but ______ I didn’t find her attractive.","我相親的對象蠻美的，不過不知怎地我發現她並不吸引我。","somewhat adv. 稍微；有幾分","adv.","somehow","My blind date was beautiful, but somehow I didn’t find her attractive.","原書例句"],["somewhat","稍微；有幾分","John is ______ lazy, which is why I don’t like him.","約翰有點懶，這就是為什麼我不喜歡他的原因。","使用 somewhat 時，該字常置於形容詞與副詞之間，修飾該形容詞或副詞。","adv.","somewhat","John is somewhat lazy, which is why I don’t like him.","原書例句"],["original","原來的；原創的／原著；原文","The ______ plan was later changed.","最初的計畫後來有所更動。","origin n. 起源；出身；originality n. 創意（不可數）；originate vi. 源自；initial a. 最初的；innovative a. 創新的","a.","original","The original plan was later changed.","原書例句"],["originally","原本；最初地（起先）","We’re ______ from Texas.","我們原籍是德州。","in the beginning 起先；eventually adv. 最後","adv.","originally","We’re originally from Texas.","原書例句"],["additional","額外的；另加的","So many children came to the party that ______ tables and chairs were required.","參加派對的孩子真多，以致於需要備用的桌椅。","an additional + 數字 = an extra + 數字；add vt. & vi. 增加；addition n. 增加","a.","additional","So many children came to the party that additional tables and chairs were required.","原書例句"],["additionally","除此之外","The rent is cheap. ______, the location is perfect.","除了房租便宜之外，地點更是棒得沒話講。","in addition / on top of sth；besides adv. 此外；furthermore adv. 而且；moreover adv. 而且","adv.","Additionally","The rent is cheap. Additionally, the location is perfect.","原書例句"],["advantage","優勢；優點；便利；益處","Bill’s superior strength gave him an ______ over his opponents.","比爾的力氣比對手大多了，因此使他占了上風。","take advantage of sb 占某人的便宜；take advantage of sth (to + V) 利用某物（以……）；disadvantage n. 缺點","n.","advantage","Bill’s superior strength gave him an advantage over his opponents.","原書例句"],["specific","特定的；特有的（與介詞 to 並用）；明確的","The man went there for a ______ purpose.","那名男子到那兒去是有特定的目的。","be specific to + 地方；be specific about...；specify vt. 具體指出；particular a. 特定的；accurate a. 精確的；general a. 一般的；籠統的","a.","specific","The man went there for a specific purpose.","原書例句"],["specifically","尤其；特別地","The doctor warned Mark ______ not to eat eggs.","醫生特別警告馬克不要吃蛋。","specially adv. 特別地；particularly adv. 特別地","adv.","specifically","The doctor warned Mark specifically not to eat eggs.","原書例句"],["destroy","毀壞；破壞","The typhoon ______ the whole area.","颱風把這一帶全部摧毀了。","destruction n. 破壞；destructive a. 有破壞力的；damage n. & vt. 破壞；ruin vt. 破壞；restore vt. 重建","vt.","destroyed","The typhoon destroyed the whole area.","原書例句"],["column","圓柱；專欄","The wooden ______ are severely decayed as a result of exposure to the elements.","由於受到風吹雨淋的關係，這些木製的柱子已經嚴重腐朽了。","columnist n. 專欄作家","n.","columns","The wooden columns are severely decayed as a result of exposure to the elements.","原書例句"],["mission","任務","Rumor has it that Michael is on a secret ______ in Syria.","謠傳麥可正在敘利亞執行一項祕密任務。","be on a mission 執行任務；missionary n. 傳教士","n.","mission","Rumor has it that Michael is on a secret mission in Syria.","原書例句"],["reveal","透露；揭露","The agent was jailed for ______ secrets to the enemy.","該名探員因洩密給敵方而入獄。","revelation n. 揭示；透露；conceal vt. 隱瞞","vt.","revealing","The agent was jailed for revealing secrets to the enemy.","原書例句"],["tropical","熱帶的","I have a liking for ______ fruits such as bananas and pineapples.","我很喜歡香蕉和鳳梨這類的熱帶水果。","the tropical zone 熱帶地區；subtropical a. 亞熱帶的；the subtropical zone 亞熱帶地區；the temperate zone 溫帶地區；the frigid zone 寒帶地區；frigid a. 嚴寒的","a.","tropical","I have a liking for tropical fruits such as bananas and pineapples.","原書例句"],["agriculture","農業","We are developing new technology to improve our ______.","我們正在研發新科技來改善農業。","agricultural a. 農業的；farming n. 農業","n.","agriculture","We are developing new technology to improve our agriculture.","原書例句"],["drag","拖曳／（空氣）阻力","Don’t ______ the chair around! It will leave marks on the wooden floor.","不要拖著椅子到處走，這樣會在木質地板上留下刮痕。","pull vt. 拉；tow vt. 拉，拖；haul vt. 拉，拖","vt.","drag","Don’t drag the chair around! It will leave marks on the wooden floor.","原書例句"],["drugstore","藥妝店","The ______ is open 24 hours a day.","這家藥妝店全天候營業。","drug n. 藥物；毒品","n.","drugstore","The drugstore is open 24 hours a day.","原書例句"],["cough","咳嗽","Cover your mouth when you ______.","咳嗽時要用手摀著嘴。","have a cough 咳嗽；have a runny nose 流鼻水（不可寫成 have a running nose）","vi. & n.","cough","Cover your mouth when you cough.","原書例句"],["dizzy","暈眩的","After three glasses of beer, I felt slightly ______.","喝了 3 杯啤酒後，我感覺有一點暈眩。","—","a.","dizzy","After three glasses of beer, I felt slightly dizzy.","原書例句"],["tasty","好吃的","My mother makes very ______ cakes.","我媽媽做的蛋糕很好吃。","taste n. 味道 & vt. 品嚐 & vi. 嚐起來；delicious a. 好吃的；yummy a. 好吃的（口語）","a.","tasty","My mother makes very tasty cakes.","原書例句"],["weapon","武器","The police found a large number of ______ in the deserted warehouse.","警方在廢置的倉庫裡查獲大批武器。","a nuclear weapon 核武；a lethal / deadly weapon 致命武器；lethal a. 致命的","n.","weapons","The police found a large number of weapons in the deserted warehouse.","原書例句"],["anxious","焦慮的；渴望的","Today, more than ever, college students are ______ about their future.","今日，更甚於以往，大學生對前途感到焦慮不安。","be anxious about... 對……感到焦慮 = be worried about...；be anxious to + V / be eager to + V 渴望……；anxiously adv. 焦急地；anxiety n. 焦慮；worried a. 擔心的；apprehensive a. 憂慮的；longing a. 渴望的；eager a. 渴望的","a.","anxious","Today, more than ever, college students are anxious about their future.","原書例句"],["flash","閃光／（使）閃光","The ______ of lightning scared those birds away.","那道閃電的閃光把那群鳥嚇走了。","blaze vi. 閃耀；燃燒 & n. 大火；flesh n.（人或動物的）肉","n. & vt. & vi.","flash","The flash of lightning scared those birds away.","原書例句"],["flashlight","手電筒","The ______ doesn’t work when the batteries are dead.","電池沒電時，手電筒就不亮了。","torch n. 火把；lantern n. 燈籠","n.","flashlight","The flashlight doesn’t work when the batteries are dead.","原書例句"],["naked","赤裸的","At some beaches in Spain, you can swim ______.","在西班牙若干海灘，你可以裸泳。","to the naked eye 對肉眼而言；nude a. 裸的；bare a. 裸的","a.","naked","At some beaches in Spain, you can swim naked.","原書例句"],["sink","（廚房內的）水槽／沉","Put the dishes in the ______, and I’ll wash them later.","把碗盤放在水槽裡，我等會兒去洗。","sink, sank, sunk；float vi. 浮","n. & vi.","sink","Put the dishes in the sink, and I’ll wash them later.","原書例句"],["passenger","乘客","Several ______ were injured during the bumpy flight.","好幾名乘客在顛簸的飛行途中受傷了。","a passenger plane 客機；rider n. 乘坐者","n.","passengers","Several passengers were injured during the bumpy flight.","原書例句"],["lock","鎖／鎖好","Turn the key in the ______ to make sure it is secure.","把鑰匙插到鎖裡轉一下，確定上鎖了。","lockable a. 可鎖起來的；locker n. 衣物櫃；unlock vt. 開鎖；secure a. 牢固的","n. & vt.","lock","Turn the key in the lock to make sure it is secure.","原書例句"],["juicy","多汁的","The apples are big and ______ at this time of the year.","每年這個時候蘋果總是又大又多汁。","juice n. 果汁","a.","juicy","The apples are big and juicy at this time of the year.","原書例句"],["neat","整齊的；整潔的","Judy’s handwriting is very ______.","茱蒂的筆跡非常整齊。","neat and tidy 乾淨整潔的；tidy a. 整潔的 & vt. & vi. 整理；sloppy a. 邋遢的；untidy a. 凌亂的","a.","neat","Judy’s handwriting is very neat.","原書例句"]],"U04":[["pretend","假裝","Mary has broken up with John, but he ______ that nothing has happened.","瑪莉和約翰分手了，但約翰假裝什麼事都沒發生。","pretend + that... 假裝……；make believe + that...；pretend to + V 假裝要……","vt.","pretends","Mary has broken up with John, but he pretends that nothing has happened.","原書例句"],["frequent","經常的；經常造訪","Nick is a ______ visitor to our house.","尼克是我們家的常客。","frequency n. 頻率；constant a. 持續的；continual a. 頻頻的；celebrity n. 名人","a. & vt.","frequent","Nick is a frequent visitor to our house.","原書例句"],["connect","連結；關聯","The railway ______ Paris and Nice.","這條鐵路連接巴黎和尼斯。","connect A with B 將A與B聯繫在一起；associate A with B；connect A to B 將A與B連結；connection n. 關係；關聯","vt. & vi.","connects","The railway connects Paris and Nice.","原書例句"],["occasion","特殊的大事；場合（與介詞 on 並用）","This wedding is a great ______.","這場婚禮是一件大事。","on occasion 偶爾 = occasionally；occasional a. 偶爾的；occasionally adv. 偶爾；event n. 事件","n.","occasion","This wedding is a great occasion.","原書例句"],["faith","信心；信任","I have ______ in your honesty.","我信任你的誠實。","have faith in... 對……有信心 = have trust in... = have belief in...；faithful a. 忠實的；守信的；assurance n. 信心；保證；belief n. 相信；trust n. 相信","n.","faith","I have faith in your honesty.","原書例句"],["experiment","實驗；試驗","This product is the result of long ______.","這個產品是長期實驗的結果。","conduct / perform / carry out / do an experiment 做實驗；experiment on sth 對某物做實驗；experiment with sth 用某物做實驗；experimental a. 實驗性的；experimentation n. 實驗（不可數）","n. & vi.","experiments","This product is the result of long experiments.","原書例句"],["aware","知道的；察覺的（與介詞 of 並用）","You should always be ______ of your surroundings.","你應時時了解周遭的環境。","be aware of... 知道……；察覺到…… = be conscious of...；conscious a. 察覺到的；有知覺的；unaware a. 未察覺到的","a.","aware","You should always be aware of your surroundings.","原書例句"],["awareness","意識；察覺","The government is trying to raise public ______ about environmental protection.","政府正設法提高民眾的環保意識。","raise awareness of / about... 喚起關於……的意識；environmental / protection / political / social awareness 環保／政治／社會意識；consciousness n. 知覺；意識","n.","awareness","The government is trying to raise public awareness about environmental protection.","原書例句"],["security","安全","Many workers see the policy as a major threat to their job ______.","許多員工都認為這項政策是他們工作保障的一大威脅。","secure a. 安全的；safety n. 安全","n.","security","Many workers see the policy as a major threat to their job security.","原書例句"],["considerable","相當大的","The rice crop suffered ______ damage as a result of the typhoon.","由於這場颱風，稻米作物遭受相當大的損失。","consider vt. & vi. 考慮；考慮；considerate a. 體貼的；consideration n. 考慮","a.","considerable","The rice crop suffered considerable damage as a result of the typhoon.","原書例句"],["replace","取代","I’m considering ______ my old PC with a notebook.","我正考慮把舊的個人電腦換成一臺新的筆記型電腦。","replace A with B 以B取代A，把A換成B；replaceable a. 可取代的；substitute vt. 取代 & n. 代替者","vt.","replacing","I’m considering replacing my old PC with a notebook.","原書例句"],["replacement","替代人選；替代品","We need a ______ for the waiter, who left last week.","我們需要一個人來接替上週離職的服務生。","","n.","replacement","We need a replacement for the waiter, who left last week.","原書例句"],["conclusion","結束；結論","Mr. Williams thanked his audience at the ______ of his speech.","威廉斯先生在演講結束時向聽眾表示謝意。","come to a/the conclusion 得到結論 = reach a/the conclusion；In conclusion,... 總之，…… = To sum up,...；conclude vi. & vt. 作結論；結束；斷定","n.","conclusion","Mr. Williams thanked his audience at the conclusion of his speech.","原書例句"],["collection","蒐集物","Bill showed us a very fine ______ of old coins.","比爾向我們展示了非常珍貴的古錢收藏。","a collection of... ……的收藏；a large collection of... ……的大量收藏；collect vt. 蒐集（郵票等）& vi. 集合；collective a. 共同的；集體的 & n. 企業集團；collector n. 收藏家；收稅員","n.","collection","Bill showed us a very fine collection of old coins.","原書例句"],["inform","通知；告知","Please ______ us of any change of schedule.","若排程表有任何更動請通知我們。","inform sb of sth 通知某人某事 = notify sb of sth；keep sb informed of / about sth 將某事隨時通知某人；informative a. 有內容的；能增進知識的","vt.","inform","Please inform us of any change of schedule.","原書例句"],["information","消息；資料","Thank you for giving us all the ______ we need.","謝謝你提供我們一切想要的資訊。","不可數；有時縮寫成 info；mine n. 礦山（此處指寶庫）","n.","information","Thank you for giving us all the information we need.","原書例句"],["elect","選舉 & 當選的（與名詞並用，形成複合字）","We ______ John (as) our class leader.","我們推選約翰擔任本班班長。","elect sb + (as) + 職位 選舉某人擔任某職位；select vt. 挑選 & a. 精選的","vt. & a.","elected","We elected John (as) our class leader.","原書例句"],["election","選舉","The ______ results will be broadcast tomorrow morning.","這次的選舉結果將於明天早上廣播。","","n.","election","The election results will be broadcast tomorrow morning.","原書例句"],["elective","選舉的 & 選修","The mayor is an ______ official.","市長是經由選舉產生的官員。","option n. 選修科目","a. & n.","elective","The mayor is an elective official.","原書例句"],["signal","號誌；信號 & 發出信號","You must obey the traffic ______.","你必須遵守交通號誌。","signal sb to + V 向某人打手勢，要某人……；sign n. sign / sign language；signature n. 簽訂；簽名","n. & vt.","signals","You must obey the traffic signals.","原書例句"],["gesture","手勢；表示 & 做手勢","The foreigner used ______ to convey his idea.","這名外國人使用手勢傳達他的意思。","make a... gesture 做出……的手勢；in a gesture of... 表示……","n. & vi.","gestures","The foreigner used gestures to convey his idea.","原書例句"],["civil","國內的；公民的；文明的；有禮的","The incident led to a ______ war that lasted twenty years.","這個事件導致了一場持續20年之久的內戰。","a civil war 內戰；civil rights 公民的權利（恆用複數）；civilize vt. 教化；使開化；civilized a. 文明的；開化的；civilization n. 文明（不可數）；civilian a. 平民的 & n. 平民","a.","civil","The incident led to a civil war that lasted twenty years.","原書例句"],["scary","可怕的","The ______ scene of the accident shocked all of us.","這起意外的可怕景象讓我們大家都感震驚。","scare vt. 嚇 & n. 驚嚇；scared a. 感到害怕的 = afraid a. 害怕的","a.","scary","The scary scene of the accident shocked all of us.","原書例句"],["edit","編輯","Tom ______ the manuscripts for publication.","湯姆編輯這些手稿準備出版。","edit sth for publication 編輯某物以供出版","vt.","edited","Tom edited the manuscripts for publication.","原書例句"],["editor","編者；編輯","Bill is the ______-in-chief of that magazine.","比爾是那本雜誌的總編輯。","edition n. 版本；editorial n.（報紙的）社論 & a. 編輯上的；editor-in-chief 總編輯","n.","editor","Bill is the editor-in-chief of that magazine.","原書例句"],["governor","州長；省長","The ______ of the state is said to have been involved in the scandal.","據傳該州州長涉及此一醜聞。","govern vt. 統治；控制；government n. 政府","n.","governor","The governor of the state is said to have been involved in the scandal.","原書例句"],["expressive","表示的；善於表達的","A baby’s cry can be ______ of hunger.","嬰兒哭鬧可能表示他／她餓了。","be expressive of... 表示……；express vt. 表達（思想、感情等）& n. 快車；快遞 & a. 快速的；快速的 & adv. 用快遞寄送地；expression n. 表達；表情；用語","a.","expressive","A baby’s cry can be expressive of hunger.","原書例句"],["familiar","熟悉的","Are you ______ with my boss?","你和我老闆熟嗎？","be familiar with... 熟悉……；be familiar to sb 對某人而言是熟悉的；family n. 家庭 & a. 家庭的；familiarity n. 熟悉；熟悉；unfamiliar a. 不熟悉的；生疏的","a.","familiar","Are you familiar with my boss?","原書例句"],["sexy","性感的","Latin dances often involve ______ movements.","拉丁舞經常會出現性感的舞步。","sex n. 性別；性","a.","sexy","Latin dances often involve sexy movements.","原書例句"],["sexual","性的；性別的","Parents and school teachers should teach kids how to deal with ______ harassment.","家長和學校老師應該教導孩童如何處理性騷擾。","sexual harassment 性騷擾；harassment n. 騷擾；sexual discrimination 性別歧視；discrimination n. 歧視","a.","sexual","Parents and school teachers should teach kids how to deal with sexual harassment.","原書例句"],["explore","探尋；探索；尋找","It is said that Columbus arrived here but did not ______ the area.","據說哥倫布到過這裡，但沒有探索這個地區。","explorer n. 探險家；exploration n. 探尋；search vt. & vi. 搜索；investigate vt. & vi. 調查","vt.","explore","It is said that Columbus arrived here but did not explore the area.","原書例句"],["coach","（運動）教練；長途巴士 & 指導","When did Tom become a baseball ______?","湯姆何時當起棒球教練的？","bus n. 巴士；公車；train vt. 訓練；instruct vt. 指導","n. & vt.","coach","When did Tom become a baseball coach?","原書例句"],["bowling","保齡球運動","I seldom go ______ because I think it’s a waste of time and money.","我很少去打保齡球，因為我認為這很浪費時間和金錢。","go bowling 打保齡球；a bowling ball 保齡球；a bowling alley 保齡球館；保齡球道；pin n. 保齡球瓶","n.","bowling","I seldom go bowling because I think it’s a waste of time and money.","原書例句"],["golf","高爾夫球運動 & 打高爾夫球","______ is very popular among businessmen.","高爾夫球運動在商人間非常流行。","go golfing 打高爾夫球；a golf course 高爾夫球場；a golf club 高爾夫球桿；高爾夫俱樂部；gulf n. 海灣；鴻溝","n. & vi.","Golf","Golf is very popular among businessmen.","原書例句"],["volleyball","排球","Helen was tired out after the ______ game.","海倫在排球比賽以後整個人累垮了。","play volleyball 打排球","n.","volleyball","Helen was tired out after the volleyball game.","原書例句"],["vocabulary","字彙（量）","John has a very large ______.","約翰懂很多單字。","","n.","vocabulary","John has a very large vocabulary.","原書例句"],["tend","傾向；易於（之後接不定詞片語）& 照顧","We ______ to take natural resources for granted nowadays.","現今，我們往往將自然資源視為理所當然。","tend to + V 容易……；往往會…… = be apt / inclined / prone to + V；tend sth 照顧某物 = take care of sth；tendency n. 傾向；tent n. 帳篷","vi. & vt.","tend","We tend to take natural resources for granted nowadays.","原書例句"],["scissors","剪刀（因有兩個刀片，故恆用複數）","Please hand me the ______ on the table.","請遞給我桌上的剪刀。","a pair of scissors 一把剪刀","n.","scissors","Please hand me the scissors on the table.","原書例句"],["overseas","海外的；國外的 & 在國外地","Our ______ division has been doing very well over the past three years.","過去三年來我們的海外部門一直都表現得很好。","an overseas student 僑生；an overseas Chinese 華僑；foreign a. 國外的","a. & adv.","overseas","Our overseas division has been doing very well over the past three years.","原書例句"],["peanut","花生；很小的金額（恆用複數）","Mom spread ______ butter on each slice of bread.","媽媽把花生醬塗在每片麵包上。","peanut butter 花生醬；stingy a. 小氣的","n.","peanut","Mom spread peanut butter on each slice of bread.","原書例句"],["kindergarten","幼兒園","We sent our child to ______ last September.","我們去年九月把小孩送到幼兒園就讀。","nursery n. 托兒所；托嬰中心；a day care center 日間托兒所","n.","kindergarten","We sent our child to kindergarten last September.","原書例句"],["oral","口語的","Our language teacher gave us an ______ test instead of a written one.","我們語言老師考我們口試而非筆試。","spoken a. 口語的；an oral test 口試；a written test 筆試","a.","oral","Our language teacher gave us an oral test instead of a written one.","原書例句"],["oven","烤箱","I used an ______ to bake the cakes.","我用烤箱烤蛋糕。","microwave n. 微波爐 & vt. 微波（= microwave oven）","n.","oven","I used an oven to bake the cakes.","原書例句"],["stove","爐子","The kettle is boiling on the gas ______.","瓦斯爐上的水壺燒開了。","","n.","stove","The kettle is boiling on the gas stove.","原書例句"],["shrimp","蝦子","The fishermen cast a net and caught a lot of big ______.","漁夫撒網捕了很多蝦子。","shrimp 或 shrimps 皆可；prawn n. 明蝦；lobster n. 龍蝦","n.","shrimp","The fishermen cast a net and caught a lot of big shrimp.","原書例句"]],"U05":[["previous","先前的","Do you have any ______ experience in this job?","你之前有沒有這種工作經驗？","early a. 早先的；former a. 以前的；subsequent a. 隨後的","a.","previous","Do you have any previous experience in this job?","原書例句"],["background","背景","Because of his ______, John got the job very easily.","由於他的背景，約翰很容易地就得到了那份工作。","a family background 家庭背景；background information 背景知識","n.","background","Because of his background, John got the job very easily.","原書例句"],["aside","一旁地","Please step ______. You’re blocking my view.","請站到旁邊。你擋住我的視線了。","step aside 站在一旁；put sth aside 將某物擱置一旁","adv.","aside","Please step aside. You’re blocking my view.","原書例句"],["apart","分開","Kathy and her husband decided to live ______ for a while.","凱西和她老公決定分居一段時間。","apart from... 除了……；aside from...；except for...；tell...apart 分辨出……的不同","adv.","apart","Kathy and her husband decided to live apart for a while.","原書例句"],["decade","10 年","The company has been in business for three ______.","這間公司已經營業 30 年了。","score n. 20（左右）；six decades ago = 60 年前；three score years ago = sixty years ago","n.","decades","The company has been in business for three decades.","原書例句"],["spill","溢出；潑灑；溢出物","I got mad when the careless waiter ______ coffee on my shirt.","粗心的服務生把咖啡灑在我襯衫上時，我便發火了。","spill, spilled/spilt, spilled/spilt","v. & n.","spilled","I got mad when the careless waiter spilled coffee on my shirt.","原書例句"],["fashionable","流行的；時髦的","Don’t concern yourself merely with what’s ______.","不要只關心現在流行什麼。","old-fashioned a. 舊式的；過時的","a.","fashionable","Don’t concern yourself merely with what’s fashionable.","原書例句"],["relief","（痛苦等）解除；減輕；救濟；救濟物資（集合名詞，不可數）","Doctors work for the ______ of their patients’ suffering.","醫生們致力解除病人們的痛苦。","a relief organization 救濟組織；relief materials 救濟物資；a lot of relief 許多救濟物資；a lot of relief materials","n.","relief","Doctors work for the relief of their patients’ suffering.","原書例句"],["solid","固體的；堅固的；固體","The water froze into a ______ block of ice.","水凝結成一塊冰塊。","consolidate vt. 鞏固；統一；solidarity n. 團結；gas n. 氣體；gasoline n. 汽油；liquid n. & a. 液體；液態的","a. & n.","solid","The water froze into a solid block of ice.","原書例句"],["democratic","民主的；（美）民主黨的（大寫）","The president was elected through a ______ process.","該總統是經由民主程序選出來的。","democrat n. 民主主義者；Democratic Party 民主黨；Republican Party 共和黨","a.","democratic","The president was elected through a democratic process.","原書例句"],["democracy","民主（不可數）；民主國家（可數）","That country has moved steadily toward true ______.","該國已穩定地邁向真正的民主。","tyranny n. 專制政府；暴政","n.","democracy","That country has moved steadily toward true democracy.","原書例句"],["neighborhood","鄰近地區","There is a big department store in my ______.","我家附近有一家大型百貨公司。","in sb’s neighborhood 在某人住處附近；near where sb lives；neighbor n. 鄰居；neighboring a. 鄰近的；area n. 地區","n.","neighborhood","There is a big department store in my neighborhood.","原書例句"],["tricky","狡猾的；微妙的；難以處理的","No one likes to deal with a ______ person.","沒有人喜歡跟狡猾的人打交道。","trick vt. 欺騙；cunning / sly / crafty a. 狡猾的；put sb on the spot 讓某人出糗／下不了臺","a.","tricky","No one likes to deal with a tricky person.","原書例句"],["significant","重要的；顯著的","Hard work plays a ______ role in achieving success.","努力在獲致成功方面扮演了重要的角色。","signify vt. 表示；significance n. 意義；重要性；insignificant a. 不重要的","a.","significant","Hard work plays a significant role in achieving success.","原書例句"],["scientist","科學家","The boy wants to be a ______ when he grows up.","這名小男孩長大後要當科學家。","science n. 科學","n.","scientist","The boy wants to be a scientist when he grows up.","原書例句"],["scientific","科學的；合乎科學的","Ben compiled a lot of ______ data.","班編輯了大量的科學資料。","science n. 科學；scientist n. 科學家","a.","scientific","Ben compiled a lot of scientific data.","原書例句"],["wage","工資（尤指時薪）；發動（活動、戰爭等）","The workers went on strike in protest against low ______.","工人發動罷工抗議工資低廉。","wage war on... 向……宣戰","n. & vt.","wages","The workers went on strike in protest against low wages.","原書例句"],["salary","（按月領取的）薪水","How can you live on such a small ______?","這麼微薄的薪水你如何賴以為生？","pay n. 薪資","n.","salary","How can you live on such a small salary?","原書例句"],["resource","資源（常用複數）","We must use natural ______ wisely—many of them cannot be replenished.","我們必須善用天然資源—它們有很多是無法再補足的。","natural resources 天然資源；source n. 來源；replenish vt. 補充","n.","resources","We must use natural resources wisely—many of them cannot be replenished.","原書例句"],["motor","馬達","The machine is powered by two electric ______.","這臺機器是由兩個電動馬達提供電力的。","motorcycle n. 摩托車","n.","motors","The machine is powered by two electric motors.","原書例句"],["engage","從事；忙於（與介詞 in 並用）","The two sides ______ in peace talks.","雙方從事和平談判。","engaged a. 已訂婚的；be engaged to sb 與某人訂婚；engage in + N/V-ing 從事某事","vi.","engaged","The two sides engaged in peace talks.","原書例句"],["engagement","訂婚；（先公務上的）預約；約會","The couple announced their ______ at the dinner party.","這對情人在這場晚宴上宣布他們已訂婚。","appointment n.（公務或正式的）約會","n.","engagement","The couple announced their engagement at the dinner party.","原書例句"],["capable","有能力的；做得出……的（與介詞 of 並用）","The firm was not ______ of handling such a large order.","那家公司沒有能力處理如此龐大的訂單。","be capable of + N/V-ing；be able to + V；capability n. 能力；capacity n. 容量；incapable a. 無能的","a.","capable","The firm was not capable of handling such a large order.","原書例句"],["enable","使能夠","Knowledge ______ one to solve one’s own problems.","知識使人有能力自行解決難題。","enable sb to + V；able a. 能夠的；unable a. 無法勝任的；ability n. 能力；inability n. 無能","vt.","enables","Knowledge enables one to solve one’s own problems.","原書例句"],["portion","部分；分配","A large ______ of the money will go to charity.","這筆錢大部分要捐給慈善機構。","a large portion of... 大部分的……；a small portion of... 少部分的……；portion sth out 分配某物","n. & vt.","portion","A large portion of the money will go to charity.","原書例句"],["passage","通道；一段（文字）；（時間）消逝","There was a dark ______ leading to a secret room.","有一條昏暗的通道通往一間密室。","—","n.","passage","There was a dark passage leading to a secret room.","原書例句"],["honor","名譽；榮譽；尊重；給予榮譽；實踐","Thomas Edison won ______ for inventing the light bulb.","湯瑪士・愛迪生因發明電燈泡而贏得殊榮。","on one’s honor；Your Honor；honor one’s promise = fulfill one’s promise；honorary a. 榮譽的；honorable a. 可敬的；respect n. & vt. 敬重；prestige n. 聲望","n. & vt.","honor","Thomas Edison won honor for inventing the light bulb.","原書例句"],["glory","光榮；榮耀","The castle reminds us of the past ______ of the kingdom.","這座城堡使我們想起該王國往日的榮耀。","glorify vt. 讚揚；glorious a. 光榮的","n.","glory","The castle reminds us of the past glory of the kingdom.","原書例句"],["appeal","吸引；請求；上訴（均與介詞 to 並用）","I’m sure this program will ______ to children of all ages.","我相信這個節目一定可以吸引各年齡層的小朋友。","appeal to sb；appeal to sb for sth；appeal to sb to + V；beg sb to + V；appealing a. 動人的；attract vt. 吸引；request n. & vt. 請求","vi. & n.","appeal","I’m sure this program will appeal to children of all ages.","原書例句"],["steep","陡峭的；急劇升降的","The hill was so ______ that it took us almost two hours to reach the top.","這座山丘很陡，我們花了將近兩小時才爬到山頂。","—","a.","steep","The hill was so steep that it took us almost two hours to reach the top.","原書例句"],["desert","拋棄；沙漠","People who ______ their pets on the street are really heartless.","把寵物丟棄在街上的人真的很無情。","abandon / desert vt. 拋棄；dessert n. 餐後甜點","vt. & n.","desert","People who desert their pets on the street are really heartless.","原書例句"],["detect","發現；查出","This dog ______ drugs in the man’s baggage.","這隻狗在該男子的行李中發現毒品。","detective n. 偵探；detection n. 偵查；detector n. 探測器","vt.","detected","This dog detected drugs in the man’s baggage.","原書例句"],["ambulance","救護車","Wait here. I’ll go and call an ______.","你在此等候，我去打電話叫救護車。","call an ambulance 叫救護車","n.","ambulance","Wait here. I’ll go and call an ambulance.","原書例句"],["confirm","確認；證實","I would like to ______ my dinner reservation.","我想要確認晚餐的訂位資料。","confirmation n. 證實；證明；verify vt. 確認；deny vt. 否認","vt.","confirm","I would like to confirm my dinner reservation.","原書例句"],["loser","失敗者","______ always find excuses for their failure.","失敗者永遠為自己的失敗找藉口。","lose vt. 失敗；失去；winner n. 勝者；得獎者","n.","Losers","Losers always find excuses for their failure.","原書例句"],["handkerchief","手帕","The old man blew his nose on a ______.","老先生用手帕擤鼻涕。","handkerchiefs（複數）","n.","handkerchief","The old man blew his nose on a handkerchief.","原書例句"],["napkin","餐巾","I need a ______ to wipe my mouth.","我需要一條餐巾來擦嘴。","towel n. 毛巾","n.","napkin","I need a napkin to wipe my mouth.","原書例句"],["frank","坦白的","To be ______, I don’t trust you.","坦白說，我不信任你。","To be frank,...；Frankly speaking,...；honest a. 誠實的","a.","frank","To be frank, I don’t trust you.","原書例句"],["elevator","電梯（= lift 英）","We took the ______ to the tenth floor.","我們搭電梯到 10 樓。","take an elevator 搭電梯；escalator n. 電扶梯","n.","elevator","We took the elevator to the tenth floor.","原書例句"],["shorten","使變短；縮短","I asked the tailor to ______ the sleeves of my shirt.","我要求裁縫師將我襯衫的袖子改短。","lengthen vt. 使變長；加長","vt.","shorten","I asked the tailor to shorten the sleeves of my shirt.","原書例句"],["talkative","多話的","Sara isn’t very ______, is she?","莎拉不多話，是不是？","talk vi. 談話","a.","talkative","Sara isn’t very talkative, is she?","原書例句"],["lover","情人；愛人（= sweetheart）","Ben and Naomi were friends for years before they became ______.","班跟奈歐蜜成為情侶前當了好幾年朋友。","a secret / underground lover 地下情人","n.","lovers","Ben and Naomi were friends for years before they became lovers.","原書例句"],["apologize","道歉；賠罪","I must ______ to you for not answering your letter immediately.","我必須為未立即回信給你而向你道歉。","apologize to sb for sth；sorry a. 抱歉的；難過的","vi.","apologize","I must apologize to you for not answering your letter immediately.","原書例句"],["clothe","使穿上衣服（通常用於被動語態）（= dress）","Since it was very cold outside, Teresa ______ / dressed her children in warm clothing before they went out.","因為外邊天氣冷，泰瑞莎讓小孩穿上保暖的衣物後才出門。","clothe sb in sth / be clothed in sth；closet n. 衣櫥；wardrobe n. 衣櫥；cupboard n. 櫥櫃；壁櫥","vt.","clothed","Since it was very cold outside, Teresa clothed / dressed her children in warm clothing before they went out.","原書例句"],["closet","衣櫥","Most of the clothes in my ______ are black.","我衣櫥裡大部分的衣服是黑色的。","wardrobe n. 衣櫥；cupboard n. 櫥櫃；壁櫥","n.","closet","Most of the clothes in my closet are black.","原書例句"]],"U06":[["murder","謀殺；殺害；謀殺","The man committed ______ and was sentenced to thirty years in prison.","這名男子犯了謀殺罪，被判處 30 年徒刑。","commit murder 犯謀殺罪；commit attempted murder 犯謀殺未遂罪；get away with murder 逍遙法外；murderer n. 殺人犯","vt. & n.","murder","The man committed murder and was sentenced to thirty years in prison.","原書例句"],["roast","烤；烘焙；烤肉","Mom ______ some lamb chops for dinner.","媽媽烤了一些羊排當晚餐。","roasted a. 烤過的；roast beef 烤牛肉；roast turkey 烤火雞","vt. & vi. & n.","roasted","Mom roasted some lamb chops for dinner.","原書例句"],["reasonable","合理的；講理的","I bought this piece of furniture at a ______ price.","我以合理的價格買了這件家具。","reason n. 理由；unreasonable a. 不合理的","a.","reasonable","I bought this piece of furniture at a reasonable price.","原書例句"],["missing","失蹤的；缺少的","The hiker was reported ______ three days ago and was found this morning.","這名健行者 3 天前被報失蹤，今天早上被找到。","miss vt. 想念；錯過","a.","missing","The hiker was reported missing three days ago and was found this morning.","原書例句"],["benefit","受益；有益於；利益","My trip to the US was a ______ of my job.","到美國旅遊是工作上的一項福利。","benefit from... 從……受益；beneficial a. 有益的；be beneficial to... 對……有益","vi. & n.","benefit","My trip to the US was a benefit of my job.","原書例句"],["profit","獲利；利益；利潤","Tom made a handsome ______ from the sale.","湯姆從這筆買賣中賺了可觀的利潤。","make a profit 獲利；profit from... 從……獲益；profitable a. 有利可圖的；nonprofit a. 非營利的","vi. & n.","profit","Tom made a handsome profit from the sale.","原書例句"],["muscle","肌肉","Regular exercise can help build strong ______.","規律運動可以幫助鍛鍊強健的肌肉。","muscular a. 肌肉發達的","n.","muscles","Regular exercise can help build strong ______.","練習新編句"],["flesh","（人或動物的）肉","Eating human ______ is considered barbarous.","吃人肉被視為野蠻的行為。","meat n. 肉；Eating human flesh is considered barbarous.","n.","flesh","Eating human flesh is considered barbarous.","原書例句"],["dust","灰塵；撣去灰塵","There is so much ______ on the table.","桌上有好多灰塵。","dusty a. 灰塵多的","n. & vt.","dust","There is so much dust on the table.","原書例句"],["dirt","灰塵；髒東西；泥土","I’m afraid your sneakers need to be washed because they’re covered with ______.","恐怕你的球鞋該洗了，因為上面沾滿了髒東西。","dirty a. 骯髒的","n.","dirt","I’m afraid your sneakers need to be washed because they’re covered with dirt.","原書例句"],["automobile","汽車","I can’t afford a brand-new ______, so I’m going to buy a used one.","我買不起全新的汽車，所以打算買一輛二手車。","car n. 汽車","n.","automobile","I can’t afford a brand-new automobile, so I’m going to buy a used one.","原書例句"],["vehicle","車輛；交通工具","The number of motor ______ on the roads rose by 30% last year.","去年道路上的機動車輛數量增加了 30%。","—","n.","vehicles","The number of motor vehicles on the roads rose by 30% last year.","原書例句"],["headquarters","總部（單複數同形）","Gangsters surrounded the police ______ last night.","昨晚歹徒包圍了警察總部。","branch n. 分公司；支店","n.","headquarters","Gangsters surrounded the police headquarters last night.","原書例句"],["vision","視力；視野；遠見","I wear glasses to improve my ______.","我戴眼鏡來改善視力。","a person of vision 有遠見的人；visual a. 視覺的；envision vt. 想像；provision n. 規定；供應；supervision n. 監督","n.","vision","I wear glasses to improve my vision.","原書例句"],["visible","看得見的","The building was ______ through the trees.","透過樹木可以看見那棟建築物。","invisible a. 看不見的","a.","visible","The building was visible through the trees.","原書例句"],["exchange","交換","I ______ sth with sb.","我和某人交換某物。","exchange sth with sb；exchange A for B；exchangeable a. 可交換的","vt. & n.","exchange","I exchange sth with sb.","原書例句"],["practical","實際的；實用的","This job calls for at least five years of ______ experience.","這份工作至少需要 5 年實際經驗。","practice n. 實踐；impractical a. 不實際的","a.","practical","This job calls for at least five years of practical experience.","原書例句"],["practically","實際上；幾乎","______ speaking, Jason isn’t cut out for the job.","實際來說，傑森不適合這份工作。","Practically speaking,... 實際來說；practically = almost","adv.","Practically","Practically speaking, Jason isn’t cut out for the job.","原書例句"],["mend","修理；修補","The thrifty man ______ his own clothes, including torn socks.","這名節儉的男子自己修補衣服，包括破掉的襪子。","repair vt. 修理；fix vt. 修理","vt.","mends","The thrifty man mends his own clothes, including torn socks.","原書例句"],["repair","修理","The mechanic will ______ the broken bicycle tomorrow.","技師明天會修理壞掉的腳踏車。","fix vt. 修理","vt.","repair","The mechanic will ______ the broken bicycle tomorrow.","練習新編句"],["constant","持續的；經常的","The ______ noise of the machine is driving me crazy.","機器持續的噪音快把我逼瘋了。","constantly adv. 不斷地；經常地","a.","constant","The constant noise of the machine is driving me crazy.","原書例句"],["dramatic","戲劇的；戲劇性的；引人注目的","Would you like to read the ______ piece I wrote recently?","你想讀我最近寫的戲劇作品嗎？","drama n. 戲劇；drastic a. 激烈的","a.","dramatic","Would you like to read the dramatic piece I wrote recently?","原書例句"],["drama","戲劇","We watched a historical ______ in class.","我們在課堂上看了一齣歷史劇。","dramatic a. 戲劇的","n.","drama","We watched a historical ______ in class.","練習新編句"],["warn","警告","Our teacher ______ us not to cheat on the test.","老師警告我們考試時不要作弊。","warn sb not to + V；warn A + that + N/V-ing；warn sb of/about...；warning n. 警告","vt.","warned","Our teacher warned us not to cheat on the test.","原書例句"],["warning","警告","Thank you for your timely ______.","謝謝你及時的警告。","warn vt. 警告","n.","warning","Thank you for your timely warning.","原書例句"],["definition","定義；解釋","There are several ______ listed under the word.","這個字下面列了幾個定義。","define vt. 定義；definite a. 明確的；definitely adv. 明確地；HDTV 高畫質電視","n.","definitions","There are several definitions listed under the word.","原書例句"],["afford","買得起；負擔得起","Being poor, I can’t ______ to take a trip to Thailand.","因為窮，我負擔不起去泰國旅行的費用。","affordable a. 負擔得起的；afford + N；afford to + V；can afford sth","vt.","afford","Being poor, I can’t afford to take a trip to Thailand.","原書例句"],["missile","飛彈","They will launch the ______ as scheduled.","他們會按預定時程發射飛彈。","rocket n. 火箭","n.","missile","They will launch the missile as scheduled.","原書例句"],["rocket","火箭","The scientists launched a ______ with a communications satellite on it.","科學家發射了一枚載有通訊衛星的火箭。","—","n.","rocket","The scientists launched a rocket with a communications satellite on it.","原書例句"],["credit","信用；學分；功勞","Buying on ______ is getting popular in Taiwan.","在臺灣，賒購愈來愈普遍。","on credit 賒帳；a credit card 信用卡；sb is credited with sth 某人被歸功於某事","n.","credit","Buying on credit is getting popular in Taiwan.","原書例句"],["credible","可信的","The witness gave a ______ explanation of what happened.","目擊者對事情經過提出了可信的說明。","credibility n. 可信度；credit vt. 相信","a.","credible","The witness gave a ______ explanation of what happened.","練習新編句"],["educate","教育；培養","Peter was born in Taiwan but ______ in the United States.","彼得出生在臺灣，但在美國接受教育。","educator n. 教育家；education n. 教育；educational a. 教育的","vt.","educated","Peter was born in Taiwan but educated in the United States.","原書例句"],["education","教育","The ______al / education system in the US is somewhat different from that in Taiwan.","美國的教育制度和臺灣的有些不同。","educational a. 教育的","n.","education","The educational / education system in the US is somewhat different from that in Taiwan.","原書例句"],["preparation","準備；預備","Education should be a ______ for life after graduation.","教育應該是為畢業後的人生做準備。","in preparation for... 為……做準備；make preparations for...；prepare vt. 準備","n.","preparation","Education should be a preparation for life after graduation.","原書例句"],["prepare","準備","Mary’s students are studying in the library in ______ for the upcoming finals.","瑪麗的學生正在圖書館為即將到來的期末考做準備。","prepare for... 為……準備","vt.","preparation","Mary’s students are studying in the library in preparation for the upcoming finals.","原書例句"],["airline","航空公司","Lufthansa is one of the most popular ______ in Europe.","漢莎航空是歐洲最受歡迎的航空公司之一。","—","n.","airlines","Lufthansa is one of the most popular airlines in Europe.","原書例句"],["anyhow","無論如何","We did our best, but the other team won ______.","我們已經盡力了，但另一隊無論如何還是贏了。","anyway adv. 無論如何","adv.","anyhow","We did our best, but the other team won anyhow.","原書例句"],["dinosaur","恐龍","______ ruled the earth millions of years ago.","恐龍在數百萬年前統治地球。","—","n.","Dinosaurs","Dinosaurs ruled the earth millions of years ago.","原書例句"],["puppet","玩偶；木偶；傀儡","The students made ______ out of socks in art class.","學生們在美術課用襪子做布偶。","doll n. 玩偶","n.","puppets","The students made puppets out of socks in art class.","原書例句"],["squirrel","松鼠","City ______ eat a variety of foods, including nuts, snacks, and insects.","城市裡的松鼠吃各種食物，包括堅果、零食和昆蟲。","koala n. 無尾熊；donkey n. 驢子；ox n. 公牛（工作用）；bull n. 公牛；leopard n. 花豹；cheetah n. 獵豹；jaguar n. 美洲豹；dolphin n. 海豚；porpoise n. 鼠海豚；penguin n. 企鵝；owl n. 貓頭鷹；parrot n. 鸚鵡；eagle n. 老鷹；swallow n. 燕子；pigeon n. 鴿子","n.","squirrels","City squirrels eat a variety of foods, including nuts, snacks, and insects.","原書例句"],["koala","無尾熊","Children love ______ because they think these little animals are cute.","小朋友喜歡無尾熊，因為他們覺得這些小動物很可愛。","—","n.","koalas","Children love koalas because they think these little animals are cute.","原書例句"],["donkey","驢子","Typically, ______ are used as work animals.","通常，驢子被當作工作動物。","—","n.","donkeys","Typically, donkeys are used as work animals.","原書例句"],["ox","公牛（工作用）","My sister was born in the Year of the ______.","我妹妹是牛年出生的。","oxen（複數）","n.","Ox","My sister was born in the Year of the Ox.","原書例句"],["leopard","花豹","______ are very good at climbing trees, but they rarely do so.","花豹很會爬樹，但牠們很少這麼做。","cheetah n. 獵豹；jaguar n. 美洲豹","n.","Leopards","Leopards are very good at climbing trees, but they rarely do so.","原書例句"],["dolphin","海豚","______ have a very complicated communication system.","海豚有一套非常複雜的溝通系統。","porpoise n. 鼠海豚","n.","Dolphins","Dolphins have a very complicated communication system.","原書例句"],["penguin","企鵝","______ are birds; however, they don’t fly but they can swim like fish.","企鵝是鳥類；然而牠們不會飛，卻能像魚一樣游泳。","—","n.","Penguins","Penguins are birds; however, they don’t fly but they can swim like fish.","原書例句"],["owl","貓頭鷹","______ have large eyes and hunt at night.","貓頭鷹有大眼睛，而且在夜間獵食。","—","n.","Owls","Owls have large eyes and hunt at night.","原書例句"],["parrot","鸚鵡","The ______ likes to imitate my words.","這隻鸚鵡喜歡模仿我說話。","eagle n. 老鷹；swallow n. 燕子","n.","parrot","The parrot likes to imitate my words.","原書例句"],["pigeon","鴿子","Can you tell the difference between a ______ and a dove?","你能分辨鴿子和斑鳩的不同嗎？","—","n.","pigeon","Can you tell the difference between a pigeon and a dove?","原書例句"]],"U07":[["trend","趨勢；潮流","Business leaders have to keep track of the latest economic ______.","企業領袖必須隨時掌握最新的經濟趨勢。","keep up with the trends 跟上潮流；follow the trends 跟隨潮流；trend(y) → trendy a. 時髦的","n.","trends","Business leaders have to keep track of the latest economic trends.","原書例句"],["tide","潮汐；潮流","Time and ______ wait for no man.","歲月不待人。","Time and tide wait for no man. 歲月不待人；tide sb over 幫某人度過難關","n.","tide","Time and tide wait for no man.","原書例句"],["attract","吸引；引起注意","I must admit that I’m very ______ to David.","我必須承認我非常受大衛吸引。","be attracted to/by... 被……吸引；attract attention from...；draw attention from...；attraction n. 吸引力；吸引人的事物","vt.","attracted","I must admit that I’m very attracted to David.","原書例句"],["attractive","吸引人的；迷人的","Unlike her sister, Liz was extremely ______.","不像她姊姊，莉茲非常迷人。","charming a. 迷人的；appealing a. 吸引人的","a.","attractive","Unlike her sister, Liz was extremely attractive.","原書例句"],["historic","有歷史性的；歷史上著名的","This invention is of ______ significance.","這項發明具有歷史性的意義。","history n. 歷史；historical a. 歷史的","a.","historic","This invention is of historic significance.","原書例句"],["historian","歷史學家","The ______ wrote a book, revealing the mysteries of the dynasty.","這名歷史學家寫了一本書，揭開這個朝代的神祕面紗。","history n. 歷史","n.","historian","The historian wrote a book, revealing the mysteries of the dynasty.","原書例句"],["avenue","大街；大道","They established a branch office on Fifth ______.","他們在第五大道設立了一間分公司。","explore every avenue 想盡各種辦法","n.","Avenue","They established a branch office on Fifth Avenue.","原書例句"],["alley","巷；小徑","A car got stuck in the narrow ______.","一輛車卡在狹窄的小巷裡。","alleyway n. 小巷；blind alley / dead end 死巷","n.","alley","A car got stuck in the narrow alley.","原書例句"],["threat","威脅；恐嚇","Poverty is a ______ to society.","貧窮是社會的一項威脅。","pose a threat to... 對……構成威脅；threaten vt. 威脅；threaten sb with sth；threaten to + V","n.","threat","Poverty is a threat to society.","原書例句"],["paradise","天堂；樂園","They say Singapore is a shopping ______.","據說新加坡是購物天堂。","heaven n. 天堂；hell n. 地獄","n.","paradise","They say Singapore is a shopping paradise.","原書例句"],["hell","地獄；極不愉快之處","Bad people go to ______ after they die.","壞人死後會下地獄。","go to hell 下地獄","n.","hell","Bad people go to hell after they die.","原書例句"],["remind","提醒；使想起","The lullaby ______ me of my childhood.","這首搖籃曲使我想起童年。","remind sb of sth 使某人想起某事；remind sb to + V 提醒某人做……；reminder n. 提醒物","vt.","reminds","The lullaby reminds me of my childhood.","原書例句"],["inner","內部的；內心的","Beauty is only skin-deep. It’s ______ beauty that counts.","美貌只是膚淺的，內在美才重要。","an inner circle 核心圈；internal a. 內部的；outer a. 外部的；outer space 外太空；external a. 外部的","a.","inner","Beauty is only skin-deep. It’s inner beauty that counts.","原書例句"],["outer","外部的；外面的","Some people believe that there are intelligent beings like mankind in ______ space.","有些人相信外太空有像人類一樣有智慧的生物。","outer space 外太空；external a. 外部的","a.","outer","Some people believe that there are intelligent beings like mankind in outer space.","原書例句"],["hollow","中空的；空洞的","Bamboo is light because it is ______.","竹子因為中空所以很輕。","solid a. 實心的；hollow out 挖空","a.","hollow","Bamboo is light because it is hollow.","原書例句"],["pilot","飛行員；領航員","Brian is a licensed ______ and owns his own plane.","布萊恩是有執照的飛行員，而且擁有自己的飛機。","copilot n. 副駕駛；fighter pilot 戰鬥機飛行員；pilot a. 試驗性的；drive a plane 駕駛飛機","n.","pilot","Brian is a licensed pilot and owns his own plane.","原書例句"],["vacant","空的；空缺的","We’ll keep this position ______ until you come back.","我們會保留這個職缺直到你回來。","vacancy n. 空缺；available a. 可用的","a.","vacant","We’ll keep this position vacant until you come back.","原書例句"],["slave","奴隸","Peter is a ______ to his work and often works himself to exhaustion.","彼得是工作的奴隸，常常工作到筋疲力盡。","be a slave to... 成為……的奴隸；be enslaved by...；slave away 辛苦工作；slavery n. 奴隸制度","n.","slave","Peter is a slave to his work and often works himself to exhaustion.","原書例句"],["advise","勸告；忠告；建議","The doctor ______ Grandfather not to drink too many beers.","醫生勸祖父不要喝太多啤酒。","advise sb (not) to + V；advice n. 忠告（不可數）；adviser/advisor n. 顧問；advisory a. 諮詢的","vt.","advised","The doctor advised Grandfather not to drink too many beers.","原書例句"],["adviser","顧問；勸告者","I think you need a financial ______ to help you plan your investments.","我想你需要一位理財顧問來協助規劃投資。","advisor n. 顧問；advisory a. 諮詢的","n.","adviser","I think you need a financial adviser to help you plan your investments.","原書例句"],["stare","凝視；盯著看","Why are you ______ at me, John? Is there something wrong with me?","約翰，你為什麼一直盯著我看？我有什麼不對勁嗎？","stare at... 盯著……看","vi.","staring","Why are you staring at me, John? Is there something wrong with me?","原書例句"],["glance","瞥一眼；匆匆看","I ______ at the girl one more time before I left.","我離開前又看了那女孩一眼。","glance at... 瞥一眼；at first glance 乍看之下；peep vi. 偷看","vi. & n.","glanced","I glanced at the girl one more time before I left.","原書例句"],["sum","總和；金額；總結","Bill ______med up all expenses and said the sum of 17, 18 and 19 is 54.","比爾把所有支出加總，並說 17、18 和 19 的總和是 54。","sum up 總結；a large/small sum of money 一大／小筆錢；To sum up,... 總而言之","n. & vt.","sum","Bill summed up all expenses and said the sum of 17, 18 and 19 is 54.","原書例句"],["summary","摘要；概要","Please give me a ______ of what was decided at the meeting.","請給我一份會議決議的摘要。","In summary,... 總而言之；summarize vt. 摘要","n.","summary","Please give me a summary of what was decided at the meeting.","原書例句"],["necessity","必需品；必要性","______ is the mother of invention.","需要為發明之母。","basic necessities 生活必需品；necessary a. 必要的；unnecessary a. 不必要的","n.","Necessity","Necessity is the mother of invention.","原書例句"],["sensible","明智的；合理的","That’s a ______ approach to the problem.","那是處理這個問題的明智方法。","sense n. 感覺；常識；sensitive a. 敏感的；be sensitive to...；insensible a. 無知覺的；sensation n. 感覺；sensational a. 轟動的","a.","sensible","That’s a sensible approach to the problem.","原書例句"],["sufficient","足夠的；充分的","These poor children do not have ______ food for the winter.","這些貧困兒童沒有足夠的食物過冬。","be sufficient for sth 足以……；sufficiency n. 充足；insufficient a. 不足的","a.","sufficient","These poor children do not have sufficient food for the winter.","原書例句"],["crispy","酥脆的","These crackers are ______ and tasty.","這些餅乾又酥脆又好吃。","crisp a. 酥脆的；crunchy a. 爽脆的","a.","crispy","These crackers are crispy and tasty.","原書例句"],["almond","杏仁","______ eyes are not unique to Asians.","杏仁眼並非亞洲人獨有。","almond eyes 杏仁眼；apricot n. 杏；杏色","n.","Almond","Almond eyes are not unique to Asians.","原書例句"],["crop","農作物；收成","Our ______ are doing poorly because of the drought.","由於乾旱，我們的農作物長得不好。","crop up 突然出現；have one’s hair cropped 剪短頭髮","n.","crops","Our crops are doing poorly because of the drought.","原書例句"],["lettuce","萵苣；生菜","Have some ______. It’s good for your health.","吃點生菜吧，對你的健康有益。","cabbage n. 高麗菜；green onion 青蔥；onion n. 洋蔥；spinach n. 菠菜","n.","lettuce","Have some lettuce. It’s good for your health.","原書例句"],["spinach","菠菜","Popeye eats ______ every day to gain strength.","卜派每天吃菠菜來增強力氣。","—","n.","spinach","Popeye eats spinach every day to gain strength.","原書例句"],["bamboo","竹子","Pandas only eat a certain kind of ______.","熊貓只吃某一種竹子。","a bamboo shoot 竹筍","n.","bamboo","Pandas only eat a certain kind of bamboo.","原書例句"],["widen","使變寬；變寬","The construction crew spent several days ______ the streets in town.","施工人員花了好幾天拓寬鎮上的街道。","wide a. 寬的；widely adv. 廣泛地；width n. 寬度","vt. & vi.","widening","The construction crew spent several days widening the streets in town.","原書例句"],["weaken","使變弱；變弱","Tina’s asthma has ______ her interest in attending the party tonight.","蒂娜的氣喘使她今晚參加派對的興致減弱了。","weakness n. 弱點；weak a. 虛弱的","vt. & vi.","weakened","Tina’s asthma has weakened her interest in attending the party tonight.","原書例句"],["tent","帳篷","We pitched our ______ by the lake.","我們在湖邊搭起帳篷。","pitch a tent 搭帳篷；put up a tent；camp n. 營地","n.","tent","We pitched our tent by the lake.","原書例句"],["pulse","脈搏；脈動","Where do you get this ______? It looks absolutely fantastic.","你在哪裡買到這個脈搏？它看起來棒極了。","take/feel one’s pulse 量／感覺脈搏；pulse rate 脈搏率","n.","pulse","Where do you get this pulse? It looks absolutely fantastic.","原書例句"],["observe","觀察；遵守","Have you ______ any changes in Sam’s behavior?","你有觀察到山姆的行為有任何改變嗎？","observation n. 觀察；observer n. 觀察者；observant a. 善於觀察的","vt.","observed","Have you observed any changes in Sam’s behavior?","原書例句"],["junior","大三學生；較年幼者；資淺的；較低階的","All ______ have to take two science classes.","所有大三學生都必須修兩門自然科學課。","be junior to sb 比某人資淺；sb’s junior by three/five years 小某人三／五歲；senior n. & a. 大四學生；年長者；資深的","n. & a.","juniors","All juniors have to take two science classes.","原書例句"],["senior","大四學生；年長者；資深的","During my first year in college, I dated a ______.","我大一時和一名大四學生約會。","be senior to sb 比某人資深；sb’s senior by three/five years 大某人三／五歲；junior n. & a.","n. & a.","senior","During my first year in college, I dated a senior.","原書例句"],["marker","麥克筆；標誌物","Dennis circled the wall with a ______.","丹尼斯用麥克筆在牆上畫了一個圈。","mark n. 標記；marker pen 麥克筆","n.","marker","Dennis circled the wall with a marker.","原書例句"],["pile","一堆；一疊","There is a ______ of books in Lucy’s study.","露西的書房裡有一堆書。","a pile of... 一堆……；pile up 堆積；pile sth up 堆起某物","n.","pile","There is a pile of books in Lucy’s study.","原書例句"],["steal","偷竊","The cop caught the thief ______ a car.","警察逮到那名正在偷車的賊。","steal, stole, stolen","vt.","stealing","The cop caught the thief stealing a car.","原書例句"]],"U08":[["protection","保護","Jack was wearing a heavy coat as ______ against the cold.","傑克穿著厚重大衣禦寒。","protect vt. 保護；protective a. 保護的；as protection against... 作為防止……的保護","n.","protection","Jack was wearing a heavy coat as protection against the cold.","原書例句"],["stormy","暴風雨的；激烈的","We had a blackout during the ______ night.","暴風雨的夜晚我們停電了。","storm n. 暴風雨；vehement a. 激烈的","a.","stormy","We had a blackout during the stormy night.","原書例句"],["pure","純的；純淨的","The pajamas are made of ______ cotton.","這套睡衣是純棉製的。","pure silk 純絲；pure cotton 純棉；purify vt. 淨化","a.","pure","The pajamas are made of pure cotton.","原書例句"],["native","本土的；本地的；本地人","Chinese is Ken’s ______ language, but he is more fluent in Spanish.","中文是肯的母語，但他的西班牙文更流利。","sb’s native language/tongue 某人的母語；be native to... 原產於……；be unique to...；be indigenous to...；indigenous a. 土生土長的","a. & n.","native","Chinese is Ken’s native language, but he is more fluent in Spanish.","原書例句"],["domestic","國內的；家庭的","The airline offers both international and ______ flights.","這家航空公司同時提供國際與國內航班。","domestic affairs 國內事務；domestic animals 家畜","a.","domestic","The airline offers both international and ______ flights.","練習新編句"],["cattle","牛（集合名詞）","In New Zealand, there are more than 1,000 sheep and ______ farms.","在紐西蘭，有超過一千座綿羊和牛的農場。","cattle 為集合名詞；bull n. 公牛；buffalo n. 水牛／野牛","n.","cattle","In New Zealand, there are more than 1,000 sheep and cattle farms.","原書例句"],["bull","公牛","During the festival, many ______ will run through the narrow streets in the city.","節慶期間，許多公牛會跑過城裡狹窄的街道。","—","n.","bulls","During the festival, many bulls will run through the narrow streets in the city.","原書例句"],["buffalo","水牛；野牛","The American ______ is one of the largest land animals in North America.","美洲野牛是北美洲最大的陸生動物之一。","water buffalo 水牛","n.","buffalo","The American buffalo is one of the largest land animals in North America.","原書例句"],["lord","領主；上帝","A knight should pledge loyalty to his ______.","騎士應該宣誓效忠他的領主。","Lord 上帝；pledge loyalty to... 宣誓效忠……","n.","lord","A knight should pledge loyalty to his lord.","原書例句"],["shadow","影子；陰影；使蒙上陰影","Winnie sat in the ______.","溫妮坐在陰影處。","cast a shadow on... 在……投下影子；live in sb’s shadow 活在某人的陰影下；shade n. 陰涼處","n. & vt.","shadows","Winnie sat in the shadows.","原書例句"],["shade","陰涼處；遮蔭","We sat in the ______ of a large tree.","我們坐在一棵大樹的樹蔭下。","shadow n. 影子","n.","shade","We sat in the ______ of a large tree.","練習新編句"],["advertise","為……做廣告；刊登廣告","You should ______ your car in the local newspaper if you want to sell it quickly.","如果你想很快賣掉車子，就應該在當地報紙刊登廣告。","advertise for sb/sth 登廣告徵求……；advertiser n. 廣告商；advertisement n. 廣告；advertising n. 廣告業","vt. & vi.","advertise","You should advertise your car in the local newspaper if you want to sell it quickly.","原書例句"],["advertiser","廣告商；廣告客戶","Super Bowl ______ have to pay lots of money for their commercial time.","超級盃的廣告商必須為商業廣告時段支付很多錢。","commercial time 商業廣告時段","n.","advertisers","Super Bowl advertisers have to pay lots of money for their commercial time.","原書例句"],["advertisement","廣告","No one replied to the ______ Mary put in the paper.","沒有人回覆瑪麗刊登在報紙上的廣告。","put/place an advertisement in the newspaper 在報紙刊登廣告；ad n. 廣告","n.","advertisement","No one replied to the advertisement Mary put in the paper.","原書例句"],["liberty","自由","Give me ______, or give me death!","不自由，毋寧死！","liberal a. 自由的；liberate vt. 解放；the Statue of Liberty 自由女神像","n.","liberty","Give me liberty, or give me death!","原書例句"],["confuse","使困惑；混淆","Please slow down—you are ______ me.","請慢一點——你把我弄糊塗了。","confuse A with B 把 A 和 B 混淆；get confused 感到困惑","vt.","confusing","Please slow down—you are confusing me.","原書例句"],["suspect","懷疑；嫌疑犯；可疑的","The police ______ Bob of the crime.","警方懷疑鮑伯犯了這宗罪。","suspect sb of + N/V-ing；be suspected of + V-ing；suspicion n. 懷疑；be under suspicion；suspicious a. 可疑的","vt. & n. & a.","suspected","The police suspected Bob of the crime.","原書例句"],["suspicion","懷疑；嫌疑","Daniel is under ______ by the police for robbery.","丹尼爾因搶劫案而受到警方懷疑。","be under suspicion 受到懷疑；have a suspicion that... 懷疑……","n.","suspicion","Daniel is under suspicion by the police for robbery.","原書例句"],["beneath","在……下面；在下方","The money was hidden ______ a stack of newspapers.","錢藏在一疊報紙下面。","underneath prep. & adv. 在……下面；below prep. 在……下方；above prep. 在……上方","prep. & adv.","beneath","The money was hidden beneath a stack of newspapers.","原書例句"],["onto","到……上面","The chef squeezed some lemon juice ______ the fish to bring out its flavor.","廚師在魚上擠了一些檸檬汁來帶出它的風味。","onto = on to（依語境）","prep.","onto","The chef squeezed some lemon juice onto the fish to bring out its flavor.","原書例句"],["comfort","舒適；安慰；安慰某人","Despite all the material ______, the rich man isn’t happy.","儘管擁有一切物質享受，那位富人並不快樂。","take comfort in + N/V-ing 從……得到安慰；comfortable a. 舒適的","n. & vt.","comforts","Despite all the material comforts, the rich man isn’t happy.","原書例句"],["comparison","比較","A ______ of the two teams indicates that the game should be close.","兩隊一比較便顯示這場比賽應該會很接近。","in comparison with... 與……相比；compare vt. 比較；comparable a. 可比較的；comparative a. 比較的","n.","comparison","A comparison of the two teams indicates that the game should be close.","原書例句"],["chest","胸部；箱子","Don’t keep the secret to yourself. You should tell me and get it off your ______.","別把祕密藏在心裡，你應該告訴我，把心事說出來。","get something off one’s chest 把心事說出來；breast n. 胸部；乳房","n.","chest","Don’t keep the secret to yourself. You should tell me and get it off your chest.","原書例句"],["breast","胸部；乳房","______ cancer can be cured if detected early.","乳癌若及早發現是可以治癒的。","breast cancer 乳癌；abreast adv./a. 並排","n.","Breast","Breast cancer can be cured if detected early.","原書例句"],["scale","規模；秤；刻度","Pollution has caused changes to weather patterns on a large ______.","污染已大規模造成天氣型態的改變。","on a ... scale 以……規模；on a large/small/massive scale 大／小／大規模地","n.","scale","Pollution has caused changes to weather patterns on a large scale.","原書例句"],["conscious","意識到的；有知覺的","______ of the dangers of smoking, Benny decided to give up the bad habit.","班尼意識到吸菸的危險，因此決定戒掉這個壞習慣。","be conscious of... 意識到……；be aware of...；consciousness n. 意識；regain consciousness 恢復知覺；awareness n. 意識；conscience n. 良心","a.","Conscious","Conscious of the dangers of smoking, Benny decided to give up the bad habit.","原書例句"],["consciousness","意識；知覺","The patient regained ______ shortly after treatment.","病人在治療後不久便恢復知覺。","regain consciousness 恢復知覺","n.","consciousness","The patient regained consciousness shortly after treatment.","原書例句"],["troop","部隊；軍隊","The commander gave his ______ a pep talk to boost their morale.","指揮官對部隊發表鼓舞談話以提升士氣。","troops 軍隊；pep talk 鼓舞士氣的談話；morale n. 士氣","n.","troops","The commander gave his troops a pep talk to boost their morale.","原書例句"],["cricket","蟋蟀；板球","Do you hear a ______? It’s keeping me awake.","你有聽到蟋蟀叫嗎？牠吵得我睡不著。","—","n.","cricket","Do you hear a cricket? It’s keeping me awake.","原書例句"],["grasshopper","蚱蜢","Did you know that a ______ can leap 20 times the length of its own body?","你知道蚱蜢可以跳到自己身長 20 倍的距離嗎？","—","n.","grasshopper","Did you know that a grasshopper can leap 20 times the length of its own body?","原書例句"],["fairly","相當地；頗","It’s ______ difficult to tell the difference between Sandy and her twin sister.","要分辨珊蒂和她的雙胞胎姊妹相當困難。","fair a. 公平的；fairy n. 仙女；quite adv. 相當；rather adv. 頗","adv.","fairly","It’s fairly difficult to tell the difference between Sandy and her twin sister.","原書例句"],["substance","物質","This colorless, odorless ______ is actually quite toxic.","這種無色無味的物質其實毒性相當強。","substantial a. 大量的；實質的；odorless a. 無氣味的；toxic a. 有毒的","n.","substance","This colorless, odorless substance is actually quite toxic.","原書例句"],["pour","倒；傾注；傾盆而下","Please ______ water into the jug and then place it on the table.","請把水倒進壺裡，然後把它放在桌上。","pour A into B 把 A 倒入 B；It’s pouring. 下著傾盆大雨；It’s raining cats and dogs.；may as well + V 不妨……","vt. & vi.","pour","Please pour water into the jug and then place it on the table.","原書例句"],["promote","促進；推廣；升遷","Our company ______ education by offering scholarships to the poor.","我們公司藉由提供獎學金給窮人來促進教育。","promote peace 促進和平；promote sales 促銷；be promoted to... 被升為……；promotion n. 升遷；促銷","vt.","promotes","Our company promotes education by offering scholarships to the poor.","原書例句"],["pad","墊子；襯墊；加墊","There is a ______ on every corner of the table so that you won’t get hurt if you bump into one.","桌子的每個角都有護墊，因此撞到時不會受傷。","pad, padded, padded；be padded with... 以……填塞／加墊；mouse pad 滑鼠墊","n. & vt.","pad","There is a pad on every corner of the table so that you won’t get hurt if you bump into one.","原書例句"],["cinema","電影院；電影","They are building a ______ near our town.","他們正在我們鎮附近蓋一間電影院。","go to the cinema = go to the movies 去看電影；movie theater 電影院","n.","cinema","They are building a cinema near our town.","原書例句"],["clay","黏土","My daughter made me a flower with ______.","我女兒用黏土做了一朵花給我。","—","n.","clay","My daughter made me a flower with clay.","原書例句"],["fence","圍起；柵欄","The farmer ______ in all his cattle.","農夫把所有的牛都圍了起來。","fence ... in 把……圍起來","vt. & n.","fenced","The farmer fenced in all his cattle.","原書例句"],["garage","車庫；修車廠","My ______ can only accommodate one car.","我的車庫只能容納一輛車。","a garage sale 車庫拍賣；accommodate vt. 容納","n.","garage","My garage can only accommodate one car.","原書例句"],["fuel","燃料；加燃料；助長","Your criticism will only add ______ to the fire.","你的批評只會火上加油。","add fuel to the fire 火上加油；fuel up 加油；fuel sb’s anger 火上加油；biofuel n. 生質燃料","n. & vt.","fuel","Your criticism will only add fuel to the fire.","原書例句"],["decorate","裝飾；布置","Ken ______ his bedroom with his favorite band’s posters.","肯用他最喜愛樂團的海報裝飾臥室。","decorate A with B 用 B 裝飾 A；be decorated with...；decoration n. 裝飾","vt.","decorated","Ken decorated his bedroom with his favorite band’s posters.","原書例句"],["decrease","減少；下降","Mary’s fear ______ as she calmed down.","瑪麗冷靜下來後，恐懼也減少了。","be on the decrease/decline 正在減少；increase vt./vi./n. 增加；be on the increase 正在增加","vt. & vi. & n.","decreased","Mary’s fear decreased as she calmed down.","原書例句"],["emotional","情緒激動的；感情的","My mom became ______ upon reading the card sent her.","我媽媽讀到寄給她的卡片時情緒激動起來。","emotional quotient 情緒商數（EQ）","a.","emotional","My mom became emotional upon reading the card sent her.","原書例句"],["lick","舔；舔一下","My dog jumped onto the sofa and ______ my face.","我的狗跳上沙發舔我的臉。","suck vt. 吸；chew vt. 咀嚼；swallow vt. 吞嚥","vt. & n.","licked","My dog jumped onto the sofa and licked my face.","原書例句"],["nest","巢；窩","There’s a bird’s ______ in the tree.","樹上有一個鳥巢。","bird’s nest 鳥巢","n.","nest","There’s a bird’s nest in the tree.","原書例句"],["element","要素；元素","The book has all the ______ of a good suspense novel.","這本書具備一部優良懸疑小說的所有要素。","elemental a. 基本的；自然力的；elementary a. 基本的；an elementary school 小學","n.","elements","The book has all the elements of a good suspense novel.","原書例句"]],"U09":[["bang","砰然一聲；猛敲；巨響","The police officer heard a loud ______ and quickly grabbed his gun.","警察聽到一聲巨響，迅速拔出槍來。","with a bang 砰然一聲；with a bang = 轟轟烈烈地；go off with a bang 圓滿成功；bang one's head 撞到頭","vi. & vt. & n.","bang","The police officer heard a loud bang and quickly grabbed his gun.","原書例句"],["quote","引述；引文","The newspaper ______ the mayor as saying, ‘Two more parks will be built in this city next year.’","報紙引述市長的話：「明年這個城市將再蓋兩座公園。」","quote sb as saying... 引述某人說……；quotation n. 引文；quote/unquote 引號內／所謂的","vt. & n.","quoted","The newspaper quoted the mayor as saying, ‘Two more parks will be built in this city next year.’","原書例句"],["raw","生的；未加工的","Some vegetables can be eaten ______.","有些蔬菜可以生吃。","eat sth raw 生吃某物；raw material 原料；uncooked a. 未煮熟的；unprocessed a. 未加工的","a.","raw","Some vegetables can be eaten raw.","原書例句"],["freeze","結冰；凍僵；使凍結","The water ______ on the road, making it dangerous to drive.","水在路面結冰，使得開車很危險。","freeze, froze, frozen；freeze to death 凍死；freezer n. 冷凍庫；freezing a. 冰冷的；freezing point 冰點；frozen a. 冰凍的；be frozen with fear 嚇呆","vi. & vt.","froze","The water froze on the road, making it dangerous to drive.","原書例句"],["freezer","冷凍庫","Put the beef in the ______.","把牛肉放進冷凍庫。","—","n.","freezer","Put the beef in the freezer.","原書例句"],["freezing","冰冷的；嚴寒的","The ______ weather closed the bridge and kept most people indoors.","嚴寒的天氣使橋梁封閉，也讓大多數人待在室內。","a freezing cold day 嚴寒的一天；freezing point 冰點","a.","freezing","The freezing weather closed the bridge and kept most people indoors.","原書例句"],["frozen","冰凍的；凍僵的","Mom took the ______ fish from the freezer, so I would defrost it.","媽媽從冷凍庫拿出冷凍魚，所以我要把它解凍。","be frozen with fear 嚇呆","a.","frozen","Mom took the frozen fish from the freezer, so I would defrost it.","原書例句"],["request","要求；請求","My boss thought my report was too lengthy, so I had to cut it short at his ______.","老闆認為我的報告太冗長，所以我應他的要求縮短內容。","at sb's request 應某人的要求；on request 應要求；for the asking 只要開口；require vt. 要求；requirement n. 要求","n. & vt.","request","My boss thought my report was too lengthy, so I had to cut it short at his request.","原書例句"],["mental","心理的；精神的","Lucy is said to have some ______ problems. She is a little bit weird.","據說露西有些心理問題，她有點怪怪的。","mentally adv. 心理上地；psychological a. 心理的；physical a. 身體的；physical examination 身體檢查；physical education 體育","a.","mental","Lucy is said to have some mental problems. She is a little bit weird.","原書例句"],["victim","受害者","Many teenagers fall ______ to drugs.","許多青少年成為毒品的受害者。","fall victim to... 成為……的受害者；fall prey to... 成為……的獵物／受害者；discriminate against... 歧視……；discrimination n. 歧視","n.","victim","Many teenagers fall victim to drugs.","原書例句"],["republic","共和國","90% stands for the ______ of Korea, more commonly known as South Korea.","ROK 代表大韓民國，也就是一般所稱的南韓。","republican a. 共和國的；Republican Party（美）共和黨；the Democratic Party 民主黨；democratic a. 民主的","n.","Republic","90% stands for the Republic of Korea, more commonly known as South Korea.","原書例句"],["opposite","相反的；對面的；相反的人／事物；在……對面","I live next to the bank ______ the train station.","我住在火車站對面的銀行旁邊。","hold the opposite view 持相反觀點；quite the opposite 正好相反；opposition n. 反對；oppose vt. 反對；be opposed to + N/V-ing 反對……","a. & n. & prep.","opposite","I live next to the bank opposite the train station.","原書例句"],["superior","較優秀的；上級的；上司","This car is far ______ to that one in terms of comfort.","就舒適度而言，這輛車遠優於那輛車。","be superior/inferior to... 優於／劣於……；one's superior/inferior 某人的上司／下屬；senior/junior to...；older/younger than...；inferior a. 較差的；劣等的","a. & n.","superior","This car is far superior to that one in terms of comfort.","原書例句"],["inferior","較差的；下級的","Confucius once said, ‘Do not make friends with those who are ______ to us.’","孔子曾說：「毋友不如己者。」","be inferior to... 劣於……","a.","inferior","Confucius once said, ‘Do not make friends with those who are inferior to us.’","原書例句"],["emergency","緊急事件","In Taiwan, in case of ______, please dial 119.","在臺灣，如遇緊急事故，請撥 119。","in case of emergency 萬一發生緊急事故","n.","emergency","In Taiwan, in case of emergency, please dial 119.","原書例句"],["emergency room","急診室","The injured driver was taken to the ______ immediately.","受傷的駕駛立刻被送到急診室。","the emergency room 急診室；emergency exit 緊急出口；crisis n. 危機","n.","emergency room","The injured driver was taken to the ______ immediately.","練習新編句"],["creative","有創造力的","A ______ advertisement requires intelligence and imagination.","一則有創意的廣告需要智慧與想像力。","create vt. 創造；creativity n. 創造力；imaginative a. 富想像力的；inventive a. 有創意的；innovative a. 創新的；original a. 原創的；creative writing 創意寫作；creator n. 創造者；destroyer n. 破壞者","a.","creative","A creative advertisement requires intelligence and imagination.","原書例句"],["creature","生物","Humans are ______ of habit.","人類是習慣的動物。","living thing 生物","n.","creatures","Humans are creatures of habit.","原書例句"],["creator","創造者","Walt Disney was the ______ of Mickey Mouse.","華特・迪士尼是米老鼠的創造者。","inventor n. 發明者；destroyer n. 破壞者","n.","creator","Walt Disney was the creator of Mickey Mouse.","原書例句"],["media","媒體（複數）","The political party accused the ______ of being biased.","該政黨指責媒體有所偏頗。","medium（單數）；the mass media 大眾傳播媒體","n.","media","The political party accused the media of being biased.","原書例句"],["extreme","極端的；極端","You should handle the problem with ______ caution.","你應該極度小心地處理這個問題。","go to extremes 走極端；excessive a. 過度的；extremely adv. 極端地；exceedingly adv. 非常；excessively adv. 過度地；exceptionally adv. 異常地","a. & n.","extreme","You should handle the problem with extreme caution.","原書例句"],["extremely","極端地；非常","I was ______ happy upon hearing the good news.","聽到這個好消息時，我非常高興。","exceedingly / excessively / exceptionally adv.","adv.","extremely","I was extremely happy upon hearing the good news.","原書例句"],["plenty","很多；大量","There are ______ of activities to do on the beach during the summertime.","夏季時海灘上有許多活動可做。","plenty of + 複數名詞／不可數名詞；plentiful a. 充足的","n.","plenty","There are plenty of activities to do on the beach during the summertime.","原書例句"],["wagon","四輪貨車","Tom plans to journey across America in a covered ______.","湯姆打算乘著篷車橫越美國。","van n. 廂型車；麵包車","n.","wagon","Tom plans to journey across America in a covered wagon.","原書例句"],["van","廂型車；麵包車","I'm moving to my new apartment this Sunday. Would you lend me your ______?","我這星期日要搬到新公寓。你可以把廂型車借我嗎？","—","n.","van","I'm moving to my new apartment this Sunday. Would you lend me your van?","原書例句"],["dare","敢於；膽敢；挑戰","I ______ not tell my parents that I'm getting married soon.","我不敢告訴父母我很快就要結婚了。","dare sb to + V 激某人做……；challenge sb to + V；I dare (that)...；How dare you...? 你怎敢……？","vt. & vi.","dare","I dare not tell my parents that I'm getting married soon.","原書例句"],["scholar","學者","The author of this book is also a famous ______ in his country.","這本書的作者也是他國內一位著名學者。","scholarly a. 學者的；有學問的；a scholarly statesman 學者型政治家；scholarship n. 獎學金／學問","n.","scholar","The author of this book is also a famous scholar in his country.","原書例句"],["scholarship","獎學金；學問","The intelligent young girl is studying at Harvard on a government ______.","這位聰明的年輕女孩靠政府獎學金在哈佛就讀。","study on a scholarship 靠獎學金就學","n.","scholarship","The intelligent young girl is studying at Harvard on a government scholarship.","原書例句"],["risk","風險；冒險","Parents shouldn't run the ______ of leaving their children alone.","父母不應冒險把孩子單獨留下。","take/run the risk of + V-ing 冒……風險；at risk 處於危險之中；risk one's life 冒生命危險；risk + N/V-ing","n. & vt.","risk","Parents shouldn't run the risk of leaving their children alone.","原書例句"],["loose","寬鬆的；鬆動的","My brother likes to wear ______ clothes and pants.","我哥哥喜歡穿寬鬆的衣服和褲子。","come loose 鬆開；tight a. 緊的","a.","loose","My brother likes to wear loose clothes and pants.","原書例句"],["persuade","說服；勸服","Try to ______ Jerry to apologize to the teacher.","試著說服傑瑞向老師道歉。","persuade sb to + V 說服某人做……；talk sb into + V-ing；persuade sb not to + V；talk sb out of + V-ing；Could you dissuade Tom from talking so loudly?；persuasion n. 說服；persuasive a. 有說服力的；convincing a. 令人信服的","vt.","persuade","Try to persuade Jerry to apologize to the teacher.","原書例句"],["cone","圓錐體","I set a warning ______ behind the car to avoid further accidents.","我在車後放了一個警示錐，以避免更多事故。","an ice cream cone 冰淇淋甜筒","n.","cone","I set a warning cone behind the car to avoid further accidents.","原書例句"],["odd","奇怪的；奇數的；零散的","Paul looks ______ today. What's wrong with him?","保羅今天看起來怪怪的。他怎麼了？","odds n. 機率；strange a. 奇怪的；odd numbers 奇數；even numbers 偶數；1,3,5...；2,4,6...","a.","odd","Paul looks odd today. What's wrong with him?","原書例句"],["breath","呼吸；一口氣","I always take a deep ______ before going on the stage.","我上臺前總會深呼吸。","take a deep breath 深呼吸；catch one's breath 喘口氣；a breath of wind 一絲風；breathtaking a. 令人屏息的；breathe vi. & vt. 呼吸；breathe in/out 吸氣／吐氣","n.","breath","I always take a deep breath before going on the stage.","原書例句"],["release","釋放；發行；釋放／發行","After ten years in prison, the prisoner was ______ this morning.","服刑十年後，這名囚犯今天早上獲釋。","release sb from... 釋放某人脫離……；release a film/movie 發行電影；release names 公布姓名；release tension 舒緩緊張；release a report 發布報告","vt. & n.","released","After ten years in prison, the prisoner was released this morning.","原書例句"],["temper","脾氣","I've never seen Victoria lose her ______.","我從未看過維多利亞發脾氣。","keep/lose one's temper 忍住／發脾氣","n.","temper","I've never seen Victoria lose her temper.","原書例句"],["cotton","棉；棉花","All of our T-shirts are made of pure ______.","我們所有的 T 恤都是純棉製的。","a cotton ball 棉球；a cotton swab 棉花棒","n.","cotton","All of our T-shirts are made of pure cotton.","原書例句"],["lily","百合","The ______ in the garden are in full bloom.","花園裡的百合正盛開。","—","n.","lilies","The lilies in the garden are in full bloom.","原書例句"],["straw","吸管；稻草","You look very charming when you wear that ______ hat.","你戴那頂草帽時看起來很迷人。","the last straw 最後一根稻草；hay n. 乾草；Make hay while the sun shines. 把握時機；Finding the missing ring here is like looking for a needle in the hay. 大海撈針","n.","straw","You look very charming when you wear that straw hat.","原書例句"],["flour","麵粉","To make a cake, you need ______ and eggs.","做蛋糕需要麵粉和雞蛋。","flour 與 flower 同音；flour the bottom of the bowl 在碗底撒麵粉","n.","flour","To make a cake, you need flour and eggs.","原書例句"],["tunnel","隧道","A ______ is being built between the two cities.","兩座城市之間正在興建一條隧道。","—","n.","tunnel","A tunnel is being built between the two cities.","原書例句"],["quit","停止；離開；辭職","Paula announced that she will ______ show business next year.","寶拉宣布明年將退出演藝圈。","quit, quit, quit；quit smoking 戒菸；give up smoking；stop + V-ing 停止做……；quit one's job 辭職；quit + N/V-ing；continue to + V/V-ing 繼續……","vt. & vi.","quit","Paula announced that she will quit show business next year.","原書例句"],["intelligent","聰明的","Lisa is ______ and hardworking, which is why all her teachers like her.","麗莎既聰明又勤奮，所以所有老師都喜歡她。","intelligence n. 智慧；wit n. 機智；clever a. 聰明的；bright a. 聰明的","a.","intelligent","Lisa is intelligent and hardworking, which is why all her teachers like her.","原書例句"],["exhibition","展覽會","There will be an ______ of modern sculpture next month.","下個月將有一場現代雕塑展。","be on exhibition 展出中；be on display；exhibit vt. 展示；n. 展覽品；exhibition hall 展覽館","n.","exhibition","There will be an exhibition of modern sculpture next month.","原書例句"]],"U10":[["electronic","電子的","To our surprise, Penny plays the ______ organ very well.","令我們驚訝的是，佩妮電子琴彈得非常好。","electric a. 電的；電動的；an electric appliance 家用電器；electrical a. 與電有關的；electrician n. 電工；electricity n. 電","a.","electronic","To our surprise, Penny plays the electronic organ very well.","原書例句"],["electricity","電","This commuter train runs on ______.","這班通勤列車是以電驅動的。","electric / electrical / electronic 相關字","n.","electricity","This commuter train runs on electricity.","原書例句"],["shiny","發亮的；有光澤的","I found a ______ new coin on the ground and picked it up.","我在地上發現一枚閃亮的新硬幣，便把它撿起來。","glossy a. 有光澤的；shine vi. 照耀 & vt. 擦亮","a.","shiny","I found a shiny new coin on the ground and picked it up.","原書例句"],["palace","皇宮","Buckingham ______ is one of the Queen’s six homes.","白金漢宮是英國女王六個住所之一。","place n. 地方 & vt. 放置","n.","Palace","Buckingham Palace is one of the Queen’s six homes.","原書例句"],["rank","階級；地位；排名","People from all ______ of society deserve equal treatment.","社會各階層人士都應得到平等的待遇。","the rank and file 所有基層成員；grade / class n. 等級；rank first = come in first 排名第一","n. & vi.","ranks","People from all ranks of society deserve equal treatment.","原書例句"],["rough","粗糙的；粗略的；粗暴的","Mom’s hands are ______ from hard work.","媽媽的雙手因辛苦工作而變得粗糙。","have a rough idea of sth 對某事略知一二；be rough on sb 對某人嚴厲；uneven / coarse / brutal / violent a.；rough draft 草稿","a.","rough","Mom’s hands are rough from hard work.","原書例句"],["roughly","粗略地；大約","Nicole described ______ to me the planned course of action.","妮可向我粗略地描述預定的行動計畫。","briefly adv. 簡略地；roughly = some / about / approximately / around（約）","adv.","roughly","Nicole described roughly to me the planned course of action.","原書例句"],["entry","入口","The main ______ to the stadium is across the road.","體育場的主要入口在馬路對面。","entrance n. 入口（與介詞 to 並用）；exit n. 出口（與介詞 from 並用）","n.","entry","The main entry to the stadium is across the road.","原書例句"],["proof","證明；防……的","I wouldn’t demand ______ of loyalty from a friend.","我不會向朋友要求忠誠的證明。","prove vi. 證明 & vt. 證實；proof of... ……的證明；waterproof 防水的；soundproof 隔音的；bulletproof 防彈的；fireproof 防火的","n. & a.","proof","I wouldn’t demand proof of loyalty from a friend.","原書例句"],["owe","欠；歸功於","You still ______ me NT$1,000, and you seem to have forgotten it.","你還欠我新臺幣 1,000 元，而且你好像忘了。","owe sb sth 欠某人某物；owe A to B 把 A 歸因於 B；attribute A to B","vt.","owe","You still owe me NT$1,000, and you seem to have forgotten it.","原書例句"],["owing","欠著的；未付清的","______ to poor management, the factory shut down 2 years after it was established.","由於管理不善，這家工廠成立兩年後便倒閉了。","owing to... 由於 = due to / on account of / as a result of","a.","Owing","Owing to poor management, the factory shut down 2 years after it was established.","原書例句"],["sin","罪惡；犯罪","In the eyes of my boss, wasting time is a ______.","在我老闆眼中，浪費時間是一種罪惡。","sin, sinned, sinned；sinful a. 有罪的；crime 指法律上的罪，sin 指良心／道德上的罪","n. & vi.","sin","In the eyes of my boss, wasting time is a sin.","原書例句"],["navy","海軍","Nancy’s grandfather was in the ______ during the war.","南西的祖父在戰爭期間曾服役於海軍。","naval a. 海軍的；air force 空軍；army 陸軍；marine corps 海軍陸戰隊；bribery n. 賄賂；corruption n. 貪腐；air base 空軍基地；barracks n. 營房；PX / post exchange 福利社","n.","navy","Nancy’s grandfather was in the navy during the war.","原書例句"],["violence","暴力；猛烈","You can’t resort to ______ just because you can’t reason with someone.","你不能只因無法跟別人理論就訴諸暴力。","cruelty n. 殘酷；brutality n. 殘暴；resort to... 訴諸……","n.","violence","You can’t resort to violence just because you can’t reason with someone.","原書例句"],["violent","暴力的；猛烈的","Beethoven’s father was a ______ and dangerous man.","貝多芬的父親是一個粗暴而又危險的人。","cruel / brutal a.；violently adv. 激烈地；粗暴地；vehemently adv. 激烈地；cruelly / brutally adv.","a.","violent","Beethoven’s father was a violent and dangerous man.","原書例句"],["concert","一致；協調（不可數）；音樂會；演唱會（可數）","We should work in ______ with one another to improve the quality of our lives.","我們應該同心協力改善生活品質。","work in concert with... 與……同心協力；put on / hold a concert 舉辦演唱會","n.","concert","We should work in concert with one another to improve the quality of our lives.","原書例句"],["poll","民意調查；做問卷調查","A nationwide ______ revealed different opinions among young voters.","一項全國性民調顯示年輕選民之間有不同意見。","reveal vt. 顯示；survey n. 調查 & vt. 調查；deteriorate vi. 惡化；burglar n. 竊賊","n. & vt.","poll","A nationwide poll revealed different opinions among young voters.","原書例句"],["survey","調查；調查／勘察","According to a recent ______, the quality of life in Taiwan is deteriorating.","根據最近的一項調查，臺灣的生活品質正在惡化。","deteriorate vi. 惡化；burglar n. 竊賊","n. & vt.","survey","According to a recent survey, the quality of life in Taiwan is deteriorating.","原書例句"],["investigate","調查（案件）","The police are still ______ the case.","警方仍在調查這個案件。","investigate a case = look into a case；investigation n. 調查；probe vt. 調查","vt.","investigating","The police are still investigating the case.","原書例句"],["automatic","自動的","______ cameras are getting more and more popular these days.","自動照相機現在越來越流行了。","automated a. 自動化的；automatically adv. 自動地；on one’s own 自動地","a.","Automatic","Automatic cameras are getting more and more popular these days.","原書例句"],["automatically","自動地","The dishwasher will stop ______ when the dishes are clean.","碗盤洗乾淨後，洗碗機會自動停止。","on one’s own 自動地","adv.","automatically","The dishwasher will stop automatically when the dishes are clean.","原書例句"],["bullet","子彈","The police fired a ______ at the thief as he ran away.","小偷逃跑時，警方朝他開了一槍。","fire a bullet at... 朝……開槍；the bullet train 子彈列車；a bullet hole 彈孔；bulletin n. 公告","n.","bullet","The police fired a bullet at the thief as he ran away.","原書例句"],["ownership","所有權","Tom and John had a fight over the ______ of the land.","湯姆和約翰為了這塊土地的所有權而爭吵。","own vt. 擁有；owner n. 所有者；主人","n.","ownership","Tom and John had a fight over the ownership of the land.","原書例句"],["similarity","相似（不可數）；相似之處（可數）","There is little ______ between the two sisters.","這兩姊妹幾乎沒有相似之處。","bear similarity to... = bear a resemblance to... 與……相似；similar a. 相似的；resemblance n. 相似；difference n. 差異","n.","similarity","There is little similarity between the two sisters.","原書例句"],["relax","放鬆；休息","Listening to music can help me ______.","聽音樂可以幫助我放鬆。","relaxation n. 放鬆；unwind vt. & vi. 放鬆；relaxed a. 放鬆的／寬鬆的；relaxing a. 令人放鬆的；loose a. 寬鬆的；carefree a. 無憂無慮的","vt. & vi.","relax","Listening to music can help me relax.","原書例句"],["relaxed","放鬆的；寬鬆的","School regulations have become more and more ______.","校規已變得越來越寬鬆。","relaxing a. 令人放鬆的","a.","relaxed","School regulations have become more and more relaxed.","原書例句"],["stir","攪拌；騷動","I ______ my coffee with a spoon.","我用湯匙攪拌咖啡。","stir, stirred, stirred；stir up... 激起……；stir up trouble 惹麻煩；cause a stir 引起騷動；mixture n. 混合物","vt. & n.","stirred","I stirred my coffee with a spoon.","原書例句"],["territory","領土；地盤","It is not uncommon for dogs to fight over food and ______.","狗為了搶食物及地盤而打架是屢見不鮮的事。","territorial a. 領土的；turf n. 地盤","n.","territory","It is not uncommon for dogs to fight over food and territory.","原書例句"],["sip","啜飲；小口喝；一小口","The guy sitting at the bar ______ coffee is my boyfriend.","那個坐在吧檯喝咖啡的男生是我男友。","sip, sipped, sipped；take a sip of... 喝一小口……","vt. & vi. & n.","sipping","The guy sitting at the bar sipping coffee is my boyfriend.","原書例句"],["wisdom","智慧","Aristotle was a man of great ______.","亞里斯多德是一位很有智慧的人。","wise a. 明智的；intelligence n. 智力／智慧；wisdom 偏生活經驗上的智慧，intelligence 偏課業、學術上的智慧","n.","wisdom","Aristotle was a man of great wisdom.","原書例句"],["meanwhile","同時","I’ll do the cooking; ______, you can do the laundry for me.","我來做飯；同時，你可以幫我洗衣服。","meantime adv. & n. 同時；in the meanwhile = in the meantime = meanwhile / meantime","adv. & n.","meanwhile","I’ll do the cooking; meanwhile, you can do the laundry for me.","原書例句"],["wheat","小麥","Flour is made from ______.","麵粉是由小麥製成的。","oat n. 燕麥；barley n. 大麥；rye n. 黑麥；buckwheat n. 蕎麥；grain n. 穀物","n.","wheat","Flour is made from wheat.","原書例句"],["compete","競爭","No computer can ______ with this one in terms of speed.","就速度而言，沒有任何電腦能比得上這一臺。","compete with sb for sth 與某人競爭某物；competition n. 競爭；competitive a. 有競爭力的；competitor n. 競爭者；competent a. 有能力的；competence n. 能力","vi.","compete","No computer can compete with this one in terms of speed.","原書例句"],["ton","噸；大量","The truck weighs over two ______ and cannot cross the bridge.","這輛卡車重超過兩噸，因此不能過橋。","tons of work 許多工作；a lot of work 大量工作","n.","tons","The truck weighs over two tons and cannot cross the bridge.","原書例句"],["pea","豌豆","My favorite dish is roast chicken with ______ and vegetables.","我最喜歡的菜是烤雞配豌豆和蔬菜。","mung bean n. 綠豆；soybean n. 黃豆；adzuki bean n. 紅豆","n.","peas","My favorite dish is roast chicken with peas and vegetables.","原書例句"],["controller","控制器；控制人員","Please press the ______ to turn the machine on.","請按控制器把機器打開。","flight traffic controller 飛航管制員","n.","controller","Please press the controller to turn the machine on.","原書例句"],["county","郡；縣","John grew up in Taichung ______.","約翰在臺中縣長大。","province n. 省；city n. 市","n.","County","John grew up in Taichung County.","原書例句"],["awkward","笨拙的；尷尬的","Sue is quite ______ and falls over a lot.","蘇相當笨拙，常常跌倒。","clumsy a. 笨拙的","a.","awkward","Sue is quite awkward and falls over a lot.","原書例句"],["talent","天才；天分","Mary has a ______ for drawing.","瑪麗有繪畫天分。","have a talent for... 有……天分；be talented in... 在……方面有天分；talented a. 有天分的；gifted a. 有天分的；versatile a. 多才多藝的","n.","talent","Mary has a talent for drawing.","原書例句"],["talented","有天分的","The lack of ______ people makes it hard for the government to carry out the project.","缺乏有才華的人，使政府很難執行這項計畫。","gifted a. 有天分的；versatile a. 多才多藝的","a.","talented","The lack of talented people makes it hard for the government to carry out the project.","原書例句"],["shortly","不久；立刻","Mary successfully found a well-paid job ______ after she graduated from college.","瑪麗大學畢業後不久便順利找到一份待遇優渥的工作。","shortly after / before... 在……之後／之前不久；immediately after / before...","adv.","shortly","Mary successfully found a well-paid job shortly after she graduated from college.","原書例句"],["organize","組織","Ted ______ these workers into a union.","泰德將這些工人組織成一個工會。","organized a. 有組織的；organizer n. 組織者","vt.","organized","Ted organized these workers into a union.","原書例句"],["pronounce","發音；宣判","How do you ______ your last name?","你的姓怎麼發音？","pronunciation n. 發音","vt.","pronounce","How do you pronounce your last name?","原書例句"],["assume","認定；假設；承擔（責任）","Paul ______ that his girlfriend was joking when she said he was ugly.","保羅的女友說他很醜時，他認定她一定是在開玩笑。","assume the burden of... = shoulder the burden of... 負起……責任；assumption n. 假設","vt.","assumed","Paul assumed that his girlfriend was joking when she said he was ugly.","原書例句"]],"U11":[["forever","永遠","After working 20 years in New York, John is planning on going back to his hometown in Minneapolis and staying there ______.","在紐約工作 20 年後，約翰計畫回到明尼亞波利斯的故鄉並永遠住在那裡。","forever and a day 永永遠遠；for good 永久地","adv.","forever","After working 20 years in New York, John is planning on going back to his hometown in Minneapolis and staying there forever.","原書例句"],["temporary","暫時的","The hunter made a ______ shelter out of stone.","獵人用石頭搭了一個臨時住所。","on a temporary basis 暫時地；permanent a. 永久的；temporarily adv. 暫時地；permanently adv. 永久地","a.","temporary","The hunter made a temporary shelter out of stone.","原書例句"],["temporarily","暫時地","After taking the medicine, Amber felt ______ relieved.","吃了藥之後，安柏暫時感到舒坦一些。","relieved a. 感到寬慰的","adv.","temporarily","After taking the medicine, Amber felt temporarily relieved.","原書例句"],["maid","女僕","Having a butler, three ______, and two gardeners to take care of his needs, the millionaire leads a luxurious life.","這個百萬富翁有一個管家、三個女僕及兩個園丁照料他的需求，過著奢華的生活。","servant n. 僕人；butler n. 管家；luxurious a. 奢華的","n.","maids","Having a butler, three maids, and two gardeners to take care of his needs, the millionaire leads a luxurious life.","原書例句"],["resist","抵抗；忍住","How can you ______ chocolate cake? Whenever I see some, I must have a piece.","你怎能抗拒巧克力蛋糕？我每次看到都非吃一塊不可。","cannot resist + V-ing = cannot help + V-ing = cannot help but + V；resistant a. 抵抗的；be resistant to sth；resistance n. 抵抗","vt. & vi.","resist","How can you resist chocolate cake? Whenever I see some, I must have a piece.","原書例句"],["guidance","指導；引導","Under Coach Lee’s ______ and leadership, I’m sure we’ll win the contest.","在李教練的指導與領導下，我相信我們會贏得這場比賽。","under sb’s guidance 在某人指導下；guide vt. 指導；instruction n. 指示；教導","n.","guidance","Under Coach Lee’s guidance and leadership, I’m sure we’ll win the contest.","原書例句"],["accurate","準確的；精確的","Though the clock is old, it is still ______.","這個鐘雖然舊了，仍然很準確。","accuracy n. 準確；precise a. 精確的；inaccurate a. 不準確的","a.","accurate","Though the clock is old, it is still accurate.","原書例句"],["sake","理由；緣故","For the ______ of your health, you should break the habit of smoking immediately.","為了你的健康，你應該立刻戒掉抽菸的習慣。","for the sake of... 為了……；for sb’s sake 為了某人","n.","sake","For the sake of your health, you should break the habit of smoking immediately.","原書例句"],["toss","拋；扔；擲；拋擲","After reading the letter, David crumpled it up and ______ it into the fire.","大衛看完信之後，就把信揉成一團丟到火裡去了。","toss and turn 輾轉反側；a toss of a coin 擲硬幣；throw vt. 丟；crumple vt. 揉皺","vt. & n.","tossed","After reading the letter, David crumpled it up and tossed it into the fire.","原書例句"],["reserve","預訂；保留；儲備；保護區","I’d like to ______ a room for three nights.","我要訂房住三晚。","keep sth in reserve 儲備某物；reservation n. 預訂；reservoir n. 水庫；preserve vt. 保護；保存；book vt. 預訂","vt. & n.","reserve","I’d like to reserve a room for three nights.","原書例句"],["harbor","港口；庇護；心懷","Hong Kong is a ______ city.","香港是個港都。","a harbor city = a port city 港都；harbor a grudge against sb = bear a grudge against sb 對某人懷恨；port n. 港口","n. & vt.","harbor","Hong Kong is a harbor city.","原書例句"],["dock","碼頭；扣除","The ships were all in ______ before the typhoon approached.","颱風接近前，船隻全都停靠在碼頭。","in dock 在碼頭；dock sb’s pay / wages / salary 扣某人的薪資；wharf n. 碼頭","n. & vt.","dock","The ships were all in dock before the typhoon approached.","原書例句"],["trail","跟蹤；拖曳；小徑","The policeman ______ the suspect to the house he lived in.","那名警察跟蹤嫌犯到他住的地方。","trail sb to + 地方 = track/follow sb to + 地方；track n. 軌跡；path n. 小徑；tug vt. 拖拉","vt. & n.","trailed","The policeman trailed the suspect to the house he lived in.","原書例句"],["faint","昏眩的；微弱的；昏倒；昏厥","I didn’t eat anything today and I feel ______ with hunger now.","我今天什麼也沒吃，現在餓得發暈。","feel faint 感到暈眩；not have the faintest/foggiest/slightest idea = have no idea 一點也不知道；pass out 昏倒","a. & vi. & n.","faint","I didn’t eat anything today and I feel faint with hunger now.","原書例句"],["trace","追蹤；查出；痕跡","It isn’t easy to ______ your ancestors, especially your female relatives.","追查祖先並不容易，尤其是女性親屬。","disappear without a trace 消失得無影無蹤；track vt. 追蹤；ancestor n. 祖先","vt. & n.","trace","It isn’t easy to trace your ancestors, especially your female relatives.","原書例句"],["steady","穩定的；使穩定；穩定地；固定交往的情侶","It’s hard to find a ______ job these days.","現在很難找到一份穩定的工作。","steady, steadied, steadied；go steady (with sb) 穩定交往；steadily adv. 不斷地；漸漸地","a. & vt. & adv. & n.","steady","It’s hard to find a steady job these days.","原書例句"],["steadily","不斷地；漸漸地","With the breeze blowing ______ from the window, I couldn’t help but fall asleep.","微風從窗口徐徐吹來，我忍不住睡著了。","progressively / gradually adv. 漸漸地","adv.","steadily","With the breeze blowing steadily from the window, I couldn’t help but fall asleep.","原書例句"],["stable","穩定的","The company is currently ______ and doing well.","這家公司目前狀況穩定，運作良好。","be in stable/critical condition 情況穩定／危急；critical a. 危急的；stabilize vt. 使穩定","a.","stable","The company is currently stable and doing well.","原書例句"],["injury","傷害；損害","It took three weeks for Sam to recover from his sports ______.","山姆花了三週才從運動傷害中復原。","injuries（複數）；injure vt. 傷害；recover from... 從……復原；scandal n. 醜聞；reputation n. 名聲","n.","injury","It took three weeks for Sam to recover from his sports injury.","原書例句"],["dealer","商人；經銷商","Paul has made a lot of money as an antique ______.","保羅當古董商賺了很多錢。","a car dealer 汽車商；an antique dealer 古董商；deal in used cars 從事中古車買賣；merchant / trader n. 商人；trade n. 貿易","n.","dealer","Paul has made a lot of money as an antique dealer.","原書例句"],["admire","欽佩；欣賞","I ______ Justin for his proficiency in English.","賈斯汀的英文造詣令我折服。","admire sb for sth 因某事欽佩某人；admirable a. 令人欽佩的；admiration n. 欽佩；appreciate vt. 欣賞；think highly of... 看得起","vt.","admire","I admire Justin for his proficiency in English.","原書例句"],["heel","腳後跟；鞋跟；替鞋裝跟","With the enemy army hard on his ______, the soldier had no choice but to jump off the cliff.","由於後頭敵軍窮追不捨，這名士兵別無選擇，只好跳下懸崖。","hard on one’s heels 緊追不捨；high heels 高跟鞋；a pair of high heels 一雙高跟鞋；cliff n. 懸崖；gracefully adv. 優雅地","n. & vt.","heels","With the enemy army hard on his heels, the soldier had no choice but to jump off the cliff.","原書例句"],["satisfactory","令人滿意的","I couldn’t get a ______ explanation for what had occurred.","對於所發生的事，我找不到滿意的解釋。","satisfy vt. 使滿意；satisfying a. 令人愉快／滿足的；satisfied a. 滿意的；be satisfied with...；satisfaction n. 滿意","a.","satisfactory","I couldn’t get a satisfactory explanation for what had occurred.","原書例句"],["satisfactorily","令人滿意地","The conference has been progressing ______ so far.","這場會議至今進行得還算令人滿意。","—","adv.","satisfactorily","The conference has been progressing satisfactorily so far.","原書例句"],["splash","潑水；濺水；水花；引起轟動","The baby ______ water on her mother as her mother bathed her.","小寶寶在媽媽幫她洗澡時，潑水到媽媽身上。","splash water on sb；splash about/around 到處潑水；make a splash 引起轟動；sensation n. 轟動；bathe vt. 為……洗澡；debut n. 初次登臺","vi. & vt. & n.","splashed","The baby splashed water on her mother as her mother bathed her.","原書例句"],["impress","使印象深刻；使銘記","I was deeply ______ with the city’s boulevard.","這個城市的林蔭大道令我印象深刻。","be impressed with sth；impress sb with sth = impress sth on/upon sb；impressive a. 令人印象深刻的；impression n. 印象；想法","vt.","impressed","I was deeply impressed with the city’s boulevard.","原書例句"],["melt","融化；使融化；心軟","The sun ______ the ice in the buckets before the party even started.","派對都還沒開始，太陽就把好幾桶的冰塊融化了。","melt away 融化消失；a melting pot 大熔爐；diversity n. 多樣性","vi. & vt.","melted","The sun melted the ice in the buckets before the party even started.","原書例句"],["desirable","適合的；妥當的；值得嚮往的；合意的","That busy corner is a ______ place for a restaurant.","那個車水馬龍的角落很適合開一家餐廳。","It is desirable that + S + (should) + V 最好……；alternative n. 替代方案；wrongdoing n. 不當行為","a.","desirable","That busy corner is a desirable place for a restaurant.","原書例句"],["desire","渴望；慾望","Everyone ______ happiness.","每個人都渴望幸福。","leave nothing to be desired 無可挑剔；leave much to be desired 尚待改進；a desire for...；have a desire to + V","vt. & n.","desires","Everyone desires happiness.","原書例句"],["badly","拙劣地；嚴重地；非常","Kelly plays the piano very ______.","凱莉的鋼琴彈得很差。","need sth badly = be badly in need of sth 非常需要某物","adv.","badly","Kelly plays the piano very badly.","原書例句"],["colony","殖民地；群體","New York was originally a Dutch ______.","紐約原本是荷蘭的殖民地。","colonies（複數）；a colony of ants/bees 一群螞蟻／蜜蜂；colonial a. 殖民地的；colonize vt. 殖民","n.","colony","New York was originally a Dutch colony.","原書例句"],["efficient","有效率的","A boss likes nothing more than a faithful and ______ worker.","老闆最喜歡忠實又有效率的員工。","effective a. 有效的；inefficient a. 無效率的；consume vt. 消耗","a.","efficient","A boss likes nothing more than a faithful and efficient worker.","原書例句"],["stale","不新鮮的；無新意的；令人厭倦的","The man left his wife when he found their marriage had gone ______.","這個男子發現跟太太的婚姻已變得索然無味時，便離開了她。","go stale 變得乏味／沒有興趣；stale bread 不新鮮的麵包；a stale joke 老掉牙的笑話；decayed / flat / boring a.；fresh a. 新鮮的","a.","stale","The man left his wife when he found their marriage had gone stale.","原書例句"],["ambassador","大使（與介詞 to 並用）","Who is the Japanese ______ to South Africa?","日本駐南非大使是誰？","consul n. 領事；diplomat n. 外交官；embassy n. 大使館","n.","ambassador","Who is the Japanese ambassador to South Africa?","原書例句"],["alphabet","字母（總稱）；字母表","There are 26 letters in the English ______.","英文字母表共有 26 個字母。","letter n. 字母；alphabetical a. 按字母順序的","n.","alphabet","There are 26 letters in the English alphabet.","原書例句"],["crab","螃蟹","A ______ has two large claws.","螃蟹有兩隻大螯。","crabbed a. 潦草難讀的；crabbed handwriting 潦草的筆跡；claw n. 螯","n.","crab","A crab has two large claws.","原書例句"],["global","全球的；全世界的","This could become a ______ problem.","這可能成為全球性的問題。","global warming 全球暖化；globe n. 地球；球體","a.","global","This could become a global problem.","原書例句"],["foggy","有霧的","It’s dangerous to drive on ______ days.","在有霧的日子開車很危險。","fog n. 霧；sunny 晴朗的；cloudy 多雲的；rainy 下雨的；snowy 下雪的；windy 有風的","a.","foggy","It’s dangerous to drive on foggy days.","原書例句"],["dumb","啞的；愚笨的","People who can’t speak used to be called “______”; now we call them “mute.”","以前不能說話的人被稱為「dumb」，現在則用「mute」一字形容。","play dumb 裝傻；stupid a. 愚笨的；mute a. 啞的；blind a. 失明的；deaf a. 失聰的；deaf and dumb 又聾又啞","a.","dumb","People who can’t speak used to be called “dumb”; now we call them “mute.”","原書例句"],["pump","抽取；打氣；泵浦","We need to ______ the water out of the basement.","我們必須把水從地下室抽出去。","pump...up / pump up... 打氣；pump sth into... 把……注入……；pumper n. 抽水機","vt. & n.","pump","We need to pump the water out of the basement.","原書例句"],["subtract","減去","______ five from ten, and you’ll get five.","10 減 5 等於 5。","subtract A from B 從 B 減去 A；add vt. 加；plus prep. 加；minus prep. 減／零下／負數；the minus sign 減號；multiply vt. 乘；multiply A by B = multiply A and B；times prep. 乘；divide vt. 除","vt.","Subtract","Subtract five from ten, and you’ll get five.","原書例句"]],"U12":[["capture","捕捉；俘虜；吸引；捕獲","Police have finally ______ the leader of the criminal organization.","警方終於逮捕了犯罪組織的首領。","capture / catch sb’s attention 吸引某人注意；capture the headlines 成為頭條；arrest vt. 逮捕；seize vt. 抓住；apprehend vt. 逮捕；rebel n. 叛軍／反叛者","vt. & n.","captured","Police have finally captured the leader of the criminal organization.","原書例句"],["ambition","野心；抱負","Mike’s ______ is to become the chess champion.","麥克的志向是成為西洋棋冠軍。","drive n. 幹勁；determination n. 決心；ambitious a. 有野心的","n.","ambition","Mike’s ambition is to become the chess champion.","原書例句"],["rely","依賴；依靠","A happy marriage ______ on mutual trust.","幸福的婚姻有賴於彼此的信任。","rely, relied, relied；rely on/upon... = depend on/upon... 依賴……","vi.","relies","A happy marriage relies on mutual trust.","原書例句"],["reliable","可靠的","The weather forecast is not always ______, so you’d better carry an umbrella with you just in case.","天氣預報並不總是可靠，所以你最好隨身帶把傘以防萬一。","dependable a. 可靠的；forecast n. 預報","a.","reliable","The weather forecast is not always reliable, so you’d better carry an umbrella with you just in case.","原書例句"],["holy","神聖的","Nothing is ______ for Paul; he only believes in money.","對保羅而言沒有什麼是神聖的；他只相信金錢。","divine a. 神聖的；sacred a. 神聖的","a.","holy","Nothing is holy for Paul; he only believes in money.","原書例句"],["survivor","倖存者","No ______ were found in this airplane crash.","這起空難中沒有發現任何生還者。","survive vi. & vt. 倖存／存活；survival n. 生存","n.","survivors","No survivors were found in this airplane crash.","原書例句"],["wicked","邪惡的","Snow White’s ______ stepmother is very jealous of her stepdaughter’s beauty.","白雪公主邪惡的繼母非常嫉妒她繼女的美貌。","wickedness n. 邪惡；evil a. 邪惡的；rip sb off 敲某人竹槓","a.","wicked","Snow White’s wicked stepmother is very jealous of her stepdaughter’s beauty.","原書例句"],["innocent","無辜的；天真的","The suspect claimed to be ______ of the robbery, but no one believed him.","嫌犯聲稱自己沒有犯下搶劫案，但沒有人相信他。","be innocent of... 未犯……；innocence n. 清白／天真；be incapable of... 不可能做……","a.","innocent","The suspect claimed to be innocent of the robbery, but no one believed him.","原書例句"],["restrict","限制","Hoping that she could eventually quit smoking, Mary started ______ her smoking to half a pack a day.","希望最後能戒菸，瑪麗開始把每天的吸菸量限制在半包。","restrict A to B 把 A 限制在 B；restricted a. 受限制的；restriction n. 限制；limit vt. 限制；martial law 戒嚴","vt.","restricting","Hoping that she could eventually quit smoking, Mary started restricting her smoking to half a pack a day.","原書例句"],["pause","暫停；停頓","There was a long, embarrassing ______ after Tommy asked a stupid question.","湯米問了一個愚蠢的問題後，出現了一段漫長又尷尬的沉默。","pause to + V 停下來做……；silence n. 沉默；break n. 休息","n. & vi.","pause","There was a long, embarrassing pause after Tommy asked a stupid question.","原書例句"],["darkness","黑暗","It’s very dangerous to drive in such ______ without headlights.","在如此黑暗的情況下不開車燈駕駛非常危險。","dark a. 黑暗的；after dark 天黑後；keep sb in the dark about sth 不讓某人知道某事；power failure 停電","n.","darkness","It’s very dangerous to drive in such darkness without headlights.","原書例句"],["darken","變暗；使變暗","The theater room ______ and then the film began.","戲院內暗了下來，接著電影開始播放。","—","vi. & vt.","darkened","The theater room darkened and then the film began.","原書例句"],["fortune","運氣；財富","Frank always says it’s his good ______ to work with so many brilliant and talented people here in this company.","法蘭克總說，能和公司裡這麼多優秀又有才華的人共事是他的幸運。","make a fortune 發財；cost sb a fortune 花某人一大筆錢；fortunate a. 幸運的；misfortune n. 不幸；a fortune teller 算命師；fate n. 命運；superb a. 極佳的","n.","fortune","Frank always says it’s his good fortune to work with so many brilliant and talented people here in this company.","原書例句"],["remote","偏遠的；關係疏遠的；可能性極小的","No gas station can be found in such a ______ town.","在這麼偏遠的小鎮找不到加油站。","a remote control 遙控器；a remote relative 遠親；a remote chance 極小的可能；distant a. 遙遠的；color-blind a. 色盲的","a.","remote","No gas station can be found in such a remote town.","原書例句"],["assist","協助","I ______ Mom in doing the housework on weekends.","我週末幫媽媽做家事。","assist sb in + V-ing = help sb (to) V 幫助某人做……；assistance n. 協助；come to sb’s assistance 幫助某人；assistant n. 助理 & a. 助理的","vt. & vi.","assist","I assist Mom in doing the housework on weekends.","原書例句"],["assistance","協助","If everybody ______, the job will get done quickly.","如果每個人都幫忙，工作很快就會完成。","come to sb’s assistance 幫助某人","n.","assists","If everybody assists, the job will get done quickly.","原書例句"],["assistant","助理；助理的","The boss always hires attractive personal ______.","老闆總是雇用外表亮眼的私人助理。","personal assistant 私人助理；assistant manager 副理","n. & a.","assistants","The boss always hires attractive personal assistants.","原書例句"],["scatter","撒；使散開；散開；零星的一群","You can ______ some sand on the ice so you don’t slip.","你可以在冰上撒些沙，這樣就不會滑倒。","spread vt. & vi. 散布；slip vi. 滑倒；mob n. 暴民；mobster n. 幫派分子","vt. & vi. & n.","scatter","You can scatter some sand on the ice so you don’t slip.","原書例句"],["regional","地區的；區域的","Economic recession in these countries is partly caused by ______ conflicts.","這些國家的經濟衰退有一部分是區域衝突所造成的。","region n. 地區；recession n. 經濟衰退；zone n. 區域 & vt. 劃分區域；area n. 地區；district n. 區域","a.","regional","Economic recession in these countries is partly caused by regional conflicts.","原書例句"],["zone","區域；將……劃為特定用途區","Louise volunteered to go to the war ______ to report on the war.","露易絲自願前往戰區報導戰爭。","war zone 戰區；zone sth for... 將某地劃作……用途","n. & vt.","zone","Louise volunteered to go to the war zone to report on the war.","原書例句"],["grab","抓住；攫取","I ______ a bite to eat this morning and then went to work.","我今天早上隨便吃了點東西就去上班了。","grab, grabbed, grabbed；grab a bite to eat 隨便吃點東西；make a grab for sth 伸手搶某物；seize vt. 抓住","vt. & n.","grabbed","I grabbed a bite to eat this morning and then went to work.","原書例句"],["grasp","抓牢；理解；緊握","A man in a black suit ______ Paul by the arm and shook him violently, telling him to stay out of their business.","一名穿黑西裝的男子抓住保羅的手臂猛烈搖晃，要他別管他們的事。","grasp sb by the arm 抓住某人的手臂；grasp the meaning of... 理解……的意思","vt. & n.","grasped","A man in a black suit grasped Paul by the arm and shook him violently, telling him to stay out of their business.","原書例句"],["horn","角；喇叭","Some goats have large and magnificent ______.","有些山羊長著又大又漂亮的角。","honk the horn 按喇叭；play/blow one’s own horn/trumpet 自吹自擂；trumpet n. 小號；loudspeaker n. 擴音器","n.","horns","Some goats have large and magnificent horns.","原書例句"],["whistle","口哨；哨子；吹口哨；鳴笛","I knew Uncle George was around when I heard that tuneless ______ of his.","當我聽到喬治叔叔那不成調的口哨聲時，就知道他在附近。","blow a whistle 吹哨；whistle at sb 對某人吹口哨；tuneless a. 不成調的；referee n. 裁判","n. & vi. & vt.","whistle","I knew Uncle George was around when I heard that tuneless whistle of his.","原書例句"],["dine","用餐","Who are you going to ______ out with tonight?","你今晚要和誰出去吃飯？","dine in 在家用餐；dine out 外出用餐","vi.","dine","Who are you going to dine out with tonight?","原書例句"],["suburb","郊區","Judy used to live in the ______ of London.","茱蒂以前住在倫敦郊區。","in the suburbs of... 在……郊區；outskirts n. 郊區；urban a. 都市的；urbanize vt. 都市化；urbanization n. 都市化；rural a. 鄉村的","n.","suburbs","Judy used to live in the suburbs of London.","原書例句"],["strip","剝去；脫掉；長條","We’ll have to ______ the posters off the wall before we start painting.","開始粉刷前，我們得先把牆上的海報撕下來。","strip, stripped, stripped；strip sb of sth 剝奪某人某物；strip off = take off one’s clothes 脫衣服；stripe n. 條紋；naked a. 裸體的","vt. & vi. & n.","strip","We’ll have to strip the posters off the wall before we start painting.","原書例句"],["graduate","畢業；畢業生；研究所的","Mary ______ in history from Yale University last year.","瑪麗去年從耶魯大學歷史系畢業。","graduate from... 從……畢業；graduate school 研究所；graduate student 研究生；undergraduate student 大學生；graduation n. 畢業；undergraduate n. & a. 大學生／大學部的","vi. & n. & a.","graduated","Mary graduated in history from Yale University last year.","原書例句"],["coconut","椰子","______ milk is an important ingredient of Thai cuisine.","椰奶是泰國料理的重要材料。","ingredient n. 成分；材料；cuisine n. 菜餚／料理","n.","Coconut","Coconut milk is an important ingredient of Thai cuisine.","原書例句"],["hesitate","猶豫","Katherine is still ______ about whether or not to marry Kevin.","凱瑟琳仍在猶豫是否要嫁給凱文。","hesitate about/over sth 對某事猶豫；don’t hesitate to + V 儘管做……；hesitant a. 猶豫的；hesitation n. 猶豫","vi.","hesitating","Katherine is still hesitating about whether or not to marry Kevin.","原書例句"],["fist","拳頭；用拳頭打","The angry driver shook his ______ at the slow-moving pedestrian.","生氣的駕駛對那名走得很慢的行人揮拳。","shake sb’s fist at... 對……揮拳","n. & vt.","fist","The angry driver shook his fist at the slow-moving pedestrian.","原書例句"],["wrist","手腕","I sprained my ______ bowling.","我打保齡球時扭傷了手腕。","a wristband 腕帶；a knee band 護膝","n.","wrist","I sprained my wrist bowling.","原書例句"],["elbow","手肘；用手肘推擠","Jenny hurt her ______ when playing tennis.","珍妮打網球時傷到了手肘。","elbow one’s way 擠出一條路；elbow sb out of the way 用手肘把某人推開","n. & vt.","elbow","Jenny hurt her elbow when playing tennis.","原書例句"],["buzz","嗡嗡叫；忙碌穿梭；嗡嗡聲；打電話","Bees were ______ around the flowers in the garden.","蜜蜂在花園的花朵四周嗡嗡飛舞。","buzz around 四處忙碌；give sb a buzz = give sb a call/ring = call sb (up) 打電話給某人","vi. & n.","buzzing","Bees were buzzing around the flowers in the garden.","原書例句"],["hum","哼唱；發出嗡嗡聲；嗡嗡聲","Jeff was ______ a song while taking a shower.","傑夫洗澡時哼著一首歌。","hum, hummed, hummed","vt. & vi. & n.","humming","Jeff was humming a song while taking a shower.","原書例句"],["waterfall","瀑布","The boat went over the ______, and no one survived.","船越過瀑布墜下，無人生還。","cascade n. 瀑布","n.","waterfall","The boat went over the waterfall, and no one survived.","原書例句"],["flood","洪水；淹沒；氾濫","The ______ ruined hundreds of houses and claimed twenty lives.","洪水摧毀了數百棟房屋，並奪走二十條人命。","a flood of... 大量……；be flooded with... 湧入大量……；resident n. 居民","n. & vt. & vi.","flood","The flood ruined hundreds of houses and claimed twenty lives.","原書例句"],["cafeteria","自助餐廳；學校／公司餐廳","I’ve heard that the ______ over there has excellent food.","我聽說那邊的自助餐廳餐點很棒。","café n. 咖啡館","n.","cafeteria","I’ve heard that the cafeteria over there has excellent food.","原書例句"],["dawn","黎明；開始；開始明白","The couple got up at ______ to watch the sunrise together.","這對夫妻黎明時起床，一起看日出。","at dawn 在黎明；since the dawn of history 自有歷史以來；it dawns on sb that... 某人開始明白……；daybreak n. 黎明；at daybreak 在黎明；immortality n. 永生","n. & vi.","dawn","The couple got up at dawn to watch the sunrise together.","原書例句"],["dusk","黃昏","We returned home before ______.","我們在黃昏前回到家。","at dusk 在黃昏","n.","dusk","We returned home before ______.","練習新編句"],["bind","綁；束縛","I think you should ______ the old papers into a bundle before putting them outside.","我想你應該先把舊報紙綁成一捆，再放到外面。","bind, bound, bound；bind A to B 把 A 綁在 B；bound a. 被束縛的","vt.","bind","I think you should bind the old papers into a bundle before putting them outside.","原書例句"],["dishonest","不誠實的","I can see Tom has been doing things in a ______ manner.","我看得出來湯姆一直以不誠實的方式做事。","untruthful a. 不誠實的；deceitful a. 欺騙的；honest a. 誠實的","a.","dishonest","I can see Tom has been doing things in a dishonest manner.","原書例句"],["operation","操作；手術","Are you familiar with the ______ of this machine?","你熟悉這部機器的操作嗎？","perform an operation on... = perform surgery on... 為……動手術；surgery n. 手術；operate vt. 操作／動手術；operator n. 操作者；operational a. 操作上的","n.","operation","Are you familiar with the operation of this machine?","原書例句"],["crane","起重機；鶴；伸長脖子","You have to get a license to operate a ______.","你必須取得執照才能操作起重機。","crane one’s neck 伸長脖子；operate a crane 操作起重機；egret n. 白鷺鷥","n. & vi.","crane","You have to get a license to operate a crane.","原書例句"],["basement","地下室","During the storm, everyone went to the ______ for safety.","暴風雨期間，每個人都到地下室避難。","cellar n. 地窖／地下室","n.","basement","During the storm, everyone went to the basement for safety.","原書例句"],["bet","打賭；賭注","I ______ you Betty is still in the office.","我敢說貝蒂還在辦公室裡。","bet, bet, bet；I bet... 我敢說……；bet money on sth 在某事上下注；place/put a bet (on sth) 下賭注；inexperienced a. 缺乏經驗的","vt. & n.","bet","I bet you Betty is still in the office.","原書例句"]],"U13":[["cast","投；擲；投票；演員陣容；石膏模","James ______ the die to start the game.","詹姆士擲骰子開始遊戲。","cast, cast, cast；cast the die 擲骰子；cast a ballot / vote 投票；cast a look at... 看……一眼；throw vt. 投、擲；plot n. 劇情；plaster cast 石膏模；heal vi. 癒合","vt. & n.","cast","James cast the die to start the game.","原書例句"],["squeeze","擠；榨；擠入；擠壓；少量","Don’t ______ your pimples unless you want scars on your face.","除非你想在臉上留下疤痕，否則不要擠青春痘。","squeeze into... 擠進……；squeeze sth out 擠出某物；squeeze sb’s hand 握／捏某人的手；pimple n. 青春痘；scar n. 疤痕；press vt. 壓","vt. & vi. & n.","squeeze","Don’t squeeze your pimples unless you want scars on your face.","原書例句"],["twist","扭；轉；扭曲；扭轉","I ______ my head around to see what was going on.","我轉過頭去看發生了什麼事。","twist one’s head around 轉頭；twist the truth 扭曲事實；twist sb’s words 曲解某人的話；distort vt. 扭曲；sprain vt. 扭傷","vt. & vi. & n.","twisted","I twisted my head around to see what was going on.","原書例句"],["award","獎；獎項；授予","Many celebrities attended the ______ ceremony.","許多名人出席了頒獎典禮。","prize n. 獎品；award sb sth 頒給某人某物；be awarded sth 被頒予某物；celebrity n. 名人","n. & vt.","awards","Many celebrities attended the awards ceremony.","原書例句"],["medal","獎章；獎牌","Officer Smith was given a ______ for his brave deeds.","史密斯警官因英勇事蹟而獲頒一枚獎章。","a gold medal 金牌；a silver medal 銀牌；a bronze medal 銅牌","n.","medal","Officer Smith was given a medal for his brave deeds.","原書例句"],["drip","滴；滴下；滴水聲","Water ______ from my ceiling during rainstorms.","下雨時，水從我家的天花板滴下來。","drip, dripped, dripped；drop vi. & n. 滴落／水滴；dribble vi. & n. 滴下／細流","vt. & vi. & n.","dripped","Water dripped from my ceiling during rainstorms.","原書例句"],["journey","旅行；旅程；旅行","Peter has decided to go on a ______ to southern Taiwan next month.","彼得已決定下個月到臺灣南部旅行。","trip n. 旅行；journey to + 地方；go on a journey / trip to...；take a trip to...；travel to...","n. & vi.","journey","Peter has decided to go on a journey to southern Taiwan next month.","原書例句"],["client","客戶","We can’t afford to lose Mr. Johnson. He’s a very important ______ of ours.","我們不能失去強森先生，他是我們非常重要的客戶。","customer n. 顧客","n.","client","We can’t afford to lose Mr. Johnson. He’s a very important client of ours.","原書例句"],["precious","珍貴的；寶貴的","Time is ______, and we cannot afford to waste it.","時間很寶貴，我們浪費不起。","valuable a. 有價值的","a.","precious","Time is precious, and we cannot afford to waste it.","原書例句"],["jet","噴射機；搭噴射機快速前往；噴射","Mr. Stevenson is so rich that he even has his own ______.","史蒂文森先生非常有錢，甚至擁有自己的噴射機。","jet, jetted, jetted；a passenger jet 客機；a jet fighter 噴射戰鬥機；jet lag 時差；jet off to... 搭機快速前往……","n. & vi. & vt.","jet","Mr. Stevenson is so rich that he even has his own jet.","原書例句"],["mystery","神祕；謎","The reasons behind Dr. Todd’s murder have remained a ______ for many years.","陶德博士遭謀殺的原因多年來一直是個謎。","mysterious a. 神祕的；riddle n. 謎","n.","mystery","The reasons behind Dr. Todd’s murder have remained a mystery for many years.","原書例句"],["mankind","人類（總稱）","Television is one of the most popular inventions in the history of ______.","電視是人類歷史上最普及的發明之一。","mankind 中的 man 指人類；human being n. 人；humankind n. 人類；benefit from... 從……受益","n.","mankind","Television is one of the most popular inventions in the history of mankind.","原書例句"],["humankind","人類（總稱）","All ______ will benefit from the scientist’s discovery.","全人類都將從這位科學家的發現中受益。","與 mankind 同義","n.","humankind","All humankind will benefit from the scientist’s discovery.","原書例句"],["campus","校園","Mary didn’t live on ______ while in college. She lived off campus with her aunt and uncle.","瑪麗念大學時沒有住校，她和叔叔、嬸嬸住在校外。","on campus 在校園內；off campus 在校園外","n.","campus","Mary didn’t live on campus while in college. She lived off campus with her aunt and uncle.","原書例句"],["scream","尖叫；尖叫聲","It is horrible to hear someone ______ in the middle of the night.","半夜聽到有人尖叫是很可怕的。","shriek vi. 尖叫；shout vi. & n. 喊叫；shout for help 大聲求救；shout at sb 對某人大叫","vi. & n.","screaming","It is horrible to hear someone screaming in the middle of the night.","原書例句"],["roar","吼叫；咆哮；吼叫聲","The ______ of a lion can be quite scary.","獅子的吼叫聲可能相當嚇人。","roar with laughter 放聲大笑","vi. & n.","roar","The roar of a lion can be quite scary.","原書例句"],["yell","大叫；叫喊聲","Dad ______ at me when I made the same mistake again.","我又犯同樣的錯誤時，爸爸對我大吼。","yell at sb 對某人大叫；let out a yell 發出叫喊；frustration n. 挫折","vi. & n.","yelled","Dad yelled at me when I made the same mistake again.","原書例句"],["harm","傷害；損害","Smoking will do you great ______. Why don’t you just quit?","抽菸對你有很大的傷害。你為什麼不乾脆戒掉呢？","do sb harm = do harm to sb 傷害某人；do sb good 對某人有益；wouldn’t harm / hurt a fly 心地善良、連蒼蠅也不傷害","n. & vt.","harm","Smoking will do you great harm. Why don’t you just quit?","原書例句"],["harmful","有害的","Anything can be ______ when carried to extremes.","任何事情做得過火都可能有害。","be harmful / detrimental to sb / sth 對某人／某物有害；detrimental a. 有害的；extreme n. 極端；carry sth to extremes 把某事做得過火","a.","harmful","Anything can be harmful when carried to extremes.","原書例句"],["budget","預算；編列預算；安排（時間／金錢）","We have to carry out the project on a tight ______.","我們必須在預算有限的情況下執行這項計畫。","on a tight budget 預算吃緊；budget one’s time / money 安排時間／金錢","n. & vt.","budget","We have to carry out the project on a tight budget.","原書例句"],["flame","火焰；燃燒；因強烈情緒而發亮","The barn was already in ______ by the time the fire engine arrived.","消防車抵達時，穀倉已經陷入火海。","be in flames 著火；flame with envy 嫉妒得兩眼冒火；inflame vt. 使燃燒／激起；fire n. 火；arouse vt. 激起","n. & vi.","flames","The barn was already in flames by the time the fire engine arrived.","原書例句"],["wipe","擦拭；消滅；擦拭","The waitress ______ the table with a damp cloth.","女服務生用濕布擦桌子。","wipe sth out 消滅／徹底摧毀","vt. & n.","wiped","The waitress wiped the table with a damp cloth.","原書例句"],["angel","天使","Helen has a perfect voice and sings just like an ______.","海倫有一副完美的嗓音，唱起歌來就像天使一樣。","angle n. 角度；角","n.","angel","Helen has a perfect voice and sings just like an angel.","原書例句"],["devil","魔鬼","Stay away from that guy! He is a real ______!","離那個傢伙遠一點！他真是個惡魔！","Speak of the devil, and he shall appear. 說曹操，曹操到。","n.","devil","Stay away from that guy! He is a real devil!","原書例句"],["barrel","桶；槍管","These oak ______ are used for wine storage.","這些橡木桶是用來儲藏葡萄酒的。","barrel 亦可作量詞；storage n. 儲藏","n.","barrels","These oak barrels are used for wine storage.","原書例句"],["bucket","水桶","Can you help me fill these ______ with water?","你可以幫我把這些水桶裝滿水嗎？","kick the bucket 翹辮子／死掉；be alive and kicking 活蹦亂跳","n.","buckets","Can you help me fill these buckets with water?","原書例句"],["pail","桶；提桶","It took several ______ of water to put out the fire.","用了好幾桶水才把火撲滅。","pale a. 蒼白的","n.","pails","It took several pails of water to put out the fire.","原書例句"],["clue","線索；提示","Do you have any ______ to the robber’s whereabouts?","你有任何關於那名搶匪下落的線索嗎？","do not have a clue = have no idea 一點也不知道；clue to / about / as to... 關於……的線索；whereabouts n. 下落","n.","clues","Do you have any clues to the robber’s whereabouts?","原書例句"],["hint","暗示；提示；暗示","Tammy hoped Steven would take the ______ and stop bothering her.","譚米希望史蒂芬能領會暗示，不要再煩她。","take / get a/the hint 領會暗示；hint that... 暗示……；hint at... 暗示……；suggest vt. 暗示／建議","n. & vt. & vi.","hint","Tammy hoped Steven would take the hint and stop bothering her.","原書例句"],["eager","渴望的；熱切的","Mary is ______ to start her new job.","瑪麗迫不及待想開始她的新工作。","be eager to + V = be longing to + V = be dying to + V；be eager for + sth = be longing for + sth = be dying for + sth","a.","eager","Mary is eager to start her new job.","原書例句"],["spin","紡；旋轉；編造；旋轉","The factory has a reputation for ______ fine wool yarn.","這家工廠以紡製精細羊毛紗線聞名。","spin, spun, spun；spin a story / yarn 編故事；yarn n. 紗線；spin around 旋轉；rotate vt. & vi. 旋轉；reputation n. 名聲","vt. & vi. & n.","spinning","The factory has a reputation for spinning fine wool yarn.","原書例句"],["romantic","浪漫的；不切實際的；浪漫主義者","Many girls have ______ ideas about becoming a model.","許多女孩對成為模特兒抱有浪漫的想法。","romance n. 浪漫故事／戀情；impractical a. 不切實際的；dreamy a. 夢幻的；realistic a. 實際的；indulge in... 沉迷於……","a. & n.","romantic","Many girls have romantic ideas about becoming a model.","原書例句"],["passion","熱情；酷愛","Amy has ______ for clothes. She always wears stylish things.","艾咪熱愛服飾，她總是穿著時髦的衣服。","have a passion for... 熱愛……；passionate a. 熱情的；stylish a. 時髦的","n.","passion","Amy has passion for clothes. She always wears stylish things.","原書例句"],["warmth","溫暖","Seeing Jane smile brings me ______ and makes my day.","看到珍的微笑讓我感到溫暖，也讓我一整天心情愉快。","warm a. 溫暖的；make sb’s day 使某人一天都很開心","n.","warmth","Seeing Jane smile brings me warmth and makes my day.","原書例句"],["adventure","冒險；冒險經歷","That old man often tells us of his many ______ in Africa.","那位老人常告訴我們他在非洲的許多冒險經歷。","venture n. & vt. & vi. 冒險；Nothing ventured, nothing gained. 不入虎穴，焉得虎子。","n.","adventures","That old man often tells us of his many adventures in Africa.","原書例句"],["adventurous","愛冒險的；大膽的","George is not very ______ when it comes to food.","說到食物，喬治並不是很勇於嘗試。","daring a. 大膽的；risk-taking a. 愛冒險的","a.","adventurous","George is not very adventurous when it comes to food.","原書例句"],["studio","錄音室；工作室","This recording ______ is fully equipped.","這間錄音室設備齊全。","recording studio 錄音室；warehouse n. 倉庫","n.","studio","This recording studio is fully equipped.","原書例句"],["verse","韻文；詩","The poet expressed his ideas in ______.","這位詩人以詩表達他的想法。","version n. 版本；versed a. 精通的；be versed in... 精通……","n.","verse","The poet expressed his ideas in verse.","原書例句"],["bride","新娘","Kent introduced us to his young ______.","肯特把他年輕的新娘介紹給我們。","bridegroom n. 新郎（= groom）","n.","bride","Kent introduced us to his young bride.","原書例句"],["bore","使厭煩；令人厭煩的人／事物","People who talk too much about themselves ______ everyone else.","太常談論自己的人會讓其他人感到厭煩。","bore sb to death / tears 使某人無聊至極；bored a. 感到厭煩的；boring a. 令人厭煩的；boredom n. 無聊","vt. & n.","bore","People who talk too much about themselves bore everyone else.","原書例句"],["presence","出席；在場；存在","Your ______ is requested at this afternoon’s meeting.","敬請您出席今天下午的會議。","in the presence of... 當著……的面；present a. 在場的；absence n. 缺席","n.","presence","Your presence is requested at this afternoon’s meeting.","原書例句"],["doughnut","甜甜圈（= donut）","We ate ______ for breakfast this morning.","我們今天早上早餐吃甜甜圈。","—","n.","doughnuts","We ate doughnuts for breakfast this morning.","原書例句"],["rush","衝；匆忙；熱潮；尖峰時間","Everyone ______ into the street when a fire broke out.","火災發生時，每個人都衝到街上。","rush into... 衝進……；rush out of... 衝出……；be rushed to... 被緊急送往……；in a rush = in a hurry = in haste 匆忙；rush hour 尖峰時間；rash a. 魯莽的","vi. & n.","rushed","Everyone rushed into the street when a fire broke out.","原書例句"],["bitter","苦的；痛苦的；懷恨的","Some Chinese medicines taste quite ______.","有些中藥嚐起來相當苦。","be bitter about... 對……憤憤不平；bitterly adv. 痛苦地／強烈地；bitterly criticize sb 嚴厲批評某人；bitterness n. 苦味／痛苦","a.","bitter","Some Chinese medicines taste quite bitter.","原書例句"],["bookcase","書櫃","Lisa pulled out a book from her ______.","麗莎從書櫃裡抽出一本書。","bookshelf n. 書架","n.","bookcase","Lisa pulled out a book from her bookcase.","原書例句"]],"U14":[["swear","發誓；說髒話","I ______ to God that I didn’t take your pen!","我對天發誓我沒有拿你的筆！","swear, swore, sworn；swear to God that... 對天發誓……；be sworn in as... 宣誓就任……","vi. & vt.","swear","I swear to God that I didn’t take your pen!","原書例句"],["parade","遊行；遊行隊伍","Those soldiers were ______ in front of the presidential palace.","那些士兵正在總統府前遊行。","be on parade 遊行；march vi. & n. 行進／遊行；be on the march 行進中","vi. & n.","parading","Those soldiers were parading in front of the presidential palace.","原書例句"],["march","行進；遊行","Thousands of demonstrators ______ towards City Hall at 2:00 yesterday afternoon.","數千名示威者昨天下午兩點朝市政府前進。","be on the march 行進中","vi. & n.","marched","Thousands of demonstrators marched towards City Hall at 2:00 yesterday afternoon.","原書例句"],["cigarette","香菸","Please put out your ______, sir. This is a non-smoking area.","先生，請把香菸熄掉。這裡是禁菸區。","be addicted to cigarettes / smoking 對香菸／吸菸上癮；get addicted to cigarettes / smoking 染上菸癮；tobacco n. 菸草；cigar n. 雪茄","n.","cigarette","Please put out your cigarette, sir. This is a non-smoking area.","原書例句"],["plastic","塑膠；塑膠的","Bags made of ______ are harmful to the environment.","塑膠製的袋子對環境有害。","a plastic bag 塑膠袋；plastic surgery 整形手術；leather n. 皮革；a leather coat 皮衣；leather boots 皮靴","n. & a.","plastic","Bags made of plastic are harmful to the environment.","原書例句"],["leather","皮革","______ coats are back in fashion.","皮衣又流行起來了。","a leather coat 皮衣；leather boots 皮靴","n.","Leather","Leather coats are back in fashion.","原書例句"],["float","漂浮；浮板","The first step in learning how to swim is to learn how to ______.","學游泳的第一步是學會如何漂浮。","sink vi. 沉；float on... 漂浮在……上","vi. & n.","float","The first step in learning how to swim is to learn how to float.","原書例句"],["pole","桿；竿子；磁極","Place the positive ______ of the battery in the toy first and then the negative one.","先把電池的正極放進玩具，再放負極。","a fishing pole / rod 釣竿；be poles apart 截然不同；North Pole 北極；South Pole 南極","n.","pole","Place the positive pole of the battery in the toy first and then the negative one.","原書例句"],["casual","偶然的；無心的；非正式的（指服裝）","Peter and Bruce’s long friendship began with a ______ meeting at a party.","彼得和布魯斯長久的友誼始於一次派對上的偶遇。","casual wear 休閒服；informal a. 非正式的；formal a. 正式的；casually adv. 偶然地／隨便地","a.","casual","Peter and Bruce’s long friendship began with a casual meeting at a party.","原書例句"],["casually","偶然地；隨便地","On weekends, Jenny strolls ______ in the park near where I live.","週末時，珍妮會悠閒地在我住家附近的公園散步。","—","adv.","casually","On weekends, Jenny strolls casually in the park near where I live.","原書例句"],["doubtful","懷疑的；可疑的","I was ______ about the old man’s good intentions.","我對那位老人的善意有所懷疑。","be doubtful about... 對……感到懷疑；doubt n. & vt. 懷疑；without a doubt 毫無疑問；doubtfully adv. 懷疑地；unsure / uncertain / unconvinced a. 不確定的；doubtless a. & adv. 無疑的／必定地","a.","doubtful","I was doubtful about the old man’s good intentions.","原書例句"],["doubtless","無疑的；必定地","Bill has been studying so hard that he will ______ pass the exam.","比爾一直這麼用功讀書，他無疑會通過考試。","—","a. & adv.","doubtless","Bill has been studying so hard that he will doubtless pass the exam.","原書例句"],["stuff","東西（不可數）；填滿","Leave your ______ in the car while we check if the hotel has any rooms available.","我們查看旅館是否有空房時，把你的東西留在車上。","be stuffed with... 塞滿……；stuffy a. 悶熱的／不通風的","n. & vt.","stuff","Leave your stuff in the car while we check if the hotel has any rooms available.","原書例句"],["bare","空的；赤裸的；露出","Our fridge is ______, so we must do some shopping this afternoon.","我們的冰箱空空如也，所以今天下午得去買些東西。","barehanded a. 赤手空拳的；barefoot / barefooted a. 赤腳的；barely adv. 幾乎不","a. & vt.","bare","Our fridge is bare, so we must do some shopping this afternoon.","原書例句"],["barely","幾乎不","She could ______ hear the speaker from the back row.","她坐在後排幾乎聽不見講者的聲音。","hardly / scarcely adv. 幾乎不","adv.","barely","She could ______ hear the speaker from the back row.","練習新編句"],["tourist","觀光客；遊客；觀光的","This scenic spot draws tens of thousands of ______ every month.","這個風景區每個月吸引數萬名遊客。","tourist attraction 觀光景點；tour n. 旅行／遊覽；be on a tour of a city 在城市觀光；tourism n. 觀光業","n. & a.","tourists","This scenic spot draws tens of thousands of tourists every month.","原書例句"],["tourism","觀光業","The country heavily depends on ______ to support its economy.","這個國家高度依賴觀光業來支撐經濟。","—","n.","tourism","The country heavily depends on tourism to support its economy.","原書例句"],["leap","跳躍；跳","You’d better look before you ______; haste in this case may cause undesired results.","你最好三思而後行；在這種情況下倉促行事可能造成不良結果。","leap, leapt, leapt；by leaps and bounds 突飛猛進；a leap year 閏年；jump vi. & n. 跳","vi. & n.","leap","You’d better look before you leap; haste in this case may cause undesired results.","原書例句"],["fade","褪色；漸弱","General MacArthur once said, “Old soldiers never die; they just ______ away.”","麥克阿瑟將軍曾說：「老兵不死，只是逐漸凋零。」","fade away 漸漸消失；fade out 淡出；vanish vi. 消失；disappear vi. 消失","vi.","fade","General MacArthur once said, “Old soldiers never die; they just fade away.”","原書例句"],["vanish","消失","Many ancient civilizations have ______ mysteriously.","許多古代文明已神祕地消失。","disappear vi. 消失","vi.","vanished","Many ancient civilizations have vanished mysteriously.","原書例句"],["cabin","（森林或山中的）小木屋；船艙；機艙","Nobody lives in that log ______.","沒有人住在那間原木小屋裡。","the passenger cabin 客艙；hut n. 小屋","n.","cabin","Nobody lives in that log cabin.","原書例句"],["hut","小屋","Jim built a wooden ______ all by himself.","吉姆獨力蓋了一間木屋。","—","n.","hut","Jim built a wooden hut all by himself.","原書例句"],["powder","粉末；磨粉","Slowly grind these ingredients into a ______.","慢慢把這些材料磨成粉末。","powder one’s face 在臉上撲粉；pill n. 藥丸；tablet n. 藥片／平板電腦","n. & vt.","powder","Slowly grind these ingredients into a powder.","原書例句"],["pill","藥丸","Judy has to rely on sleeping ______ in order to fall asleep.","茱蒂必須靠安眠藥才能入睡。","—","n.","pills","Judy has to rely on sleeping pills in order to fall asleep.","原書例句"],["tablet","藥片；平板電腦","The doctor gave me some ______ to help control my frequent headaches.","醫生給了我一些藥片來幫助控制我頻繁的頭痛。","take a tablet 服用一顆藥片；tablet computer 平板電腦","n.","tablets","The doctor gave me some tablets to help control my frequent headaches.","原書例句"],["deck","甲板","Let’s go up on ______ and take a look at the night view.","我們到甲板上看看夜景吧。","—","n.","deck","Let’s go up on deck and take a look at the night view.","原書例句"],["limb","四肢之一","In that country, many children lost ______ because of stepping on landmines.","在那個國家，許多孩子因踩到地雷而失去四肢。","limb n.（樹的）大枝；lose a limb 失去一肢","n.","limbs","In that country, many children lost limbs because of stepping on landmines.","原書例句"],["mayor","市長","My ______ offered his condolences to the victims of the earthquake.","我的市長向地震受害者表達慰問。","major n. 少校／主修；county magistrate n. 縣長","n.","mayor","My mayor offered his condolences to the victims of the earthquake.","原書例句"],["disk","光碟片（= disc）","Jimmy took out a ______ and put it into his computer’s disk drive.","吉米拿出一片光碟，放進電腦的光碟機裡。","a disk drive 光碟機","n.","disk","Jimmy took out a disk and put it into his computer’s disk drive.","原書例句"],["strategy","策略","We’re working on new marketing ______ for the product.","我們正在研擬這項產品的新行銷策略。","strategic a. 策略的；strategic weapons 戰略武器","n.","strategies","We’re working on new marketing strategies for the product.","原書例句"],["crawl","爬；緩慢的行進","A child ______ before it learns to walk.","小孩學會走路之前會先爬。","creep vi. 爬行／躡手躡腳地走","vi. & n.","crawls","A child crawls before it learns to walk.","原書例句"],["barn","穀倉","The farmer keeps his cows and horses in the ______.","農夫把牛和馬養在穀倉裡。","hay n. 乾草；hit the hay 上床睡覺；haystack n. 乾草堆","n.","barn","The farmer keeps his cows and horses in the barn.","原書例句"],["hay","乾草","The homeless man was found sleeping on the ______ in the barn.","那名遊民被發現睡在穀倉的乾草上。","hit the hay 上床睡覺；haystack n. 乾草堆","n.","hay","The homeless man was found sleeping on the hay in the barn.","原書例句"],["routine","慣例；例行公事；例行公事的","Reading English papers in the morning has become part of my daily ______.","早上閱讀英文報紙已成為我日常生活的一部分。","a daily routine 每天的例行公事","n. & a.","routine","Reading English papers in the morning has become part of my daily routine.","原書例句"],["carpet","地毯；在……鋪地毯","Until the floods hit down the ______, Mary’s house was beautiful.","在洪水毀壞地毯之前，瑪麗的房子很漂亮。","be carpeted with... 鋪滿……；rug n. 小地毯；cleaner n. 清潔工／清潔劑；cleaner’s / dry cleaner 乾洗店；cooker n. 炊具；rice cooker 電鍋；cupboard n. 碗櫃；hammer n. 鐵鎚；hammer / drive a nail into... 把釘子釘入……","n. & vt.","carpet","Until the floods hit down the carpet, Mary’s house was beautiful.","原書例句"],["cleaner","清潔工；清潔劑","My boss was once a street ______ when he was young.","我老闆年輕時曾是一名街道清潔工。","the dry cleaner’s 乾洗店","n.","cleaner","My boss was once a street cleaner when he was young.","原書例句"],["cooker","炊具","Almost every Chinese family has a rice ______.","幾乎每個華人家庭都有電鍋。","a rice cooker 電鍋；cook n. 廚師","n.","cooker","Almost every Chinese family has a rice cooker.","原書例句"],["cupboard","碗櫃","Put these plates on the top shelf of the kitchen ______.","把這些盤子放在廚房碗櫃最上層。","—","n.","cupboard","Put these plates on the top shelf of the kitchen cupboard.","原書例句"],["hammer","鐵鎚","I drove the nail into the wall with a ______.","我用鐵鎚把釘子敲進牆裡。","hammer a nail into... = drive a nail into... 把釘子釘入……","n.","hammer","I drove the nail into the wall with a hammer.","原書例句"],["hanger","衣架","Dry your clothes on ______.","把你的衣服晾在衣架上。","—","n.","hangers","Dry your clothes on hangers.","原書例句"],["heater","暖氣機；加熱器","We need a ______ to keep us warm in winter.","冬天我們需要暖氣機來保暖。","air conditioner n. 冷氣機；fireplace n. 壁爐","n.","heater","We need a heater to keep us warm in winter.","原書例句"],["broadcast","播送；廣播","The show was ______ live.","這個節目是現場直播的。","cast n. 演員陣容；forecast vt. & n. 預測／預報","vt. & n.","broadcast","The show was broadcast live.","原書例句"],["brunch","早午餐","I eat ______ on weekends because I sleep late.","我週末吃早午餐，因為我睡得晚。","brunch = breakfast + lunch","n.","brunch","I eat brunch on weekends because I sleep late.","原書例句"]],"U15":[["dislike","不喜歡；厭惡","Tanya has a ______ for grapes.","譚雅不喜歡葡萄。","have a dislike for... 不喜歡……；dislike doing sth 不喜歡做某事；keep a low profile 保持低調","n. & vt.","dislike","Tanya has a dislike for grapes.","原書例句"],["patience","耐心","Can’t you walk a little faster? I’m losing my ______.","你不能走快一點嗎？我快失去耐心了。","patient a. 有耐心的；be patient with sb 對某人有耐心；impatient a. 不耐煩的；be impatient with sb 對某人不耐煩；impatience n. 不耐煩","n.","patience","Can’t you walk a little faster? I’m losing my patience.","原書例句"],["bubble","泡泡；冒泡","There are many ______ in the bathtub.","浴缸裡有許多泡泡。","bubble over = feel excited 興奮不已","n. & vi.","bubbles","There are many bubbles in the bathtub.","原書例句"],["mushroom","蘑菇；迅速增加","______ soup is my favorite.","蘑菇湯是我的最愛。","flourish vi. 繁榮／茂盛","n. & vi.","Mushroom","Mushroom soup is my favorite.","原書例句"],["mobile","可移動的；行動的","A business person cannot do without a ______ phone.","商務人士不能沒有手機。","movable a. 可移動的；mobile phone = cellular phone = cellphone 手機；smartphone 智慧型手機","a.","mobile","A business person cannot do without a mobile phone.","原書例句"],["nickname","綽號；給……取綽號","Every student in my class has a ______.","我班上的每位學生都有綽號。","pen name 筆名；hammer n. 鐵鎚","n. & vt.","nickname","Every student in my class has a nickname.","原書例句"],["vivid","生動的；鮮明的","Mary’s description of the party was so ______ that I felt as though I had been there.","瑪麗對派對的描述如此生動，讓我覺得自己彷彿也在現場。","vividly adv. 生動地；graphic a. 生動的；dull a. 枯燥的／暗淡的","a.","vivid","Mary’s description of the party was so vivid that I felt as though I had been there.","原書例句"],["lively","活潑的；充滿活力的","A good night’s sleep helped me feel ______ again.","一夜好眠讓我又恢復了活力。","energetic / vigorous a. 精力充沛的；feeble a. 虛弱的","a.","lively","A good night’s sleep helped me feel lively again.","原書例句"],["bury","埋葬；掩埋","Because of the earthquake, hundreds of people were ______ alive.","由於地震，數百人遭到活埋。","bury, buried, buried；bury sb alive 活埋某人；be buried alive 被活埋；be buried in... 埋首於……；burial n. 埋葬","vt.","buried","Because of the earthquake, hundreds of people were buried alive.","原書例句"],["continent","洲；大陸","Australia is a ______; New Zealand isn’t.","澳洲是一個洲；紐西蘭不是。","continental a. 大陸的；mainland n. 大陸／本土；on the Chinese mainland 在中國大陸；on the European Continent 在歐洲大陸","n.","continent","Australia is a continent; New Zealand isn’t.","原書例句"],["farther","較遠的；更遠地","You’ll find the bookcase at the ______ end of the living room.","你會在客廳較遠的那一端找到書櫃。","further a. & adv. 更進一步的／更遠地；until further notice 直到另行通知","a. & adv.","farther","You’ll find the bookcase at the farther end of the living room.","原書例句"],["weep","哭泣","The mourners silently ______ at the old man’s funeral.","哀悼者在那位老人的葬禮上默默哭泣。","weep, wept, wept；sob vi. 啜泣；mourner n. 哀悼者","vi.","wept","The mourners silently wept at the old man’s funeral.","原書例句"],["ripe","成熟的；時機成熟的","You can’t eat those oranges until they are ______.","那些柳橙要成熟後才能吃。","ripen vi. 成熟；mature a. 成熟的；the time is ripe for... 做……的時機成熟","a.","ripe","You can’t eat those oranges until they are ripe.","原書例句"],["boot","靴子；踢；啟動（電腦）","I need to buy a new pair of ______ for my hiking trip.","我需要為健行之旅買一雙新靴子。","a pair of boots 一雙靴子；give sb the boot = fire sb 解雇某人；boot up 啟動電腦；send sb off 把某人罰出場；tardy a. 遲到的","n. & vt. & vi.","boots","I need to buy a new pair of boots for my hiking trip.","原書例句"],["complain","抱怨","Kevin ______ that the food was terrible.","凱文抱怨食物很糟。","complain that... 抱怨……；complain about + N/V-ing 抱怨……；complaint n. 抱怨；make complaints about... = complain about...；grievance n. 不滿／抱怨","vt. & vi.","complained","Kevin complained that the food was terrible.","原書例句"],["complaint","抱怨","Stop making ______ about life and learn to appreciate what you have.","別再抱怨人生，要學會珍惜你所擁有的。","make complaints about... 對……抱怨；appreciate vt. 感激／欣賞","n.","complaints","Stop making complaints about life and learn to appreciate what you have.","原書例句"],["cheek","臉頰；厚臉皮","The little girl has rosy ______ and blue eyes.","那個小女孩有紅潤的雙頰和藍色的眼睛。","have the cheek to + V 厚著臉皮做……","n.","cheeks","The little girl has rosy cheeks and blue eyes.","原書例句"],["jaw","下巴；顎","Your ______ is the lower part of your face below your mouth.","下巴是臉部位於嘴巴下方的部分。","escape from the jaws of death 死裡逃生","n.","jaw","Your jaw is the lower part of your face below your mouth.","原書例句"],["chin","下巴","Peter has a big ______, but it is hidden under his thick beard.","彼得有個大下巴，但藏在濃密的鬍鬚下。","—","n.","chin","Peter has a big chin, but it is hidden under his thick beard.","原書例句"],["forehead","額頭","Helen’s got a large ______ and a pointy chin.","海倫有寬大的額頭和尖下巴。","brow n. 額頭／眉毛","n.","forehead","Helen’s got a large forehead and a pointy chin.","原書例句"],["cocktail","雞尾酒","We will host a ______ party tonight in celebration of John’s birthday.","今晚我們將舉辦雞尾酒會慶祝約翰的生日。","a cocktail party 雞尾酒會","n.","cocktail","We will host a cocktail party tonight in celebration of John’s birthday.","原書例句"],["bartender","酒保","The successful businessman used to work as a ______ while in college.","這位成功的商人在大學時曾當過酒保。","—","n.","bartender","The successful businessman used to work as a bartender while in college.","原書例句"],["pub","酒吧","Many foreigners frequent that ______ because of its homey atmosphere.","許多外國人常去那家酒吧，因為那裡有舒適自在的氣氛。","bar / tavern n. 酒吧；frequent vt. 常去；homey a. 舒適自在的","n.","pub","Many foreigners frequent that pub because of its homey atmosphere.","原書例句"],["wander","漫遊；徘徊","The confused old man ______ through the streets, unsure of where he was.","那位迷糊的老人徘徊在街上，不知道自己身在何處。","wanderer n. 流浪者；roam vi. 漫遊；wonder vi. 想知道；stroll vi. & n. 散步","vi.","wandered","The confused old man wandered through the streets, unsure of where he was.","原書例句"],["miracle","奇蹟","It’s a ______ that no one was killed or injured in that accident.","那場事故中沒有人死亡或受傷，真是奇蹟。","work / perform miracles 創造奇蹟；miraculous a. 奇蹟般的；wonder n. 奇蹟","n.","miracle","It’s a miracle that no one was killed or injured in that accident.","原書例句"],["whip","鞭子；鞭打；攪打","The cowboy picked up his hat and ______, and then he went to find the horse.","牛仔拿起帽子和鞭子，然後去找馬。","whip, whipped, whipped；lash vt. 鞭打；jockey n. 騎師","n. & vt.","whip","The cowboy picked up his hat and whip, and then he went to find the horse.","原書例句"],["wealthy","富有的","The ______ are not necessarily happy; likewise, the poor are not necessarily sad.","富人未必快樂；同樣地，窮人也未必悲傷。","wealth n. 財富；rich / affluent a. 富有的","a.","wealthy","The wealthy are not necessarily happy; likewise, the poor are not necessarily sad.","原書例句"],["poverty","貧窮；缺乏","The ______ of his family made it impossible for Paul to attend college.","保羅家境貧困，使他無法上大學。","poor a. 貧窮的；poverty-stricken / impoverished a. 貧困的","n.","poverty","The poverty of his family made it impossible for Paul to attend college.","原書例句"],["drunk","喝醉的；醉漢","Sam got ______ at the party, so I drove him home.","山姆在派對上喝醉了，所以我開車送他回家。","get drunk 喝醉；intoxicated a. 喝醉的","a. & n.","drunk","Sam got drunk at the party, so I drove him home.","原書例句"],["lawn","草坪","Peter spent all morning helping his father mow the ______.","彼得花了一整個早上幫父親割草。","mow the lawn 割草；lawn mower 割草機","n.","lawn","Peter spent all morning helping his father mow the lawn.","原書例句"],["meadow","草地；牧草地","Some sheep were grazing in the ______.","有些羊正在草地上吃草。","grassland n. 草原；pasture n. 牧場；graze vi. 吃草","n.","meadow","Some sheep were grazing in the meadow.","原書例句"],["weed","雜草；除草","Is this a healthy plant or is it a ______?","這是一株健康的植物，還是雜草？","grow like weeds 長得很快","n. & vt.","weed","Is this a healthy plant or is it a weed?","原書例句"],["portrait","肖像；畫像","Mary’s great-grandmother’s ______ still hangs in her father’s house.","瑪麗曾祖母的肖像仍掛在她父親家裡。","portray vt. 描繪","n.","portrait","Mary’s great-grandmother’s portrait still hangs in her father’s house.","原書例句"],["marble","大理石；彈珠","The monument is made of ______ and granite.","這座紀念碑是由大理石和花崗岩製成的。","play marbles 玩彈珠；granite n. 花崗岩","n.","marble","The monument is made of marble and granite.","原書例句"],["bead","珠子","I’m making a necklace for my niece using colorful ______.","我正用彩色珠子為姪女做一條項鍊。","—","n.","beads","I’m making a necklace for my niece using colorful beads.","原書例句"],["comma","逗號","The only mistake was a missing ______ in this sentence.","唯一的錯誤是這個句子少了一個逗號。","be left in a coma 陷入昏迷；coma n. 昏迷","n.","comma","The only mistake was a missing comma in this sentence.","原書例句"],["laughter","笑聲","______ is the best medicine.","笑是最好的良藥。","burst into laughter = burst out laughing 突然大笑","n.","Laughter","Laughter is the best medicine.","原書例句"],["grin","咧嘴笑；露齒笑","Mary ______ at her boyfriend the moment she saw him.","瑪麗一看到男友就對他咧嘴笑。","grin, grinned, grinned；grin at sb 對某人咧嘴笑；giggle vi. & n. 咯咯笑","vi. & n.","grinned","Mary grinned at her boyfriend the moment she saw him.","原書例句"],["bless","祝福；保佑","The priest ______ the children as they left.","孩子們離開時，牧師為他們祝福。","be blessed with... 有幸擁有……；blessing n. 祝福","vt.","blessed","The priest blessed the children as they left.","原書例句"],["crash","撞擊聲；墜毀；撞上","While driving through the intersection, we heard a loud ______.","開車通過十字路口時，我們聽到一聲巨響。","a plane crash 空難；crash into... 撞上……；crush vt. 壓碎；clash n. & vi. 衝突；on the spot 當場","n. & vi.","crash","While driving through the intersection, we heard a loud crash.","原書例句"],["cruel","殘酷的","Children should be taught from an early age not to be ______ to animals.","孩子應從小被教導不要虐待動物。","be cruel to... 對……殘酷；cruelty n. 殘酷；cruelly adv. 殘酷地；violent / brutal / nasty / unkind a. 殘忍的；kind a. 仁慈的","a.","cruel","Children should be taught from an early age not to be cruel to animals.","原書例句"],["database","資料庫","The researcher entered the survey results into the ______.","研究人員把調查結果輸入資料庫。","data n. 資料；information n. 資訊；info n. 資訊；researcher n. 研究人員","n.","database","The researcher entered the survey results into the database.","原書例句"],["grassy","長滿草的；多草的","Eric likes to lie down on ______ fields and watch the clouds float by.","艾瑞克喜歡躺在草地上，看著雲朵飄過。","grass n. 草","a.","grassy","Eric likes to lie down on grassy fields and watch the clouds float by.","原書例句"],["dumpling","餃子；麵糰製食品","Would you like some more ______?","你還要再吃一些餃子嗎？","—","n.","dumplings","Would you like some more dumplings?","原書例句"],["geography","地理學","In high school, my worst subject was ______.","高中時，我最差的科目是地理。","geographic = geographical a. 地理的","n.","geography","In high school, my worst subject was geography.","原書例句"]],"U16":[["amaze","使驚訝","Joe’s violin-playing skills ______ everyone at the concert.","喬的小提琴演奏技巧讓演奏會上的所有人大吃一驚。","surprise vt. 使驚訝；astonish vt. 使吃驚；astound vt. 使震驚","vt.","amazed","Joe’s violin-playing skills amazed everyone at the concert.","原書例句"],["amazed","感到驚訝的","We were all ______ at Peter’s ability to handle the problem.","我們對彼得處理問題的能力感到驚訝。","be amazed at / by... 對……感到驚訝；be surprised / astonished / astounded at / by...","a.","amazed","We were all amazed at Peter’s ability to handle the problem.","原書例句"],["amazing","令人驚訝的","It’s ______ that an ant can carry objects many times heavier than itself.","螞蟻搬得動比自己身體重好幾倍的物體，真令人驚奇。","surprising / astonishing / astounding a. 令人驚訝的","a.","amazing","It’s amazing that an ant can carry objects many times heavier than itself.","原書例句"],["amazement","驚異；驚愕","I thought my father would get angry, but to my ______, he tried to comfort me.","我以為父親會生氣，但令我吃驚的是，他卻試著安慰我。","to one’s amazement 令某人吃驚的是……；surprise / astonishment n. 驚訝","n.","amazement","I thought my father would get angry, but to my amazement, he tried to comfort me.","原書例句"],["acceptable","可接受的；尚可的","The plan we made should be ______ to them.","我們擬的計畫對他們而言應該是可以接受的。","accept vt. 接受；acceptance n. 接受；satisfactory a. 令人滿意的；good enough 還算不錯的；unacceptable a. 不能接受的","a.","acceptable","The plan we made should be acceptable to them.","原書例句"],["satisfactory","令人滿意的","The teacher said my report was ______ but could still be improved.","老師說我的報告令人滿意，但仍可再改進。","—","a.","satisfactory","The teacher said my report was ______ but could still be improved.","練習新編句"],["charm","魅力；符咒；使著迷","The actor is not very handsome but has great ______.","這名演員不是很帥但是魅力十足。","be charmed by... = be fascinated by / with... = be attracted by / to...；work like a charm 十分順利；attraction n. 吸引；charisma n. 魅力；fascination n. 魅力","n. & vt.","charm","The actor is not very handsome but has great charm.","原書例句"],["charming","迷人的","I’m under Jane’s spell because she is so ______.","我對珍著迷，因為她實在太迷人。","attractive / appealing a. 吸引人的","a.","charming","I’m under Jane’s spell because she is so charming.","原書例句"],["meaningful","有意義的；意義深長的","We had a ______ and constructive meeting this afternoon.","今天下午我們開了一場有意義且具建設性的會議。","mean vt. 意指；meaning n. 意義；significant a. 有意義的／重大的","a.","meaningful","We had a meaningful and constructive meeting this afternoon.","原書例句"],["meaningless","無意義的；不重要的","I find this essay utterly ______.","我覺得這篇文章完全沒有意義。","insignificant a. 無意義的／不重要的；utterly adv. 完全地","a.","meaningless","I find this essay utterly meaningless.","原書例句"],["statue","雕像","The ______ of Liberty is probably America’s most famous landmark.","自由女神像很可能是美國最知名的地標。","sculpture n. 雕像；the Statue of Liberty 自由女神像；erect vt. 豎立","n.","Statue","The Statue of Liberty is probably America’s most famous landmark.","原書例句"],["living","生計；活著的；現在的","Joseph makes a ______ teaching English.","喬瑟夫以教英文維生。","earn / make a living + V-ing 以……維生；earn / make a living as + 職業；live a. 現場的／活的；alive a. 活著的；livelihood n. 生計","n. & a.","living","Joseph makes a living teaching English.","原書例句"],["communicate","傳達（意見、感受等）；溝通","Richard always ______ his ideas clearly.","理查總能清楚地表達他的意見。","communicate with sb 與某人溝通；communication n. 聯絡／傳播；communicative a. 愛交談的","vt. & vi.","communicates","Richard always communicates his ideas clearly.","原書例句"],["communicable","可溝通的","The doctor explained how the ______ disease spreads.","醫生說明了這種傳染病如何傳播。","stubborn a. 固執的","a.","communicable","The doctor explained how the ______ disease spreads.","練習新編句"],["swell","腫大；膨脹；隆起","The man’s finger ______ after the snake bit it.","該男子的手指被蛇咬後腫了起來。","swell, swelled, swelled / swollen","vi.","swelled","The man’s finger swelled after the snake bit it.","原書例句"],["shrink","（使）縮小","Cotton clothes usually ______ in the dryer.","棉質衣服烘乾後通常會縮小。","shrink, shrank, shrunk；shrink 亦可作名詞，表示精神科醫生","vi. & vt.","shrink","Cotton clothes usually shrink in the dryer.","原書例句"],["knight","騎士","That ______ betrayed his country for his lover.","那名騎士為了情人而背叛國家。","betray vt. 背叛","n.","knight","That knight betrayed his country for his lover.","原書例句"],["crown","皇冠；加冕","Queen Elizabeth’s ______ is on display in the Jewel House in the Tower of London.","伊麗莎白女王的皇冠在倫敦塔的珠寶屋展示。","crown sb king / queen 將某人加冕為國王／王后；be crowned king / queen 被加冕為國王／王后","n. & vt.","crown","Queen Elizabeth’s crown is on display in the Jewel House in the Tower of London.","原書例句"],["gang","幫派；成群結隊","Rumor has it that Peter joined a street ______ when he was young.","謠傳彼得年輕時曾加入某街頭幫派。","gang up against / on sb 因對付某人而成群結隊；gangster n. 幫派分子；clan n. 氏族","n. & vi.","gang","Rumor has it that Peter joined a street gang when he was young.","原書例句"],["mob","一群；暴民；（人群）圍住","The demonstrators got out of control and became a ______.","那些示威群眾失去控制，變成一群暴民。","mob, mobbed, mobbed；a mob of + 數字 一群為數……的暴民；mobster n. 暴民中的一員","n. & vt.","mob","The demonstrators got out of control and became a mob.","原書例句"],["thread","（縫衣服的）線；頭緒；穿線於","Do you have a needle and ______ I can borrow?","你有針和線可以借我嗎？","lose the thread of... 理不出……的頭緒；a thread of hope 一線希望；cord n. 有插頭的電線；細繩；rope n. 粗繩","n. & vt.","thread","Do you have a needle and thread I can borrow?","原書例句"],["stitch","一針；縫","Jack was wounded in a fight and needed 10 ______.","傑克打架受了傷，需要縫 10 針。","A stitch in time saves nine. 及時一針可省下九針。","n. & vt.","stitches","Jack was wounded in a fight and needed 10 stitches.","原書例句"],["explode","爆炸；炸掉；激增","In 1949, the Soviet Union ______ its first atomic bomb.","1949 年，蘇聯引爆它的第一顆原子彈。","explosion n. 爆炸；爆炸物；explosive a. 爆炸性的 & n. 爆炸物；blow up 炸掉","vt. & vi.","exploded","In 1949, the Soviet Union exploded its first atomic bomb.","原書例句"],["horror","恐怖；恐懼","To my ______, I realized a stranger was in my house.","嚇壞我的是，我發現家裡有個陌生人。","to one’s horror 令某人恐懼的是……；a horror movie 恐怖片；horrify vt. 使恐懼；fear n. 害怕；panic n. 驚恐","n.","horror","To my horror, I realized a stranger was in my house.","原書例句"],["horrible","可怕的；很糟的","The ______ accident was the worst one we’ve had this year.","這起可怕的意外是今年我們經歷最嚴重的一件。","terrible a. 可怕的／很糟的","a.","horrible","The horrible accident was the worst one we’ve had this year.","原書例句"],["gap","裂縫；歧異","Because of the generation ______, my mom doesn’t share my interest in this type of music.","因為有代溝，我媽媽並不和我一樣喜歡這類的音樂。","the generation gap 代溝；difference n. 差異；crack n. 裂縫","n.","gap","Because of the generation gap, my mom doesn’t share my interest in this type of music.","原書例句"],["fountain","噴泉；噴水池","Some people throw coins into ______ and make a wish, believing that their wish will come true.","有些人會將銅板丟進池子裡並許個願，他們相信這些願望會成真。","a fountain machine 飲水機；a fountain pen 鋼筆","n.","fountains","Some people throw coins into fountains and make a wish, believing that their wish will come true.","原書例句"],["youngster","年輕人","More and more ______ are becoming concerned about the environment.","越來越多的年輕人開始關心環境問題。","young a. 年輕的；youth n. 青年；youthful a. 青春的","n.","youngsters","More and more youngsters are becoming concerned about the environment.","原書例句"],["elderly","年老的","Please give your seat to ______ passengers on the bus.","在公車上請讓座給年長的乘客。","the elderly 老年人；elder n. 年長者／長輩","a.","elderly","Please give your seat to elderly passengers on the bus.","原書例句"],["elder","年長者；長輩","You should show respect to your ______ relatives.","你應該尊重年長的親戚。","one’s elder brother / sister 某人的哥哥／姊姊；one’s older brother / sister","n.","elder","You should show respect to your ______ relatives.","練習新編句"],["tap","輕拍；輕敲；水龍頭","This ______ water is not potable; it’s polluted.","不能飲用這自來水；它被污染了。","tap, tapped, tapped；tap water 自來水；tap sb on the + 身體部位 輕拍某人某部位；tab n. 標籤","vt. & vi. & n.","tap","This tap water is not potable; it’s polluted.","原書例句"],["faucet","水龍頭（美）","I turned on the ______, but no water came out.","我打開水龍頭，卻沒有水流出來。","turn on / off the faucet 開／關水龍頭；open / close the faucet","n.","faucet","I turned on the faucet, but no water came out.","原書例句"],["racial","種族的","______ discrimination is something that shouldn’t be tolerated.","種族歧視不應被容忍。","racial discrimination 種族歧視；race n. 種族","a.","Racial","Racial discrimination is something that shouldn’t be tolerated.","原書例句"],["summit","頂峰；頂點","The world leaders held ______ talks in Manila last month.","上個月各國領袖在馬尼拉舉行高峰會談。","summit talks 高峰會談；the summit of one’s career 某人事業的最高峰；peak n. 山頂／最高峰","n.","summit","The world leaders held summit talks in Manila last month.","原書例句"],["follower","擁護者；信徒","The ______ of the church all participated in the annual celebration.","該教會的信徒全都參與這個年度盛典。","follow vt. 追隨；leader n. 領導者","n.","followers","The followers of the church all participated in the annual celebration.","原書例句"],["traveler","旅行者","Because of her work, Cindy is a frequent ______ to Europe.","因為工作的關係，辛蒂常常到歐洲旅行。","travel vi. 旅行","n.","traveler","Because of her work, Cindy is a frequent traveler to Europe.","原書例句"],["champion","得到冠軍者","John was the ______ of the contest.","約翰是這次比賽的冠軍。","championship n. 冠軍頭銜；win the championship 贏得冠軍","n.","champion","John was the champion of the contest.","原書例句"],["interrupt","打斷","Do not ______ us while we’re talking.","我們在講話時不要插嘴。","interrupt sb 打斷某人的話；cut in on sb 插嘴；interruption n. 中斷／干擾","vt.","interrupt","Do not interrupt us while we’re talking.","原書例句"],["glow","光輝；發光；（眼睛）發亮","The oil lamp gives off a soft ______.","油燈散發出柔和的光。","glow with pleasure / pride / passion 散發出愉快／驕傲／熱情的光芒","vi. & n.","glow","The oil lamp gives off a soft glow.","原書例句"],["ray","光線","The sun’s ______ shone through the gap between the walls.","太陽光束從牆壁間的縫隙射進來。","X-ray n. X 光；X 光片","n.","rays","The sun’s rays shone through the gap between the walls.","原書例句"],["beam","播送；廣播；高興地微笑；光束","This program will be ______ to Japan.","本節目將對日本播送。","beam at sb 對某人微笑 = smile at sb；skylight n. 天窗","vt. & vi. & n.","beamed","This program will be beamed to Japan.","原書例句"],["twin","雙胞胎之一；雙生的","The two girls are ______, but they look nothing alike.","這兩個女孩是雙胞胎，但她們看起來一點也不像。","Siamese twins 連體嬰","n. & a.","twins","The two girls are twins, but they look nothing alike.","原書例句"],["tight","緊的；緊地","Now that I plan to study abroad, I keep a ______ budget.","我既然計畫要出國深造，就要節省使用。","keep a tight budget 抓緊預算／節儉過日；loose a. 鬆的","a. & adv.","tight","Now that I plan to study abroad, I keep a tight budget.","原書例句"],["tighten","拉緊","The little girl ______ her grip on her mom’s hand when she saw the dog.","小女孩看到那隻狗時緊抓她媽媽的手。","tighten one’s grip on sth 緊抓某物；loosen vt. 鬆開","vt.","tightened","The little girl tightened her grip on her mom’s hand when she saw the dog.","原書例句"],["sigh","嘆息","Olivia let out a ______ of relief when she received a call from her son.","奧莉維亞接到兒子的電話時，放心地歎了口氣。","let out a sigh = have a sigh = utter a sigh 嘆一口氣","n. & vi.","sigh","Olivia let out a sigh of relief when she received a call from her son.","原書例句"],["citizen","公民；市民","Tom is an Australian ______ but grew up in Taiwan.","湯姆是澳洲公民，但卻是在臺灣長大的。","citizenship n. 公民權；resident n. 居民","n.","citizen","Tom is an Australian citizen but grew up in Taiwan.","原書例句"],["holder","保持者；持有人","Mr. Smith is the current record ______ in this game.","史密斯先生是這項比賽目前的紀錄保持者。","a record holder 紀錄保持者；set / keep / break a record 創下／保持／破紀錄","n.","holder","Mr. Smith is the current record holder in this game.","原書例句"],["hunger","渴望；飢餓","After years of war, we all ______ for peace.","經過多年的戰爭，我們都渴望和平。","hunger for... 渴望……；have a hunger for... = yearn for... = crave for...；hungry a. 飢餓的","vi. & n.","hunger","After years of war, we all hunger for peace.","原書例句"]],"U17":[["knit","編織","Jenny ______ her son a pair of blue socks.","珍妮替她兒子編織了一雙藍襪子。","knit, knitted, knitted；sew vt. 縫製","vt.","knitted","Jenny knitted her son a pair of blue socks.","原書例句"],["weave","編織；穿梭；織法","Alan had to ______ his way through the crowd to get to the other end of the mall.","艾倫必須穿過人群才能到達購物中心的另一端。","weave, wove, woven；weave one’s way through... 穿梭通過……；weave in and out of traffic 在車陣中穿梭","vt. & vi. & n.","weave","Alan had to weave his way through the crowd to get to the other end of the mall.","原書例句"],["monk","和尚；僧侶","The millionaire converted to Buddhism and became a ______ after his wife passed away.","這名百萬富翁在太太過世後改信佛教並出家為僧。","priest n. 牧師／神父；monastery n. 修道院；convert vi. 改信（宗教）","n.","monk","The millionaire converted to Buddhism and became a monk after his wife passed away.","原書例句"],["nun","修女；尼姑","The ______ is a volunteer in that hospital.","這位修女是那家醫院的志工。","Sister Maria 瑪利亞修女；volunteer n. 志工","n.","nun","The nun is a volunteer in that hospital.","原書例句"],["breeze","微風；輕鬆地走","I felt great as a gentle ______ blew over my face.","當一陣微風吹過我的臉時，我感覺很舒服。","shoot the breeze = chitchat 閒聊；breeze through... 輕鬆通過……；wind n. 風；do nothing but + V 只做……","n. & vi.","breeze","I felt great as a gentle breeze blew over my face.","原書例句"],["mathematical","數學的","The ______ formula was named after the great mathematician.","這個數學公式是以這位偉大的數學家命名的。","a mathematical / math formula 數學公式；mathematics / math n. 數學；mathematician n. 數學家；arithmetic n. 算術","a.","mathematical","The mathematical formula was named after the great mathematician.","原書例句"],["postpone","延後；延期","Because of the approaching typhoon, we decided to ______ holding the meeting until next Friday.","因為颱風即將來臨，我們決定將會議延至下週五舉行。","postpone + N/V-ing；put off + N/V-ing；delay vt. 延遲；postponement n. 延期","vt.","postpone","Because of the approaching typhoon, we decided to postpone holding the meeting until next Friday.","原書例句"],["postponement","延期；延緩","The client seemed unsatisfied with the ______ of the delivery.","客戶似乎對延後交貨感到不滿。","delay n. 延遲","n.","postponement","The client seemed unsatisfied with the postponement of the delivery.","原書例句"],["emperor","皇帝","Naruhito became the ______ of Japan on May 1st, 2019.","德仁於 2019 年 5 月 1 日成為日本天皇。","empress n. 女皇／皇后；empire n. 帝國","n.","emperor","Naruhito became the emperor of Japan on May 1st, 2019.","原書例句"],["feather","羽毛","After the pillow fight, the two children were covered in ______.","枕頭大戰後，兩個孩子身上滿是羽毛。","Birds of a feather flock together. 物以類聚。；fur n.（動物的）毛皮；fur coat 毛皮大衣；conservationist n. 保育人士","n.","feathers","After the pillow fight, the two children were covered in feathers.","原書例句"],["wrap","包；裹；披肩","The little girl ______ some coins in her handkerchief.","小女孩用手帕包了幾枚硬幣。","wrap, wrapped, wrapped；wrap (sth) up 包起來／結束；be wrapped up in sth 專心於……","vt. & n.","wrapped","The little girl wrapped some coins in her handkerchief.","原書例句"],["dose","劑量；給……服藥","One ______ of this medicine will put the dog to sleep.","這種藥只要一劑就能讓這隻狗安樂死。","dosage n.（藥的）劑量；put an animal to sleep 讓動物安樂死","n. & vt.","dose","One dose of this medicine will put the dog to sleep.","原書例句"],["drown","淹沒；溺死","George kept ______ his sorrows after breaking up with Ellen.","喬治和艾倫分手後一直借酒澆愁。","drown one’s sorrows 借酒澆愁；burst one’s banks 河水潰堤","vt. & vi.","drowning","George kept drowning his sorrows after breaking up with Ellen.","原書例句"],["bunch","一束；一群","I sent Mary a ______ of flowers, but she didn’t seem delighted.","我送瑪麗一束花，但她看起來並沒有很高興。","a bunch of... 一束／一群……；bouquet n. 花束","n.","bunch","I sent Mary a bunch of flowers, but she didn’t seem delighted.","原書例句"],["bundle","一捆；一包；捆起來","Richard gave Judie a ______ of flowers on their first date.","理查在第一次約會時送茱蒂一束花。","a bundle of... 一捆……；bundle up... 把……捆起來；a bundle of nerves 神經緊張的人；typo n. 打字錯誤","n. & vt.","bundle","Richard gave Judie a bundle of flowers on their first date.","原書例句"],["motel","汽車旅館","When I’m on business, I stay in a ______ instead of a hotel because it’s a lot cheaper.","我出差時都會住汽車旅館而不住飯店，因為那便宜多了。","hotel n. 飯店；hostel n. 便宜的旅社；inn n. 小旅館；board n. 膳食","n.","motel","When I’m on business, I stay in a motel instead of a hotel because it’s a lot cheaper.","原書例句"],["suicide","自殺","It’s shocking that Larry committed ______. He seemed like a very happy man.","賴瑞自殺的事很令人震驚。他看起來像是個非常快樂的人。","commit suicide 自殺","n.","suicide","It’s shocking that Larry committed suicide. He seemed like a very happy man.","原書例句"],["mess","混亂；使混亂；胡鬧","The room is a ______. Clean up before you go.","房間亂七八糟。你先整理好再出門。","be a mess / be in a mess 一團亂；make a mess of... 把……弄得一團亂；mess sth up 搞砸；mess around 胡鬧；messy a. 凌亂的；confusion / chaos n. 混亂","n. & vt. & vi.","mess","The room is a mess. Clean up before you go.","原書例句"],["separation","分離；分開","______ from his homeland made the young soldier sad.","離開家鄉使這名年輕士兵感到難過。","separate vt. & vi. 分開","n.","Separation","Separation from his homeland made the young soldier sad.","原書例句"],["bush","灌木","This website provided detailed information on how to plant rose ______.","這個網站提供如何種植玫瑰灌木的詳細資訊。","beat around the bush 拐彎抹角；shrub n. 灌木","n.","bushes","This website provided detailed information on how to plant rose bushes.","原書例句"],["panic","驚恐；恐慌","______ does not help when one is in a dangerous situation.","陷入危險情況時，驚恐是無濟於事的。","panic, panicked, panicked；fear n. & vt. 害怕；fright n. 恐懼；scare n. & vt. 驚嚇","n. & vi.","Panic","Panic does not help when one is in a dangerous situation.","原書例句"],["seal","封條；封住；海豹","Police ______ off all the exits so the bank robbers couldn’t escape.","警方封鎖所有出口，使銀行搶匪無法逃脫。","seal off... 封鎖……；close vt. 關閉；the Arctic 北極；the Antarctic 南極","n. & vt.","sealed","Police sealed off all the exits so the bank robbers couldn’t escape.","原書例句"],["recorder","錄音機；記錄器","The tape ______ is a user-friendly machine.","這臺錄音機是很容易使用的機器。","record n. 紀錄 & vt. 錄音／錄影；a tape recorder 錄音機；a flight data recorder 飛航資料記錄器（black box 黑盒子）；user-friendly a. 容易使用的","n.","recorder","The tape recorder is a user-friendly machine.","原書例句"],["afterward(s)","之後；後來","Please review the word ______ carefully.","請仔細複習單字「afterward(s)」。","thereafter adv. 之後；beforehand adv. 事先；drizzle vi. 下毛毛雨","adv.","afterward(s)","Please review the word ______ carefully.","練習新編句"],["ladder","梯子","Andy fell down the ______ and broke his ankle and wrist.","安迪從梯子上摔下來，摔斷了腳踝和手腕。","stair n. 階梯；climb a flight of stairs 爬一段樓梯","n.","ladder","Andy fell down the ladder and broke his ankle and wrist.","原書例句"],["skip","略過；翹課；跳躍","Jerry ______ lunch in order to get his work done.","傑瑞略過午餐沒吃，以把工作做完。","skip, skipped, skipped；skip class = cut class = play hooky = play truant 翹課；spanking n. 打屁股；jump / hop / leap n. 跳","vt. & vi. & n.","skipped","Jerry skipped lunch in order to get his work done.","原書例句"],["plug","插頭；插入","I need to change the ______ on the stereo.","我需要更換音響的插頭。","plug, plugged, plugged；plug sth in 將某物插入插座；socket n. 插座；earplug n. 耳塞；a pair of earplugs 一副耳塞","n. & vt.","plug","I need to change the plug on the stereo.","原書例句"],["humor","幽默；心情；迎合、寵愛","Mark has a great sense of ______.","馬克很有幽默感。","a sense of humor 幽默感；be in a good / bad humor = be in a good / bad mood 心情好／壞；spoil vt. 寵壞；humorous a. 幽默的","n. & vt.","humor","Mark has a great sense of humor.","原書例句"],["humorous","幽默的","John is well liked by us because of his ______ personality.","約翰因為幽默的個性而深受我們喜愛。","personality n. 個性","a.","humorous","John is well liked by us because of his humorous personality.","原書例句"],["deed","行為；事蹟","Scouts need to do at least one good ______ a day.","童子軍每天至少要做一件善事。","behavior n. 行為；do a good deed 做善事；Deeds are more important than empty words. = Actions speak louder than words. 行動勝於空談。","n.","deed","Scouts need to do at least one good deed a day.","原書例句"],["stomach","胃；肚子","The smell of stinky tofu always turns Billy’s ______.","臭豆腐的味道總是讓比利反胃。","turn one’s stomach 使某人反胃；stomachache n. 胃痛；belly / tummy n. 肚子；abdomen n. 腹部；belly button / navel n. 肚臍；pot belly 大肚子","n.","stomach","The smell of stinky tofu always turns Billy’s stomach.","原書例句"],["misery","痛苦；悲慘","The homeless man lives in hunger and ______.","這名遊民生活在飢餓與痛苦之中。","miserable a. 不幸的／令人不快的","n.","misery","The homeless man lives in hunger and misery.","原書例句"],["fold","摺疊；摺痕","______ up the towels like this.","像這樣把毛巾摺起來。","with one’s arms folded 雙臂交叉；unfold vt. 展開；folder n. 文件夾","vt. & n.","Fold","Fold up the towels like this.","原書例句"],["punch","一拳；用拳打","That boxer landed a ______ on his opponent’s head.","那名拳擊手一拳打中對手的頭。","land a punch on sth 打中……；punch sb in the face 打某人的臉","n. & vt.","punch","That boxer landed a punch on his opponent’s head.","原書例句"],["label","標籤；貼標籤；把……稱為","Mom put ______ on the medicine bottles so that we could easily distinguish them.","媽媽在藥瓶上貼標籤，以便我們容易辨認。","label A as B 把 A 稱為 B；expired a. 過期的","n. & vt.","labels","Mom put labels on the medicine bottles so that we could easily distinguish them.","原書例句"],["tag","標籤；加標籤","The price ______ on the package says US$25.","包裝上的價格標籤寫著 25 美元。","tag, tagged, tagged；a price tag 價格標籤；a name tag 名牌；hashtag n. 主題標籤","n. & vt.","tag","The price tag on the package says US$25.","原書例句"],["regret","遺憾；後悔","I ______ to tell you that you didn’t meet our requirements.","我很遺憾地告訴你，你沒有達到我們的要求。","regret, regretted, regretted；much to one’s regret 令某人很遺憾的是；regret + V-ing 後悔做過……；regret to + V 遺憾要……；regretful a. 後悔的；regrettable a. 令人遺憾的","n. & vt.","regret","I regret to tell you that you didn’t meet our requirements.","原書例句"],["regretful","後悔的（修飾人）","I’m ______ that I made such a mistake.","我很後悔犯了這樣的錯誤。","—","a.","regretful","I’m regretful that I made such a mistake.","原書例句"],["regrettable","令人遺憾的（修飾事）","It is ______ that John failed the test.","約翰考試不及格令人遺憾。","—","a.","regrettable","It is regrettable that John failed the test.","原書例句"],["jazz","爵士樂","Patrick sang in a ______ band before he became a popular singer.","派屈克在成為流行歌手之前曾在爵士樂團演唱。","jazz band 爵士樂團","n.","jazz","Patrick sang in a jazz band before he became a popular singer.","原書例句"],["jeep","吉普車","A military ______ got stuck in the mud.","一輛軍用吉普車陷在泥沼中。","military jeep 軍用吉普車","n.","jeep","A military jeep got stuck in the mud.","原書例句"]],"U18":[["outdoor","戶外的；露天的","A lot of ______ activities will take place in the park tomorrow.","明天公園裡將舉辦許多戶外活動。","outdoors adv. 在戶外；indoor a. 室內的；indoors adv. 在室內","a.","outdoor","A lot of outdoor activities will take place in the park tomorrow.","原書例句"],["outdoors","在戶外","I want to stay ______ because I enjoy the fresh air.","我想待在戶外，因為我喜歡新鮮空氣。","—","adv.","outdoors","I want to stay outdoors because I enjoy the fresh air.","原書例句"],["indoor","室內的","An ______ flower market is regularly held here on Sunday mornings.","每週日上午這裡都會定期舉辦室內花市。","—","a.","indoor","An indoor flower market is regularly held here on Sunday mornings.","原書例句"],["indoors","在室內","People must stay ______ for their safety during a typhoon.","颱風期間人們必須待在室內以策安全。","—","adv.","indoors","People must stay indoors for their safety during a typhoon.","原書例句"],["bold","大膽的；醒目的","The attempt was ______ but reckless as well.","這項嘗試很大膽，但也很魯莽。","be as bold as brass 厚顏無恥；boldface n. 粗體字","a.","bold","The attempt was bold but reckless as well.","原書例句"],["split","分裂；分開","Eric ______ his food out when he saw a cockroach on the dish.","艾瑞克看到盤子裡有蟑螂時，把嘴裡的食物噴了出來。","split, split, split；split up with... 與……分手；split from... 與……分離","vt. & vi.","split","Eric split his food out when he saw a cockroach on the dish.","原書例句"],["timber","木材；林木","In this country, over 50 percent of its export earnings come from ______.","在這個國家，超過百分之五十的出口收入來自木材。","oak n. 橡樹；pine n. 松樹","n.","timber","In this country, over 50 percent of its export earnings come from timber.","原書例句"],["oak","橡樹","This antique table is made of red ______.","這張古董桌是紅橡木製的。","—","n.","oak","This antique table is made of red oak.","原書例句"],["pine","松樹","The lumberjacks decided to chop down the old ______ trees in the forest.","伐木工決定砍掉森林裡的老松樹。","pine away 日漸憔悴","n.","pine","The lumberjacks decided to chop down the old pine trees in the forest.","原書例句"],["jail","監獄；監禁","Alex was put in ______ for drug trafficking.","艾力克斯因販毒而入獄。","be put in jail / prison 入獄；be jailed 被監禁；be imprisoned 被監禁；prison n. 監獄","n. & vt.","jail","Alex was put in jail for drug trafficking.","原書例句"],["criminal","罪犯；犯罪的","The judge put the ______ in prison.","法官把那名罪犯關進監獄。","crime n. 罪；criminal law 刑法；convict n. 囚犯","n. & a.","criminal","The judge put the criminal in prison.","原書例句"],["flavor","味道；風味","Chocolate and vanilla are two different ______.","巧克力和香草是兩種不同的口味。","flavor with... 以……調味；taste n. 味道 & vi. 嚐起來","n.","flavors","Chocolate and vanilla are two different flavors.","原書例句"],["transport","運輸；運送","In the past, people used trains to ______ coal.","過去人們用火車運送煤。","transportation n. 運輸；public transportation 大眾運輸","n. & vt.","transport","In the past, people used trains to transport coal.","原書例句"],["hourly","每小時的；每小時地","I get an ______ wage of $25 at my job.","我這份工作的時薪是 25 美元。","on an hourly basis 按小時計；every hour 每小時；weekly a. & adv. 每週的／每週地；monthly a. & adv. 每月的／每月地；quarterly a. & adv. 每季的／每季地","a. & adv.","hourly","I get an hourly wage of $25 at my job.","原書例句"],["weekly","每週的；每週地","The employee’s ______ wage was reduced by 10%.","這名員工的週薪被減少百分之十。","on a weekly basis 每週；every week 每週","a. & adv.","weekly","The employee’s weekly wage was reduced by 10%.","原書例句"],["monthly","每月的；每月地","Roger usually spends his ______ allowance on clothes.","羅傑通常把每月的零用錢花在衣服上。","on a monthly basis 每月；every month 每月","a. & adv.","monthly","Roger usually spends his monthly allowance on clothes.","原書例句"],["quarterly","每季的；每季地","The ______ meeting is a big event in Jerry’s company.","季會是傑瑞公司裡的一件大事。","—","a. & adv.","quarterly","The quarterly meeting is a big event in Jerry’s company.","原書例句"],["yearly","每年的；每年地","The club holds a ______ meeting every December.","這個社團每年十二月舉行一次年度會議。","on a yearly basis 每年；every year 每年；annually adv. 每年地","a. & adv.","yearly","The club holds a ______ meeting every December.","練習新編句"],["stiff","僵硬的；不自然的","My legs are ______ from sitting too long at my desk.","我的腿因為在書桌前坐太久而僵硬。","be as stiff as a board 僵硬如木板；stiffen vt. & vi.（使）變僵硬；My neck stiffened after hours of reading.","a.","stiff","My legs are stiff from sitting too long at my desk.","原書例句"],["rag","破布","I felt sorry for those children in ______.","我很同情那些衣衫襤褸的孩子。","from rags to riches 白手起家致富；in rags 衣衫襤褸","n.","rags","I felt sorry for those children in rags.","原書例句"],["rug","小地毯","A good ______ can add a cozy atmosphere to your living room.","一張好的小地毯可以為你的客廳增添舒適的氣氛。","a rug on the floor 地板上的小地毯","n.","rug","A good rug can add a cozy atmosphere to your living room.","原書例句"],["rob","搶劫；剝奪","The man tried to ______ a convenience store at night.","那名男子企圖在夜間搶劫一家便利商店。","rob, robbed, robbed；rob A of B 搶走 A 的 B；robbery n. 搶劫；commit robbery 犯搶劫罪；robber n. 搶匪","vt.","rob","The man tried to ______ a convenience store at night.","練習新編句"],["robbery","搶劫","The young men committed ______ and were put in jail.","那些年輕人犯下搶劫罪而被關進監獄。","commit robbery 犯搶劫罪","n.","robbery","The young men committed robbery and were put in jail.","原書例句"],["aboard","在（船、飛機、火車）上；上（船、飛機、火車）","We went ______ the ship at 6:00 this morning.","我們今天早上六點登船。","go aboard 上船／飛機；abroad adv. 在國外","adv. & prep.","aboard","We went aboard the ship at 6:00 this morning.","原書例句"],["athlete","運動員","An ______ should know the importance of warming up.","運動員應該知道暖身的重要性。","athlete’s foot 香港腳；athletic a. 運動的；an athletic meet 運動會","n.","athlete","An athlete should know the importance of warming up.","原書例句"],["ribbon","緞帶；絲帶","Mom tied a beautiful, purple ______ around my birthday gift.","媽媽在我的生日禮物上繫了一條漂亮的紫色緞帶。","tie a ribbon around... 用緞帶繫住……；knot n. 結 & vt. 打結；knotty a. 棘手的","n.","ribbon","Mom tied a beautiful, purple ribbon around my birthday gift.","原書例句"],["knot","結；打結","Mary tied the wires together into a ______.","瑪麗把電線打成一個結。","tie the knot with sb 與某人結婚","n. & vt.","knot","Mary tied the wires together into a knot.","原書例句"],["tune","曲調；調音","The girl was singing out of ______ because of stage fright.","那女孩因怯場而唱走音。","be in tune with... 與……協調；sing in tune 唱準音；be out of tune 走音；melody n. 旋律","n. & vt.","tune","The girl was singing out of tune because of stage fright.","原書例句"],["dim","昏暗的；使昏暗","You will hurt your eyes working in such ______ light.","在如此昏暗的光線下工作會傷害眼睛。","dim, dimmer, dimmest；bright a. 明亮的","a. & vt.","dim","You will hurt your eyes working in such dim light.","原書例句"],["carriage","四輪馬車；車廂","I still remember riding in Grandpa’s ______ when I was small.","我仍記得小時候坐祖父馬車的情景。","carriage n.（火車的）車廂","n.","carriage","I still remember riding in Grandpa’s carriage when I was small.","原書例句"],["thankful","感謝的；欣慰的","I’m really ______ to you for all the support you gave me and my family.","我真的很感謝你給予我和家人的所有支持。","be thankful / grateful to sb for sth 因某事感謝某人；thank vt. 感謝；grateful a. 感激的","a.","thankful","I’m really thankful to you for all the support you gave me and my family.","原書例句"],["brass","黃銅；銅管樂器","The metal frame around the picture was made of ______.","照片周圍的金屬框是黃銅製的。","copper n. 銅；bronze n. 青銅","n.","brass","The metal frame around the picture was made of brass.","原書例句"],["shallow","淺的；膚淺的","Kids should play in the ______ end of the pool.","小孩應該在游泳池的淺水區玩。","superficial a. 膚淺的；deep a. 深的","a.","shallow","Kids should play in the shallow end of the pool.","原書例句"],["kidney","腎臟","John will die if he doesn’t have a ______ transplant soon.","約翰若不趕快接受腎臟移植就會死。","a kidney transplant 腎臟移植；lung n. 肺","n.","kidney","John will die if he doesn’t have a kidney transplant soon.","原書例句"],["lung","肺","Smoking can seriously damage the ______.","吸菸可能嚴重傷害肺部。","lung cancer 肺癌","n.","lung","Smoking can seriously damage the ______.","練習新編句"],["saucer","茶碟；飛碟","I spilled the cup of tea on the ______ by accident.","我不小心把杯裡的茶灑在茶碟上。","a flying saucer 飛碟；sauce n. 醬汁；soy sauce 醬油","n.","saucer","I spilled the cup of tea on the saucer by accident.","原書例句"],["receiver","聽筒；接收器","The receptionist picked up the telephone ______ and said, “Hello.”","接待員拿起電話聽筒說：「哈囉。」","receive vt. 接收；recipient n. 接受者","n.","receiver","The receptionist picked up the telephone receiver and said, “Hello.”","原書例句"],["mighty","強大的；巨大的","The ______ lion roared from the hilltop.","強大的獅子在山頂咆哮。","almighty a. 全能的；God Almighty 全能的上帝；powerful a. 強大的；might n. 力量","a.","mighty","The mighty lion roared from the hilltop.","原書例句"],["swift","迅速的；迅速地","A ______ current carried the boat down the river.","湍急的水流把船沖向下游。","prompt a. 迅速的；quick a. 快的；rapid a. 迅速的","a. & adv.","swift","A swift current carried the boat down the river.","原書例句"],["approve","贊成；批准","The manager didn’t ______ our plan because it was too risky.","經理不贊成我們的計畫，因為風險太高。","approve of... 贊成……；agree to... 同意……；approval n. 贊成／批准；meet with one’s approval 得到某人贊同","vt. & vi.","approve","The manager didn’t approve our plan because it was too risky.","原書例句"],["lightning","閃電","The farmer was struck by ______ but fortunately he survived.","那名農夫遭雷擊，但幸運地活了下來。","a bolt of lightning 一道閃電；thunder n. 雷","n.","lightning","The farmer was struck by lightning but fortunately he survived.","原書例句"],["pitch","瀝青；音高；投（球）；搭（帳篷）","Dad ______ the ball to my sister, and she swung the bat.","爸爸把球投給我妹妹，她揮棒擊球。","pitch-black a. 漆黑的；pitcher n. 投手；pitch a tent 搭帳篷；high-pitched voice 高音調的聲音","n. & vt.","pitched","Dad pitched the ball to my sister, and she swung the bat.","原書例句"]],"U19":[["ash","灰；灰燼","Mary emptied the ______ in the trash can.","瑪麗把灰燼倒進垃圾桶裡。","turn to ashes 化為灰燼；ashtray n. 菸灰缸","n.","ashes","Mary emptied the ashes in the trash can.","原書例句"],["ashtray","菸灰缸","Please put the cigarette ash in the ______.","請把菸灰放進菸灰缸裡。","—","n.","ashtray","Please put the cigarette ash in the ______.","練習新編句"],["rumor","謠言；傳聞","______ has it that Gatsby is going to marry a rich widow.","謠傳蓋茲比將娶一位有錢的寡婦。","Rumor has it that... 據傳……；It is rumored / said that... 據說……；Rumors spread that... 謠傳……","n.","Rumor","Rumor has it that Gatsby is going to marry a rich widow.","原書例句"],["echo","回響；回聲","I heard vague ______ of someone’s footsteps.","我聽到某人模糊的腳步回聲。","repeat vt. 重複；reiterate vt. 重申；vague a. 模糊不清的","vi. & n.","echoes","I heard vague echoes of someone’s footsteps.","原書例句"],["sweat","流汗；汗","I ______ a lot on hot days.","大熱天我會流很多汗。","sweat a lot / heavily 大量流汗；sweat like a pig 汗流浹背；No sweat. 沒問題。；break a sweat 開始流汗；perspire vi. 流汗","vi. & n.","sweat","I sweat a lot on hot days.","原書例句"],["perspire","流汗","People often ______ heavily when exercising in hot weather.","人們在炎熱天氣運動時常會大量流汗。","break a sweat 開始流汗","vi.","perspire","People often ______ heavily when exercising in hot weather.","練習新編句"],["tub","浴缸；盆","My apartment, sadly, does not have a ______.","很遺憾，我的公寓沒有浴缸。","bathtub n. 浴缸（= bath）","n.","tub","My apartment, sadly, does not have a tub.","原書例句"],["peel","果皮；削皮","Scientists have discovered that banana ______ contain alcohol.","科學家已發現香蕉皮含有酒精。","peeler n. 削皮器","n. & vt.","peels","Scientists have discovered that banana peels contain alcohol.","原書例句"],["handy","方便的；手邊的","You’d better carry an umbrella with you; it may come in ______.","你最好帶把傘，它可能隨時會派得上用場。","come in handy 派得上用場；gadget n. 小器具","a.","handy","You’d better carry an umbrella with you; it may come in handy.","原書例句"],["handful","一把；少數","The boy grabbed a ______ of berries and tucked them in his pocket.","那男孩抓了一把莓果塞進口袋裡。","a handful of... 一把／少數的……；tuck vt. 塞入","n.","handful","The boy grabbed a handful of berries and tucked them in his pocket.","原書例句"],["outline","大綱；輪廓；概述","Our teacher asked us to write an ______ before writing our research papers.","老師要求我們先擬大綱再寫研究報告。","sketch n. & vt. 草圖／素描；summarize vt. 摘要","n. & vt.","outline","Our teacher asked us to write an outline before writing our research papers.","原書例句"],["tray","托盤","The waitress brought the drinks we ordered on a ______.","女服務生用托盤端來我們點的飲料。","—","n.","tray","The waitress brought the drinks we ordered on a tray.","原書例句"],["hasty","匆忙的；草率的","A ______ decision is often regretted later.","草率的決定往往事後令人後悔。","hasten vt. & vi. 加速；haste n. 匆忙；in haste = in a hurry = in a rush 匆忙地；hurried a. 匆忙的；hastily adv. 匆忙地","a.","hasty","A hasty decision is often regretted later.","原書例句"],["hastily","匆忙地；草率地","Don’t do things ______, or you’re likely to make mistakes.","做事不要草率，否則你很可能會犯錯。","in haste = hurriedly 匆忙地","adv.","hastily","Don’t do things hastily, or you’re likely to make mistakes.","原書例句"],["saving(s)","存款（常用複數）；節省","She puts part of her salary into her ______ every month.","她每個月把一部分薪水存入存款。","open a savings account 開儲蓄帳戶；open a checking account 開支票帳戶；earnings n. 收入；income n. 收入；revenue n. 收入／收益","n.","savings","She puts part of her salary into her ______ every month.","練習新編句"],["earnings","收入（常用複數）","Thanks to our successful marketing strategies, our company’s ______ increased by 20% last quarter.","多虧成功的行銷策略，我們公司的收入上季增加了 20%。","income / revenue n. 收入；strategy n. 策略","n.","earnings","Thanks to our successful marketing strategies, our company’s earnings increased by 20% last quarter.","原書例句"],["deposit","存放（銀行）；押金","Jason ______ 200 dollars in the bank each month.","傑森每個月在銀行存 200 美元。","withdraw vt. 提領；deposit money in / into a bank account 存款；withdraw money from a bank account 提款","vt. & n.","deposits","Jason deposits 200 dollars in the bank each month.","原書例句"],["sincere","誠懇的；真誠的","John was ______ in his apology, so his mom forgave him.","約翰真心道歉，所以他媽媽原諒了他。","express one’s sincere thanks / apologies to sb 向某人表達誠摯謝意／歉意；sincerity n. 真誠；insincere a. 不真誠的","a.","sincere","John was sincere in his apology, so his mom forgave him.","原書例句"],["inspect","檢查；視察","The police ______ the bloodstains at the crime scene.","警方檢查犯罪現場的血跡。","inspection n. 檢查；examine vt. 檢驗；investigate vt. 調查；inspector n. 檢查員；examiner n. 檢查員；defect n. 缺陷","vt.","inspected","The police inspected the bloodstains at the crime scene.","原書例句"],["inspector","檢查員","Those ______ were busy checking our products for defects before shipment.","那些檢查員忙著在出貨前檢查我們的產品是否有瑕疵。","examiner n. 檢查員；defect n. 缺陷","n.","inspectors","Those inspectors were busy checking our products for defects before shipment.","原書例句"],["spray","噴灑；噴霧","Mary ______ herself with perfume before going out on a date.","瑪麗在出去約會前噴了香水。","sprinkle vt. 灑；styling spray 定型噴霧","vt. & n.","sprayed","Mary sprayed herself with perfume before going out on a date.","原書例句"],["lobby","大廳；遊說","Harry and I will meet in the hotel ______ tomorrow morning.","哈利和我明天早上會在飯店大廳碰面。","lobbyist n. 說客；persuade vt. 說服；proposal n. 提案","n. & vt. & vi.","lobby","Harry and I will meet in the hotel lobby tomorrow morning.","原書例句"],["hallway","走廊","The restroom is at the end of the ______ on the right-hand side.","洗手間在走廊盡頭的右手邊。","passage / corridor n. 通道","n.","hallway","The restroom is at the end of the hallway on the right-hand side.","原書例句"],["halfway","中途的；在半路上","A ______ house is a place aimed at helping former prisoners turn over a new leaf.","中途之家旨在幫助更生人改過自新。","a halfway house 中途之家；meet sb halfway 與某人各退一步","a. & adv.","halfway","A halfway house is a place aimed at helping former prisoners turn over a new leaf.","原書例句"],["fond","喜好的","Kim is really ______ of heavy metal.","金真的很喜歡重金屬樂。","be fond of... 喜歡……","a.","fond","Kim is really fond of heavy metal.","原書例句"],["harvest","收割；收穫","The farmers had to ______ the rice before the typhoon came.","農夫們必須在颱風來之前收割稻米。","reap vt. & vi. 收割；farmhand n. 農場工人","vt. & n.","harvest","The farmers had to harvest the rice before the typhoon came.","原書例句"],["gamble","賭博；冒險","James loves to ______ by buying lottery tickets each week.","詹姆士喜歡每週買彩券來賭博。","gamble A on B 把 A 賭在 B 上；take a gamble 冒險而為；bet vt. & n. 賭","vt. & vi. & n.","gamble","James loves to gamble by buying lottery tickets each week.","原書例句"],["sleeve","袖子","It looks like the boxer is going to lose the fight, but I believe he still has some tricks up his ______.","那名拳擊手看來好像快輸了，但我相信他還留了幾手。","have sth up one’s sleeve 留有錦囊妙計；roll up one’s sleeves 捲起袖子","n.","sleeve","It looks like the boxer is going to lose the fight, but I believe he still has some tricks up his sleeve.","原書例句"],["collar","衣領","Todd grabbed George by the ______ and punched him in the face.","陶德抓住喬治的衣領並朝他臉上揍了一拳。","white-collar a. 白領階級的；blue-collar a. 藍領階級的；color n. 顏色","n.","collar","Todd grabbed George by the collar and punched him in the face.","原書例句"],["truthful","誠實的；真實的","You can trust Jim; he is a ______ and upright man.","你可以信任吉姆，他為人誠實又正直。","honest a. 誠實的；true a. 真實的；truth n. 真相","a.","truthful","You can trust Jim; he is a truthful and upright man.","原書例句"],["kilometer","公里（長度單位）","The Great Wall is thousands of ______ long.","萬里長城長達數千公里。","亦可寫成 km；meter n. 公尺；centimeter n. 公分","n.","kilometers","The Great Wall is thousands of kilometers long.","原書例句"],["awful","可怕的；很差的","Denny’s handwriting was so ______ that the teacher asked him to rewrite his report.","丹尼的字跡太糟了，所以老師要他重寫報告。","horrible / terrible a. 可怕的／很差的","a.","awful","Denny’s handwriting was so awful that the teacher asked him to rewrite his report.","原書例句"],["discount","打折；折扣","Shops ______ everything around holidays.","商店會在假日前後大打折扣。","give sb a 20% / 40% discount on sth 給某人某物八折／六折優惠；reduction n. 減價；boutique n. 時裝精品店","vt. & n.","discount","Shops discount everything around holidays.","原書例句"],["drain","排出；排水管","The water in the bathtub should be ______ first.","浴缸的水應該先放掉。","brain drain 人才外流","vt. & n.","drained","The water in the bathtub should be drained first.","原書例句"],["pit","坑","We dug a ______ for the campfire.","為了生營火，我們挖了一個坑。","hole n. 洞","n.","pit","We dug a pit for the campfire.","原書例句"],["chip","碎片；晶片；削下一小片","The detective found some ______ of wood on the floor.","偵探在地板上發現一些木屑。","chip, chipped, chipped；be a chip off the old block 與父親極為相像","n. & vt.","chips","The detective found some chips of wood on the floor.","原書例句"],["tug","用力拉；拖","My girlfriend gently ______ my arm, asking me to give her a kiss.","我女朋友輕輕拉我的手臂，要我親她一下。","tug, tugged, tugged；tug sb’s arm 拉某人的手臂；tug on / at sb’s sleeve 拉某人的袖子；tugboat n. 拖船；tug-of-war n. 拔河","vt. & vi. & n.","tugged","My girlfriend gently tugged my arm, asking me to give her a kiss.","原書例句"],["tug-of-war","拔河比賽","My class played against Christine’s in a ______.","我們班和克莉絲汀她那班比賽拔河。","—","n.","tug-of-war","My class played against Christine’s in a tug-of-war.","原書例句"],["beetle","甲蟲","My brother keeps a ______ as a pet.","我哥哥養了一隻甲蟲當寵物。","dragonfly n. 蜻蜓；moth n. 蛾；butterfly n. 蝴蝶；pupa n. 蛹；cocoon n. 繭","n.","beetle","My brother keeps a beetle as a pet.","原書例句"],["dragonfly","蜻蜓","Different species of ______ can be found near the lake.","湖邊可以找到不同種類的蜻蜓。","species n. 種類","n.","dragonflies","Different species of dragonflies can be found near the lake.","原書例句"],["moth","蛾","Can you distinguish between a ______ and a butterfly?","你分得出蛾和蝴蝶嗎？","moth 和 butterfly 屬同一科；pupa n. 蛹；cocoon n. 繭","n.","moth","Can you distinguish between a moth and a butterfly?","原書例句"],["apron","圍裙","Mother put on her kitchen ______ and cooked us a meal.","媽媽穿上廚房圍裙，為我們煮了一頓飯。","—","n.","apron","Mother put on her kitchen apron and cooked us a meal.","原書例句"],["cock","公雞（= rooster）","______ usually crow in the early morning.","公雞通常在清晨啼叫。","cock 亦可作 vt. 翹起；rooster n. 公雞","n.","Cocks","Cocks usually crow in the early morning.","原書例句"],["fighter","戰鬥機；鬥士","The ______ plane crashed, killing its two pilots.","那架戰鬥機墜毀，造成兩名飛行員死亡。","a jet fighter 噴射戰鬥機；crime fighter 打擊犯罪者","n.","fighter","The fighter plane crashed, killing its two pilots.","原書例句"],["brick","磚塊","Tom built a house of ______.","湯姆蓋了一棟磚造房屋。","a bricklayer 砌磚工人","n.","bricks","Tom built a house of bricks.","原書例句"],["spaghetti","義大利麵條（不可數）","I ate two plates of ______ at the party.","我在派對上吃了兩盤義大利麵。","macaroni n. 通心麵","n.","spaghetti","I ate two plates of spaghetti at the party.","原書例句"],["steam","蒸氣；蒸；冒蒸氣","______ engines were developed in the 18th century.","蒸汽引擎在 18 世紀發展出來。","run out of steam 精疲力竭；let / blow off steam 發洩精力／怒氣；steam up sth 使某物蒙上水氣；steamer n. 蒸汽船","n. & vt. & vi.","Steam","Steam engines were developed in the 18th century.","原書例句"]],"U20":[["import","進口；進口品","Most cheeses in that store are ______ from France.","那家店的起司大多是從法國進口。","import sth to + 地方 將某物進口至某地；import sth from + 地方 從某地進口某物","vt. & n.","imported","Most cheeses in that store are imported from France.","原書例句"],["export","出口；輸出品","Cheap toys made in that country are ______ to the US in large numbers every year.","由那個國家製造的便宜玩具每年都會大量出口到美國去。","export sth to + 地方 出口某物至某地；export sth from + 地方 從某地出口某物","vt. & n.","exported","Cheap toys made in that country are exported to the US in large numbers every year.","原書例句"],["tribe","部落","Each of the ______ has its distinctive tribal traditions and cultures.","每個部落都有其獨特的部落傳統及文化。","tribal a. 部落的","n.","tribes","Each of the tribes has its distinctive tribal traditions and cultures.","原書例句"],["leisure","閒暇；空閒時間","What do you usually do at your ______?","你空閒時通常做些什麼事？","at one’s leisure = at one’s free time 某人閒暇時間；leisurely a. 從容不迫地 & a. 休閒的；lead / live a leisurely life 過著悠閒的生活","n.","leisure","What do you usually do at your leisure?","原書例句"],["gum","牙齦（複數）；口香糖（不可數）","I went to see a dentist for my sore ______.","因為牙齦疼痛，我去看了牙醫。","chewing gum / bubble gum 口香糖","n.","gums","I went to see a dentist for my sore gums.","原書例句"],["awake","醒來；醒著的","I was raining outside when Dylan ______.","狄倫醒來時，外面正下著雨。","awake, awoke / awaked, awoken / awaked；be awake to sth 了解某事；wake up 醒來","vi. & a.","awoke","I was raining outside when Dylan awoke.","原書例句"],["awaken","喚醒；醒來","Bill was ______ up by a strange noise in the middle of the night.","比爾半夜被一個奇怪的聲音吵醒。","awaken sb to sth 喚醒某人注意某事；waken vt. & vi. 喚醒／醒來","vt. & vi.","woken","Bill was woken up by a strange noise in the middle of the night.","原書例句"],["heap","一堆；大量","There is a ______ of dirty clothes on Jack’s bed.","傑克的床上有一堆髒衣服。","a heap of... 一堆……","n.","heap","There is a heap of dirty clothes on Jack’s bed.","原書例句"],["ivory","象牙；象牙製的（不可數）；象牙色的","A gown made of elephant has two long tusks of ______.","大象有兩根長長的象牙。","ivories n. 鋼琴鍵；live in an ivory tower 住在象牙塔裡","n. & a.","ivory","A gown made of elephant has two long tusks of ivory.","原書例句"],["stubborn","固執的","Jane wanted to try traveling abroad all by herself, but her ______ parents wouldn’t let her.","珍想嘗試獨自一人出國旅行，但她固執的父母不讓她去。","be as stubborn as a mule 像騾子一樣固執；willful a. 任性的","a.","stubborn","Jane wanted to try traveling abroad all by herself, but her stubborn parents wouldn’t let her.","原書例句"],["greedy","貪心的；貪婪的","The young man is ______ for power.","那位年輕人貪求權力。","be greedy for... 貪求……；greed n. 貪婪","a.","greedy","The young man is greedy for power.","原書例句"],["optimistic","樂觀的","Investors are still relatively ______ about the company’s prospects.","投資人對該公司的前景仍相對樂觀。","optimism n. 樂觀；pessimistic a. 悲觀的；optimist n. 樂觀者","a.","optimistic","Investors are still relatively optimistic about the company’s prospects.","原書例句"],["rid","擺脫；去除","The police chief promised he would do whatever he could to ______ the city of crime.","警察局長承諾會盡其所能消除城市的犯罪。","rid, rid, rid；get rid of sth 擺脫／除去某物","vt.","rid","The police chief promised he would do whatever he could to rid the city of crime.","原書例句"],["moist","潮濕的；濕潤的","The warm and ______ climate here makes it a perfect place for tropical fruits.","這裡溫暖潮濕的氣候使其成為熱帶水果生長的絕佳地方。","damp / humid a. 潮濕的；moist vt. 使潮濕；moisture n. 水分／濕氣","a.","moist","The warm and moist climate here makes it a perfect place for tropical fruits.","原書例句"],["moisture","水分；濕氣","______ is taken out of the air by this machine, after which it turns into water.","這臺機器會將空氣中的水分抽出，之後水分會變成水。","dampness n. 潮濕","n.","Moisture","Moisture is taken out of the air by this machine, after which it turns into water.","原書例句"],["laundry","洗衣物；洗衣店","I used to do the ______ once a week when I lived in a dormitory.","我以前住在宿舍時一週洗一次衣服。","do the laundry 洗衣服；do the dishes 洗碗盤","n.","laundry","I used to do the laundry once a week when I lived in a dormitory.","原書例句"],["chill","使冰冷；感到寒冷；寒意","I felt the ______ in the air when I left home this morning and realized that winter was around the corner.","今天早上離開家時，我感到空氣中的寒意，並意識到冬天快到了。","catch a chill 著涼；catch a cold 感冒；a chill of fear 一陣恐懼；chill to the bone 冷入骨髓；chill out 放鬆","vt. & vi. & n.","chill","I felt the chill in the air when I left home this morning and realized that winter was around the corner.","原書例句"],["chilly","冷的；寒冷的","It is getting ______ in here. Let’s turn the heater on.","這裡開始變冷了，我們把暖氣打開吧。","cold a. 冷的","a.","chilly","It is getting chilly in here. Let’s turn the heater on.","原書例句"],["headline","頭條新聞；標題","The financial scandal has been in the ______ for weeks.","這起財務醜聞已連續數週登上頭條新聞。","be in the headlines 成為頭條新聞；hit the headlines 成為頭條新聞；grab / make the headlines 成為頭條新聞","n.","headlines","The financial scandal has been in the headlines for weeks.","原書例句"],["heading","標題；題目","What’s the ______ of that article you mentioned?","你提到的那篇文章標題是什麼？","title n. 標題","n.","heading","What’s the heading of that article you mentioned?","原書例句"],["bleed","流血","After being hit in the face with a volleyball, Tom’s nose kept ______.","湯姆的臉被排球打中後，鼻子一直流血。","bleed, bled, bled","vi.","bleeding","After being hit in the face with a volleyball, Tom’s nose kept bleeding.","原書例句"],["bloody","血淋淋的；血腥的","Many people consider boxing to be a ______ and violent sport.","許多人認為拳擊是一項血腥且暴力的運動。","in blood 流血","a.","bloody","Many people consider boxing to be a bloody and violent sport.","原書例句"],["dash","猛衝；短跑；少量","Frank ______ to the toilet as soon as the rain was over.","雨一停，法蘭克就衝向廁所。","dash to / for... 衝向……；make a dash for... 衝向……；dash sb’s dreams 粉碎某人的夢想；sprint vi. & n. 短跑","vi. & n.","dashed","Frank dashed to the toilet as soon as the rain was over.","原書例句"],["robe","長袍；浴袍","The judge was wearing a black ______.","法官穿著黑色長袍。","bathrobe n. 浴袍；dressing gown n. 浴袍","n.","robe","The judge was wearing a black robe.","原書例句"],["icy","冰冷的；冰封的","Be careful! The sidewalk is ______.","小心！人行道結冰了。","icy cold 冰冷的；ice n. 冰","a.","icy","Be careful! The sidewalk is icy.","原書例句"],["iced","冰鎮的","Nothing beats a glass of ______ / icy tea on a hot day.","大熱天，沒有什麼比一杯冰茶更棒了。","iced tea 冰茶","a.","iced","Nothing beats a glass of iced / icy tea on a hot day.","原書例句"],["screw","旋緊；螺絲；性交（粗俗用語）","I used strong ______ to fix the shelf to the wall.","我用堅固的螺絲把架子固定在牆上。","screw A to B 用螺絲將 A 鎖在 B 上；screw up / mess up 搞砸；a screwdriver 螺絲起子；a wrench 扳手；a hammer 鐵鎚","vt. & n.","screws","I used strong screws to fix the shelf to the wall.","原書例句"],["pottery","陶器（集合名詞；不可數）","Bill has a fine collection of ______.","比爾有一批很棒的陶器收藏。","—","n.","pottery","Bill has a fine collection of pottery.","原書例句"],["porcelain","瓷器（不可數）","I bought this ______ vase at an auction.","我在拍賣會上買了這個瓷器花瓶。","—","n.","porcelain","I bought this porcelain vase at an auction.","原書例句"],["vitamin","維他命","______ C is crucial for healthy gums.","維他命 C 對健康的牙齦非常重要。","Vitamin C 維他命 C","n.","Vitamin","Vitamin C is crucial for healthy gums.","原書例句"],["ache","疼痛；痛處","My heart ______ when I saw images of flood-stricken refugee camps on TV.","當我在電視上看到遭洪水侵襲的難民營畫面時，我感到心痛。","ache for sth 渴望某物；long for sth 渴望某物；have a headache 頭痛；have a toothache 牙痛；have a backache 背痛；have a stomachache 胃痛","vi. & n.","ached","My heart ached when I saw images of flood-stricken refugee camps on TV.","原書例句"],["sometime","某個時候","Let’s meet ______ next week to discuss the details of our plan, all right?","我們下週找個時間見面討論計畫的細節，好嗎？","I’ll see you sometime. 有空再見。；sometimes adv. 有時；someday adv. 有朝一日","adv.","sometime","Let’s meet sometime next week to discuss the details of our plan, all right?","原書例句"],["sometimes","有時候","I call on my grandparents in the country ______.","我有時會去鄉下探望祖父母。","at times / on occasion / occasionally 有時","adv.","sometimes","I call on my grandparents in the country sometimes.","原書例句"],["someday","有朝一日","I’m sure my luck will change ______.","我相信總有一天我的運氣會改變。","—","adv.","someday","I’m sure my luck will change someday.","原書例句"],["heal","治癒；癒合","My broken leg is gradually ______, but the doctor said it’ll take me three more weeks to fully recover.","我的斷腿正逐漸癒合，但醫生說還要三個星期才能完全康復。","cure vt. 治癒","vt. & vi.","healing","My broken leg is gradually healing, but the doctor said it’ll take me three more weeks to fully recover.","原書例句"],["jungle","叢林；密林","They said the rebels had a stronghold deep in the ______.","他們說叛軍在叢林深處有一個據點。","a concrete jungle 水泥叢林；forest n. 森林；woods n. 樹林","n.","jungle","They said the rebels had a stronghold deep in the jungle.","原書例句"],["pave","鋪（路）","The construction workers were busy ______ the road.","建築工人正忙著鋪路。","pave the way for... 為……鋪路；pavement n. 人行道／路面；sidewalk n. 人行道","vt.","paving","The construction workers were busy paving the road.","原書例句"],["pavement","人行道；路面","David fell from his bike and his head hit the ______.","大衛從腳踏車上摔下來，頭撞到路面。","sidewalk n. 人行道","n.","pavement","David fell from his bike and his head hit the pavement.","原書例句"],["sword","劍","The young man drew his ______ and challenged the knight to a duel.","年輕人拔出劍，向騎士提出決鬥。","swordsman n. 劍客","n.","sword","The young man drew his sword and challenged the knight to a duel.","原書例句"],["armed","武裝的","The bank robber was ______ with only a knife.","銀行搶匪只帶著一把刀。","be armed with... 以……武裝；armed robbery 持械搶劫；unarmed a. 未武裝的","a.","armed","The bank robber was armed with only a knife.","原書例句"],["canyon","峽谷","Have you ever visited the Grand ______ in Arizona?","你去過亞利桑那州的大峽谷嗎？","a canyon wall 峽谷壁","n.","Canyon","Have you ever visited the Grand Canyon in Arizona?","原書例句"],["sprain","扭傷；扭傷","Paula tripped on her shoelaces and ______ her ankle.","寶拉被自己的鞋帶絆倒，扭傷了腳踝。","twist vt. 扭傷；wrench vt. 扭傷","vt. & n.","sprained","Paula tripped on her shoelaces and sprained her ankle.","原書例句"],["dive","跳水；俯衝","The boys took off their clothes and ______ into the river.","男孩們脫掉衣服，跳進河裡。","dive, dived / dove, dived；dive into... 跳入……；take a dive 跳水；skydive vi. 高空跳傘；skydiving n. 高空跳傘","vi. & n.","dived","The boys took off their clothes and dived into the river.","原書例句"],["violet","紫羅蘭；紫羅蘭色的","______ are my grandmother’s favorite flowers.","紫羅蘭是我祖母最喜愛的花。","tulip n. 鬱金香","n. & a.","Violets","Violets are my grandmother’s favorite flowers.","原書例句"],["tulip","鬱金香","______ are on sale today at the flower shop.","今天花店的鬱金香特價。","—","n.","Tulips","Tulips are on sale today at the flower shop.","原書例句"]],"U21":[["luggage","行李（不可數）","Don’t forget to claim your ______ before you leave the airport.","離開機場前別忘了領取你的行李。","a piece of luggage 一件行李；two pieces of luggage 兩件行李；a lot of luggage 很多行李；baggage n. 行李（不可數）；claim one’s luggage 領取行李","n.","luggage","Don’t forget to claim your luggage before you leave the airport.","原書例句"],["baggage","行李（不可數）","Be sure to check the ______ allowance for your airline.","務必確認你搭乘航空公司的行李限額。","baggage allowance 行李限額；a piece of baggage 一件行李","n.","baggage","Be sure to check the baggage allowance for your airline.","原書例句"],["excellence","優秀；卓越","Professor Burton is well-known for his academic ______.","波頓教授以其學術上的卓越表現聞名。","excellent a. 優秀的；excel vi. 勝過；excel in / at... 擅長……；be good at... 擅長……","n.","excellence","Professor Burton is well-known for his academic excellence.","原書例句"],["excellent","優秀的；卓越的","She did an ______ job on the science project.","她的科學專題做得非常出色。","excellence n. 卓越","a.","excellent","She did an ______ job on the science project.","練習新編句"],["excel","勝過；擅長","I’m amazed at Peter’s ______ in Chinese calligraphy.","彼得在中國書法方面的卓越表現令我驚訝。","excel in / at... 擅長……","vi.","excellence","I’m amazed at Peter’s excellence in Chinese calligraphy.","原書例句"],["spoil","腐壞；寵壞；破壞","Food tends to ______ quickly in summer.","食物在夏天往往很快就會腐壞。","spoil, spoiled / spoilt, spoiled / spoilt；ruin vt. 毀壞；Spare the rod, spoil the child. 玉不琢，不成器。","vi. & vt.","spoil","Food tends to spoil quickly in summer.","原書例句"],["novelist","小說家","Ken was just an average Joe until he wrote the book. He is a famous ______ now.","肯原本只是個平凡人，直到他寫了那本書。現在他是位知名小說家。","novel n. 小說；an average Joe 平凡人","n.","novelist","Ken was just an average Joe until he wrote the book. He is a famous novelist now.","原書例句"],["invent","發明；捏造","Some people claim that Bell didn’t ______ the telephone.","有些人聲稱貝爾並沒有發明電話。","invent a story = make up a story 捏造故事；invention n. 發明；inventive a. 有創意的；inventor n. 發明家；alibi n. 不在場證明","vt.","invent","Some people claim that Bell didn’t invent the telephone.","原書例句"],["invention","發明；發明物","The telephone was an important ______.","電話是一項重要的發明。","invent vt. 發明","n.","invention","The telephone was an important ______.","練習新編句"],["inventive","有創意的；善於發明的","The student found an ______ way to solve the problem.","那名學生找到一個很有創意的方法解決問題。","invent vt. 發明","a.","inventive","The student found an ______ way to solve the problem.","練習新編句"],["inventor","發明家","Edison was one of the greatest ______ of the twentieth century.","愛迪生是二十世紀最偉大的發明家之一。","invent vt. 發明","n.","inventors","Edison was one of the greatest inventors of the twentieth century.","原書例句"],["cheerful","愉快的；開朗的","Ruth can speak in a ______ tone even when she is really mad.","露絲即使真的很生氣，也能用愉快的語氣說話。","in a cheerful tone 以愉快的語氣","a.","cheerful","Ruth can speak in a cheerful tone even when she is really mad.","原書例句"],["gossip","閒話；八卦；說閒話","My friend Ruby always keeps me up to date with the latest ______ about celebrities.","我的朋友露比總會讓我知道名人最新的八卦消息。","gossip about... 談論……的八卦；rumor n. 謠言；hearsay n. 傳聞","n. & vi.","gossip","My friend Ruby always keeps me up to date with the latest gossip about celebrities.","原書例句"],["dump","丟棄；甩掉；垃圾場","The police finally found the stolen car, which had been ______ near the beach.","警方最後找到那輛被偷的車，它被丟棄在海灘附近。","dump sb = walk out on sb 甩掉某人；jerk n. 討厭鬼","vt. & n.","dumped","The police finally found the stolen car, which had been dumped near the beach.","原書例句"],["ditch","溝渠；拋棄","Farmers use ______ for draining water.","農夫利用溝渠排水。","ditch sb = dump sb = walk out on sb 甩掉某人；drain vt. 排水","n. & vt.","ditches","Farmers use ditches for draining water.","原書例句"],["dairy","乳品店；乳製品的","______ products, such as cheese and butter, are produced from milk.","乳製品，例如起司和奶油，都是由牛奶製成的。","dairies（複數）；dairy products 乳製品；diary n. 日記；keep / write a diary 寫日記","n. & a.","Dairy","Dairy products, such as cheese and butter, are produced from milk.","原書例句"],["jar","罐子","I bought a ______ of peanut butter at the supermarket.","我在超級市場買了一罐花生醬。","container n. 容器","n.","jar","I bought a jar of peanut butter at the supermarket.","原書例句"],["sticky","黏的；悶熱潮濕的","I was sweating like a pig because it was hot and ______.","因為天氣又熱又悶，我汗流浹背。","stick vt. 黏；sweat like a pig 汗流浹背","a.","sticky","I was sweating like a pig because it was hot and sticky.","原書例句"],["advanced","先進的；高級的；年老的","This digital camera is the most ______ model on the market.","這臺數位相機是市面上最先進的機型。","advance vi. 前進 & vt. 促進；in advance = beforehand 事先；at an advanced age 高齡","a.","advanced","This digital camera is the most advanced model on the market.","原書例句"],["bacon","培根","A typical English breakfast includes eggs, ______, sausages, baked beans, and a cup of tea.","典型的英式早餐包括蛋、培根、香腸、焗豆和一杯茶。","bring home the bacon = support one’s family = be responsible for the livelihood of one’s family 養家","n.","bacon","A typical English breakfast includes eggs, bacon, sausages, baked beans, and a cup of tea.","原書例句"],["bait","餌；引誘","The con artist used a small amount of money as ______ to cheat the old man out of all his life savings.","那名騙子用一小筆錢作餌，騙走老人一生的積蓄。","take the bait 上鉤；bait sth with... 用……作餌；con artist / con man 騙子","n. & vt.","bait","The con artist used a small amount of money as bait to cheat the old man out of all his life savings.","原書例句"],["beast","野獸；畜生","The power of reason is believed to be the chief difference between man and ______.","理性能力被認為是人類與野獸之間最主要的差別。","monster n. 怪物；monstrous a. 巨大的／可怕的","n.","beasts","The power of reason is believed to be the chief difference between man and beasts.","原書例句"],["monster","怪物","The witch turned the animal into a ______.","女巫把那隻動物變成了怪物。","monstrous a. 巨大的；可怕的","n.","monster","The witch turned the animal into a monster.","原書例句"],["berry","莓果","Tom picked some ______ from that bush and popped them into his mouth.","湯姆從那叢灌木上摘了一些莓果，塞進嘴裡。","strawberry n. 草莓；blueberry n. 藍莓；cranberry n. 蔓越莓；mulberry n. 桑葚；cherry n. 櫻桃","n.","berries","Tom picked some berries from that bush and popped them into his mouth.","原書例句"],["cherry","櫻桃；櫻桃色的","Mr. Brown grew a ______ tree in his backyard.","布朗先生在後院種了一棵櫻桃樹。","cherry lips 櫻桃般紅潤的嘴唇","n. & a.","cherry","Mr. Brown grew a cherry tree in his backyard.","原書例句"],["best-seller","暢銷書（或商品）","The writer’s latest novel has been a ______ for over 20 weeks.","這位作家的最新小說已暢銷超過二十週。","sell like hot cakes 熱賣","n.","best-seller","The writer’s latest novel has been a best-seller for over 20 weeks.","原書例句"],["pancake","鬆餅","Can I have some of your ______? I’m starving.","我可以吃一些你的鬆餅嗎？我快餓死了。","—","n.","pancakes","Can I have some of your pancakes? I’m starving.","原書例句"],["jelly","果凍","Tonight we’ll have some ______ for dessert.","今晚我們會吃一些果凍當甜點。","—","n.","jelly","Tonight we’ll have some jelly for dessert.","原書例句"],["brake","煞車；煞車","Nicole put on the ______ all of a sudden and my head almost hit the windshield.","妮可突然煞車，我的頭差點撞上擋風玻璃。","put on / apply the brakes 煞車；windshield n. 擋風玻璃；break vt. 打破 & n. 破裂處","n. & vi.","brakes","Nicole put on the brakes all of a sudden and my head almost hit the windshield.","原書例句"],["bud","花苞；發芽","The roses in my backyard are in ______.","我後院的玫瑰正含苞待放。","bud, budded, budded；be in bud 含苞待放；nip sth in the bud 防患於未然；nip vt. 掐／夾","n. & vi.","bud","The roses in my backyard are in bud.","原書例句"],["yolk","蛋黃","An egg is made up of the ______ and the white.","一顆蛋由蛋黃和蛋白組成。","egg white 蛋白","n.","yolk","An egg is made up of the yolk and the white.","原書例句"],["buffet","自助餐；連續猛擊","It’s an all-you-can-eat ______, so take whatever you want and pig out!","這是吃到飽自助餐，所以想吃什麼就拿什麼，盡情大吃吧！","an all-you-can-eat buffet 吃到飽；be buffeted by... 受到……接連打擊；strike vt. 打擊","n. & vt.","buffet","It’s an all-you-can-eat buffet, so take whatever you want and pig out!","原書例句"],["bump","碰撞；腫塊","I ______ into an old friend of mine on the street last night.","昨晚我在街上巧遇一位老朋友。","bump into sb = run across sb 偶遇某人；bump into sth / sb 撞上……；bumper n. 保險桿；bumpy a. 顛簸的；a bumpy road 顛簸的道路","vi. & n.","bumped","I bumped into an old friend of mine on the street last night.","原書例句"],["carpenter","木匠","A few ______ were hired by the government to reconstruct the temple.","政府雇用了幾名木匠重建這座寺廟。","carpentry n. 木工；mason n. 泥水匠；plumber n. 水管工；tailor n. 裁縫；a tailor-made / custom-made suit 訂製西裝；a ready-made suit 成衣西裝","n.","carpenters","A few carpenters were hired by the government to reconstruct the temple.","原書例句"],["tailor","裁縫","The ______ makes the man.","人要衣裝。","tailor-made a. 訂製的；custom-made a. 訂製的；ready-made a. 現成的","n.","tailor","The tailor makes the man.","原書例句"],["chat","聊天；閒談","We had a good time ______ over dinner last night.","昨晚我們邊吃晚餐邊聊天，過得很愉快。","chat, chatted, chatted；chat with sb 與某人聊天；have a chat with sb 與某人聊聊；chat room 聊天室；chat over dinner 邊吃晚餐邊聊天","vi. & n.","chatting","We had a good time chatting over dinner last night.","原書例句"],["chop","砍；劈；肉排","Workers were busy ______ down trees in the forest.","工人正忙著砍伐森林裡的樹木。","chop, chopped, chopped；get the chop = get the boot = get the sack = be fired 被開除；a pork chop 豬排；a lamb chop 羊排","vt. & n.","chopping","Workers were busy chopping down trees in the forest.","原書例句"],["slice","薄片；切片","Jerry grabbed a ______ of bread and then rushed to work.","傑瑞抓了一片麵包，然後匆忙去上班。","a slice / piece of bread / cheese / pizza / ham 一片麵包／起司／披薩／火腿","n. & vt.","slice","Jerry grabbed a slice of bread and then rushed to work.","原書例句"],["loaf","一條（麵包）；遊手好閒","We bought a ______ of bread at the bakery.","我們在麵包店買了一條麵包。","loaves（複數）；a loaf of bread 一條麵包；loaf around = play around 閒晃","n. & vi.","loaf","We bought a loaf of bread at the bakery.","原書例句"],["circus","馬戲團","Sammy was so happy when her father promised to take her to the ______ on Saturday night.","珊米的父親答應週六晚上帶她去看馬戲團時，她非常高興。","clown n. 小丑；crow n. 烏鴉；crown n. 皇冠","n.","circus","Sammy was so happy when her father promised to take her to the circus on Saturday night.","原書例句"],["clown","小丑","The funny ______ made all of the children happy.","那個有趣的小丑逗得所有孩子都很開心。","—","n.","clown","The funny clown made all of the children happy.","原書例句"],["clinic","診所","Have you made an appointment with the local ______?","你已經和當地診所預約了嗎？","a dental clinic 牙科診所","n.","clinic","Have you made an appointment with the local clinic?","原書例句"],["stool","凳子；糞便","Roger sat on the bar ______ drinking beer and talking to the bartender.","羅傑坐在酒吧高腳凳上喝啤酒，和酒保聊天。","couch n. 長沙發","n.","stool","Roger sat on the bar stool drinking beer and talking to the bartender.","原書例句"],["zipper","拉鍊；拉上拉鍊","The ______ of the jacket I just bought is not working. What a piece of junk!","我剛買的夾克拉鍊壞了。真是個破爛貨！","zipper = zip；junk n. 垃圾／破爛貨；zip up a coat 拉上外套拉鍊","n. & vt.","zipper","The zipper of the jacket I just bought is not working. What a piece of junk!","原書例句"],["zip","拉上拉鍊","Can you help me ______ up my dress?","你可以幫我把洋裝的拉鍊拉上嗎？","zip, zipped, zipped；zip up... 拉上……的拉鍊","vt.","zip","Can you help me zip up my dress?","原書例句"],["cable","纜線；有線電視","We have to pay to watch ______ TV.","我們必須付費才能看有線電視。","a cable car 纜車；cable TV 有線電視","n.","cable","We have to pay to watch cable TV.","原書例句"],["cart","手推車；馬車","The ______ was full of fruit and vegetables.","手推車裡裝滿了水果和蔬菜。","put the cart before the horse 本末倒置；horse-drawn cart 馬車","n.","cart","The cart was full of fruit and vegetables.","原書例句"]],"U22":[["bravery","勇敢","Peter’s ______ and loyalty led him to complete the mission.","彼得的勇敢和忠誠使他完成了任務。","brave a. 勇敢的；courage n. 勇氣；cowardice n. 膽怯","n.","bravery","Peter’s bravery and loyalty led him to complete the mission.","原書例句"],["cradle","搖籃；抱在懷中","Thanks to the sound welfare system, everyone in this country is well taken care of from the ______ to grave.","多虧健全的福利制度，這個國家的每個人從出生到死亡都受到妥善照顧。","from the cradle to grave 從出生到死亡；cradle... in one’s arms 把……抱在懷中；embrace vt. 擁抱","n. & vt.","cradle","Thanks to the sound welfare system, everyone in this country is well taken care of from the cradle to grave.","原書例句"],["dam","水壩；築壩","The government is building a ______ in that river, but environmentalists are very against it.","政府正在那條河上興建水壩，但環保人士非常反對。","dam, dammed, dammed；reservoir n. 水庫","n. & vt.","dam","The government is building a dam in that river, but environmentalists are very against it.","原書例句"],["darling","親愛的人；親愛的","Oh my ______! How I have missed you!","喔，我親愛的！我好想你！","darling n. 親愛的人；honey n. 親愛的","n. & a.","darling","Oh my darling! How I have missed you!","原書例句"],["deepen","加深；深化","The expert suggested that we ______ the river to prevent flooding.","專家建議我們加深河道以防止洪水。","deep a. 深的；deeply adv. 深深地；depth n. 深度；in depth 深入地；lengthen / shorten / widen / broaden","vt. & vi.","deepen","The expert suggested that we deepen the river to prevent flooding.","原書例句"],["dime","一角硬幣","A ______ is worth one tenth of a United States dollar.","一角硬幣等於十分之一美元。","be a dime a dozen 很普通／不值錢；dime store 廉價商店；penny n. 一分；pence n. penny 的複數；penny-pinching a. 小氣的","n.","dime","A dime is worth one tenth of a United States dollar.","原書例句"],["dip","浸；下降；蘸醬","Mary ______ her handkerchief in soapy water and gently washed it.","瑪麗把手帕浸入肥皂水中，輕輕地洗。","dip, dipped, dipped；dip in / into... 浸入……；take a dip 游泳；skinny-dip 裸泳；dipstick n. 機油尺","vt. & vi. & n.","dipped","Mary dipped her handkerchief in soapy water and gently washed it.","原書例句"],["arrest","逮捕","“Freeze! You’re under ______!” shouted the policeman.","「不准動！你被捕了！」警察喊道。","be under arrest 被逮捕；be under house arrest 被軟禁","vt. & n.","arrest","“Freeze! You’re under arrest!” shouted the policeman.","原書例句"],["erase","擦掉；消除","John helped his teacher ______ the blackboard after class.","約翰下課後幫老師擦黑板。","erase sth from one’s mind 從腦中抹去；eraser n. 橡皮擦；indelible a. 擦不掉的","vt.","erase","John helped his teacher erase the blackboard after class.","原書例句"],["fancy","喜愛；想要；花俏的","Tom has a ______ for spicy Mexican food.","湯姆喜愛辛辣的墨西哥食物。","fancy + V-ing 想要……；fancy dress 華麗服裝；take a fancy to... 喜歡上……；imagination n. 想像力","n. & vt. & a.","fancy","Tom has a fancy for spicy Mexican food.","原書例句"],["fare","車資；票價","How much is the bus ______ from New York to Washington D.C.?","從紐約到華盛頓特區的公車票價是多少？","fee n. 費用；farewell n. 告別；the bus / train fare 公車／火車票價","n.","fare","How much is the bus fare from New York to Washington D.C.?","原書例句"],["flock","群；成群而行","I saw a ______ of sheep on the hillside.","我在山坡上看到一群羊。","a flock of sheep / goats 一群羊／山羊；flock of people 一群人；come in flocks 成群而來","n. & vi.","flock","I saw a flock of sheep on the hillside.","原書例句"],["pint","品脫","Joe accidentally spilled about 10 ______ of cream on the ground.","喬不小心把大約十品脫的鮮奶油灑在地上。","quart n. 夸脫；gallon n. 加侖","n.","pints","Joe accidentally spilled about 10 pints of cream on the ground.","原書例句"],["gasoline","汽油（不可數）","Mike ran out of ______ while in the middle of nowhere.","麥克在荒郊野外時汽油用完了。","gasoline / gas / petrol 汽油；petroleum n. 石油；gas station 加油站；petrol station 加油站","n.","gasoline","Mike ran out of gasoline while in the middle of nowhere.","原書例句"],["grocery","食品雜貨店；食品雜貨","I need to pick up some ______ on my way home.","我回家途中需要買些食品雜貨。","groceries n. 食品雜貨；grocery store 食品雜貨店","n.","groceries","I need to pick up some groceries on my way home.","原書例句"],["stadium","體育場","The concert will be held in a large ______.","演唱會將在一座大型體育場舉行。","gymnasium / gym n. 體育館","n.","stadium","The concert will be held in a large stadium.","原書例句"],["helmet","安全帽；頭盔","Always wear a ______ when you ride a motorcycle.","騎機車時一定要戴安全帽。","wear a helmet 戴安全帽","n.","helmet","Always wear a helmet when you ride a motorcycle.","原書例句"],["hometown","家鄉","William Shakespeare’s memorial is located in his ______.","莎士比亞的紀念館位於他的家鄉。","homeland n. 祖國／家鄉","n.","hometown","William Shakespeare’s memorial is located in his hometown.","原書例句"],["honesty","誠實","John has won my respect not because of his competence but because of his ______.","約翰贏得我的尊敬不是因為他的能力，而是因為他的誠實。","honest a. 誠實的；dishonestly adv. 不誠實地；Honesty is the best policy. 誠實為上策","n.","honesty","John has won my respect not because of his competence but because of his honesty.","原書例句"],["jewel","寶石；珠寶","The billionaire keeps most of his ______ in the bank lest they should be stolen.","那位億萬富翁把大部分珠寶存放在銀行，以免遭竊。","gem n. 寶石；jewelry n. 珠寶（不可數）","n.","jewels","The billionaire keeps most of his jewels in the bank lest they should be stolen.","原書例句"],["junk","垃圾；破爛貨；丟棄","That bicycle I bought yesterday is really a piece of ______.","我昨天買的那輛腳踏車真是個破爛貨。","junk food 垃圾食物；junkyard n. 廢車場／垃圾場","n. & vt.","junk","That bicycle I bought yesterday is really a piece of junk.","原書例句"],["litter","垃圾；亂丟垃圾","After the fair, ______ was everywhere.","市集結束後，到處都是垃圾。","a litter of... 一窩……；litter sth with... 使某處散布……；litterbug n. 亂丟垃圾的人；a litterbag 垃圾袋","n. & vt.","litter","After the fair, litter was everywhere.","原書例句"],["lifetime","一生；終生","For Tommy, going on a trip to India was a chance of a ______.","對湯米而言，去印度旅行是千載難逢的機會。","a chance of a lifetime 千載難逢的機會；in one’s lifetime 在某人一生中；lifelong a. 終生的","n.","lifetime","For Tommy, going on a trip to India was a chance of a lifetime.","原書例句"],["mall","大型購物中心","I usually hang out at the ______ with friends on weekends.","我週末通常和朋友在購物中心閒逛。","shopping mall 購物中心","n.","mall","I usually hang out at the mall with friends on weekends.","原書例句"],["marvelous","極好的；令人驚嘆的","John is famous for his ______ achievements in computer science.","約翰以他在電腦科學方面的傑出成就聞名。","marvel n. 奇蹟 & vi. 驚嘆；marvel at... 對……驚嘆；wonderful a. 極好的","a.","marvelous","John is famous for his marvelous achievements in computer science.","原書例句"],["merry","愉快的；歡樂的","The park was full of smiling parents and ______ children.","公園裡滿是面帶笑容的父母和歡樂的孩子。","Merry Christmas! 聖誕快樂！；cheerful a. 愉快的","a.","merry","The park was full of smiling parents and merry children.","原書例句"],["queer","奇怪的；古怪的","Last night, I heard a ______ noise coming from the basement.","昨晚，我聽到地下室傳來奇怪的聲音。","strange / odd / weird a. 奇怪的","a.","queer","Last night, I heard a queer noise coming from the basement.","原書例句"],["voter","選民","The ______ lined up at the polling station to give the ballots.","選民在投票所排隊投票。","vote vi. & vt. 投票；ballot n. 選票","n.","voters","The voters lined up at the polling station to give the ballots.","原書例句"],["underwear","內衣（不可數）","When Jack opened his suitcase, he realized that he’d forgotten to pack his ______.","傑克打開行李箱時，才發現忘了帶內衣。","—","n.","underwear","When Jack opened his suitcase, he realized that he’d forgotten to pack his underwear.","原書例句"],["trumpet","小號；喇叭","The young man seemed to keep blowing his own ______ in the interview.","那名年輕人在面試中似乎一直自吹自擂。","blow one’s own trumpet / horn 自吹自擂；trumpeter n. 小號手","n.","trumpet","The young man seemed to keep blowing his own trumpet in the interview.","原書例句"],["tower","塔","The ______ is about 100 meters high.","這座塔大約一百公尺高。","—","n.","tower","The tower is about 100 meters high.","原書例句"],["tangerine","橘子","What is the difference between an orange and a ______?","柳橙和橘子有什麼不同？","pineapple n. 鳳梨；melon n. 瓜；cantaloupe n. 哈密瓜；lemonade n. 檸檬水","n.","tangerine","What is the difference between an orange and a tangerine?","原書例句"],["surround","包圍；環繞","All the classmates ______ Tom, praising him for his musical talent at the concert.","所有同學都圍著湯姆，稱讚他在音樂會上的音樂才華。","be surrounded with / by... 被……包圍；surroundings n. 環境（複數）","vt.","surrounded","All the classmates surrounded Tom, praising him for his musical talent at the concert.","原書例句"],["snap","折斷；啪地關上；快照","I usually ______ the lid shut to stop your fingers at a time.","我通常會啪地把蓋子關上。","snap, snapped, snapped；snap one’s fingers 彈指；snap at sb 厲聲斥責某人；snappy a. 俐落的；make snappy 快一點；hurry up 趕快","vt. & vi. & n.","snap","I usually snap the lid shut to stop your fingers at a time.","原書例句"]],"U23":[["microphone","麥克風（= mike）","Speak into the ______ so everyone can hear you.","對著麥克風講話這樣大家才可以聽得到。","a wireless microphone 無線麥克風；wireless a. 無線的","n.","microphone","Speak into the microphone so everyone can hear you.","原書例句"],["microwave","微波爐 & 以微波爐烹調","Reheat the pizza in the ______ oven for two minutes.","把比薩放到微波爐再加熱兩分鐘。","microwave oven 才是「微波爐」正式的說法，但現今許多英美人士均將微波爐簡稱為 a microwave；oven n. 烤箱，烤爐；reheat vt. 再加熱","n. & vt.","microwave","Reheat the pizza in the microwave oven for two minutes.","原書例句"],["nap","打瞌睡 & 打盹；小睡","Grandfather ______ in the armchair while the TV was still on.","爺爺在單人座沙發上打起瞌睡，而電視還開著。","nap, napped, napped；take a nap = take a siesta 小睡一會；siesta n. 小睡（西班牙語，已為英美人士使用）；snap vi. & n. 突然折斷","vi. & n.","napped","Grandfather napped in the armchair while the TV was still on.","原書例句"],["necktie","領帶","You are required to wear a ______ if you want to get into that restaurant.","要進入那間餐廳，你得繫領帶才行。","wear a necktie / tie 繫領帶","n.","necktie","You are required to wear a necktie if you want to get into that restaurant.","原書例句"],["blouse","（女用）罩衫；短衫","Alice looks absolutely stunning in that ______.","穿著那件罩衫的艾麗絲看起來美極了。","shirt n.（男用）襯衫","n.","blouse","Alice looks absolutely stunning in that blouse.","原書例句"],["vest","背心","You can buy a ______ to match your new shirt.","你可以買件背心搭配你這件新的襯衫。","vest 可指搭配西裝穿著的無袖厚背心，亦可指室內衣的無袖汗衫","n.","vest","You can buy a vest to match your new shirt.","原書例句"],["pal","夥伴；哥兒們（口語）","Hey, ______! Want to go see a movie?","嘿，哥兒們，想不想去看場電影？","companion n. 同伴（正式）；buddy n. 老兄／哥兒們（口語）；a pen pal 筆友","n.","pal","Hey, pal! Want to go see a movie?","原書例句"],["parcel","包裹（英）& 分配（與介詞 out 並用）","Please take this ______ to the post office and have it sent immediately.","請把這個包裹拿到郵局立刻把它寄掉。","package n. 包裹（美）；charity n. 慈善機構","n. & vt.","parcel","Please take this parcel to the post office and have it sent immediately.","原書例句"],["passport","護照","You have to present your ______ as you go through customs.","你出入海關必須出示護照。","visa n. 簽證；customs n. 海關（恆用複數）；go through customs 通關／通過出入境檢查過程","n.","passport","You have to present your passport as you go through customs.","原書例句"],["pity","同情；可惜；遺憾 & vt.","______, pitied, pitied；take / have pity on sb 同情某人；It is a pity that... 很遺憾……；It is too bad that...；It is a shame that...；pitiful a. 可憐的；pitiless a. 無憐憫心的／無情的；sympathy n. 同情／憐憫","Mr. Green took pity on me and let me postpone my presentation until Friday.","同情；憐憫","n.","pity","pity, pitied, pitied；take / have pity on sb 同情某人；It is a pity that... 很遺憾……；It is too bad that...；It is a shame that...；pitiful a. 可憐的；pitiless a. 無憐憫心的／無情的；sympathy n. 同情／憐憫","原書例句"],["pollute","汙染","The exhaust from our cars ______ the air and causes asthma in children.","我們汽車排放的廢氣會汙染空氣，使幼童罹患氣喘。","pollutant n. 汙染物；asthma n. 氣喘病","vt.","pollutes","The exhaust from our cars pollutes the air and causes asthma in children.","原書例句"],["pollution","汙染（不可數）","______ control has become one of the country’s major concerns.","汙染防制已成為該國關切的主要議題之一。","air / noise / water pollution 空氣／噪音／水汙染；pollute vt. 汙染；pollutant n. 汙染物","n.","Pollution","Pollution control has become one of the country’s major concerns.","原書例句"],["rot","使腐敗 & 腐化 & vi. 腐朽；腐敗","Sweets will ______ your teeth if you eat too many of them.","如果你吃太多甜食，可是會蛀牙的。","rot, rotted, rotted；decay vt. 使蛀 & vi. 腐爛；weaken vt. 使衰弱","vt. & vi.","rot","Sweets will rot your teeth if you eat too many of them.","原書例句"],["rotten","腐敗的；貪腐的","The smell of ______ food disgusts me.","腐敗的食物味道令我作嘔。","One rotten apple spoils the barrel. 一粒老鼠屎壞了一鍋粥。；barrel n.（中間鼓起的）木製大圓桶","a.","rotten","The smell of rotten food disgusts me.","原書例句"],["rust","鏽 & vi.","The old gate was covered with ______.","那扇舊鐵門覆滿了鐵鏽。","使生鏽 & vi. 生鏽；荒廢","n.","rust","The old gate was covered with ______.","練習新編句"],["sack","大袋子","I’m so tired that I think I’ll just hit the ______.","我好累，所以我想乾脆去睡覺。","hit the sack 睡覺（口語）= hit the hay = turn in（口語）= go to bed（正式）；get the sack = be sacked = be fired 被開除","n.","sack","I’m so tired that I think I’ll just hit the sack.","原書例句"],["shampoo","洗髮精（物質名詞，不可數）& vt.","I need to buy a new bottle of ______.","我需要買一瓶新的洗髮精。","用洗髮精洗髮","n.","shampoo","I need to buy a new bottle of ______.","練習新編句"],["shepherd","牧羊人","The young ______ led a flock of sheep up the hill.","那個年輕的牧羊人把一群羊帶到山坡上。","a shepherd dog 牧羊犬","n.","shepherd","The young shepherd led a flock of sheep up the hill.","原書例句"],["slippery","滑溜溜的","Be careful! The sidewalk is ______.","小心！人行道很滑。","slip vi. 滑倒；slipper n. 拖鞋","a.","slippery","Be careful! The sidewalk is slippery.","原書例句"],["sorrow","悲傷","To our great ______, the doctor said Edward has only another five months to live.","令我們很難過的是，醫生說愛德華只剩五個月可活。","sorrowful a. 悲傷的；sorry a. 難過的；grief n. 悲痛／悲傷","n.","sorrow","To our great sorrow, the doctor said Edward has only another five months to live.","原書例句"],["spy","間諜 & vi.","______, spied, spied；spy on sb 監視某人；detective n. 偵探／刑警","The spy was caught providing information to the enemy.","偵察（與介詞 on 並用）","n.","spy","spy, spied, spied；spy on sb 監視某人；detective n. 偵探／刑警","原書例句"],["scout","偵察；尋找 & n. 童子軍","I’m ______ around for a school that has a good English learning program.","我在找尋有優良英語學習課程的學校。","search vi. 尋找（與 for 並用）；scout for... 尋找…… = search for...；a boy scout 男童軍；a girl scout 女童軍；deed n. 行為","vi.","scouting","I’m scouting around for a school that has a good English learning program.","原書例句"],["tease","揶揄","I couldn’t help getting angry when I found out John was ______ me.","我發現約翰在揶揄我時，就忍不住生氣了。","tease sb = laugh at sb = make fun of sb = pull sb’s leg 愚弄某人（非「扯某人後腿」）","vt.","teasing","I couldn’t help getting angry when I found out John was teasing me.","原書例句"],["tender","溫柔的；（年紀）稚嫩的","The ______ look my mother gave made me smile.","我媽媽溫柔的眼神讓我笑了。","at the tender age of + 年齡 以……歲的稚齡；gentle a. 溫和的","a.","tender","The tender look my mother gave made me smile.","原書例句"],["trunk","樹幹；（汽車）後行李箱；象鼻","Some mountain climbers like to carve their names on tree ______.","有些登山客喜歡把自己的名字刻在樹幹上。","bough n. 大樹枝；branch n. 中樹枝；twig n. 小樹枝／嫩枝；複數形 trunks 可指籃球員或游泳選手穿的運動褲；a pair of trunks 一件短運動褲；a first-aid kit 急救箱；flexible a. 有彈性的","n.","trunks","Some mountain climbers like to carve their names on tree trunks.","原書例句"],["tutor","家庭教師 & vt.","private ______ 私人家庭教師；tutor junior high school students 教導國中生","John’s parents are looking for a private tutor to help him with his English.","教導；給……當家庭教師","n.","tutor","private tutor 私人家庭教師；tutor junior high school students 教導國中生","原書例句"],["wax","蠟 & vt.","styling ______ 髮蠟；earwax n. 耳屎（不可數）","Wax will become liquid when it is heated.","打蠟","n.","wax","styling wax 髮蠟；earwax n. 耳屎（不可數）","原書例句"],["web","全球資訊網（字首大寫）（= the World Wide Web）；蜘蛛網","Nowadays you can find almost anything you’d like to know on the ______.","現今你幾乎可在全球資訊網／網際網路上找到所有你想知道的東西。","net n. 網際網路（字首大寫）（= the internet）；website n. 網站；internet n. 網際網路；prey n. 獵物（集合名詞，不可數）","n.","Web","Nowadays you can find almost anything you’d like to know on the Web.","原書例句"],["bulb","電燈泡（= light bulb）","This light ______ gives off purple light, which is creepy.","這個燈泡會發出紫色的光，令人毛骨悚然。","a lamp 一盞燈（含燈泡及燈罩）；creepy a. 令人毛骨悚然的","n.","bulb","This light bulb gives off purple light, which is creepy.","原書例句"],["mist","薄霧 & vt.","A thin ______ covered the lake early in the morning.","清晨一層薄霧籠罩著湖面。","使蒙上薄霧（與介詞 up 並用）","n.","mist","A thin ______ covered the lake early in the morning.","練習新編句"],["organic","有機的","More and more people are eating ______ food for the sake of their health.","為了健康的緣故，吃有機食物的人越來越多了。","organ n. 器官；organism n. 生物／有機體","a.","organic","More and more people are eating organic food for the sake of their health.","原書例句"],["palm","手掌；棕櫚（樹）","John gripped the coins tightly in his ______.","約翰把這些錢幣緊緊地握在掌中。","palm reading 看手相；read sb’s palms 看某人的手相；fist n. 拳","n.","palm","John gripped the coins tightly in his palm.","原書例句"],["pat","輕拍","Stop ______ me on the head. I have had enough of it.","別再拍我的頭，我受夠了。","pat, patted, patted；pat sb on the + 身體部位 拍某人的……；pat sb on the back = give sb a pat on the back 鼓勵某人；tap vt. 輕拍／輕敲","vt. & vi.","patting","Stop patting me on the head. I have had enough of it.","原書例句"],["learning","學識（不可數）","Professor Koss is a man of great ______.","寇斯教授是一個博學的人。","learn vi. 學習；learned a. 學問淵博的；knowledge n. 知識","n.","learning","Professor Koss is a man of great learning.","原書例句"],["kingdom","王國","The king ruled the ______ for 50 years.","那位國王統治那個王國有五十年之久。","king n. 國王／君主；empire n. 帝國；the United Kingdom 大英聯合王國","n.","kingdom","The king ruled the kingdom for 50 years.","原書例句"],["industrial","工業的","That area of the country is ______ rather than agricultural.","該國那個地區是工業區而非農業區。","industry n. 工業；industrious a. 勤奮的；diligent a. 勤奮的；industrialize vt. & vi.（使）工業化；industrialist n. 企業家／實業家；the Industrial Revolution 工業革命；agricultural a. 農業的","a.","industrial","That area of the country is industrial rather than agricultural.","原書例句"],["humid","溼氣重的","In the summer, the weather is generally hot and ______.","夏季時，天氣通常又熱又潮溼。","humidity n. 溼氣／溼度；damp a. 潮溼的；moist a. 潮溼的","a.","humid","In the summer, the weather is generally hot and humid.","原書例句"],["rectangle","長方形","The table is in the shape of a ______.","這個餐桌是長方形的。","rectangular a. 長方形的；square n. 正方形；circle n. 圓形；triangle n. 三角形；diamond n. 菱形","n.","rectangle","The table is in the shape of a rectangle.","原書例句"],["scarce","稀少的","Natural resources, such as timber and oil, are becoming ______.","像木材和石油等這類的天然資源正日漸稀少。","scarcely adv. 幾乎不；scarcity n. 稀罕／缺乏","a.","scarce","Natural resources, such as timber and oil, are becoming scarce.","原書例句"],["silk","絲","Jessica wore a blue ______ dress to the wedding party.","潔西卡穿一件藍色絲質洋裝參加結婚派對。","silky a. 像絲一樣的","n.","silk","Jessica wore a blue silk dress to the wedding party.","原書例句"],["slope","斜坡；山坡","It is difficult to ride a small motorcycle up a steep ______.","沿著陡坡騎摩托車是很困難的一件事。","a steep slope 陡坡；a gentle slope 緩坡","n.","slope","It is difficult to ride a small motorcycle up a steep slope.","原書例句"],["swan","天鵝","To everyone’s surprise, the ugly duckling has grown up into a beautiful ______.","令大家驚奇的是，那隻醜小鴨已經長大變成了一隻漂亮的天鵝。","—","n.","swan","To everyone’s surprise, the ugly duckling has grown up into a beautiful swan.","原書例句"],["log","圓木 & vt.","______, logged, logged；sleep like a log 睡得很沉；woods n. 樹林；timber n. 木材（= lumber）","Dad slept like a log and I couldn’t wake him up.","伐（木）；砍（樹）","n.","log","log, logged, logged；sleep like a log 睡得很沉；woods n. 樹林；timber n. 木材（= lumber）","原書例句"]],"U24":[["chimney","煙囪","Charlie smoked like a ______ all night, worrying about his missing daughter.","查理整晚不停抽菸，擔心他失蹤的女兒。","smoke like a chimney 菸抽得很兇","n.","chimney","Charlie smoked like a chimney all night, worrying about his missing daughter.","原書例句"],["clip","夾子；夾住；修剪","I need some ______ to hold these papers together.","我需要一些夾子把這些紙夾在一起。","clip, clipped, clipped；paper clip 迴紋針；stationery n. 文具；tack n. 圖釘 & vt. 釘住","n. & vt.","clips","I need some clips to hold these papers together.","原書例句"],["stationery","文具（不可數）","We need more office ______ for our work.","我們工作需要更多辦公文具。","office stationery 辦公文具","n.","stationery","We need more office stationery for our work.","原書例句"],["tack","圖釘；釘住","Jack used a ______ to fix the note onto the bulletin board.","傑克用圖釘把便條固定在布告欄上。","press a tack / thumbtack to the wall 把圖釘按入牆上","n. & vt.","tack","Jack used a tack to fix the note onto the bulletin board.","原書例句"],["countable","可數的","The word dog is a ______ noun, whereas the word water is an uncountable noun.","dog 這個字是可數名詞，而 water 這個字是不可數名詞。","countless a. 無數的；uncountable a. 不可數的","a.","countable","The word dog is a countable noun, whereas the word water is an uncountable noun.","原書例句"],["uncountable","不可數的","The word dog is a countable noun, whereas the word water is an ______ noun.","dog 這個字是可數名詞，而 water 這個字是不可數名詞。","countable a. 可數的","a.","uncountable","The word dog is a countable noun, whereas the word water is an uncountable noun.","原書例句"],["dearly","非常；深深地；昂貴地","Henry loves his family ______. He’s willing to do anything for them.","亨利深愛他的家人。他願意為他們做任何事。","cost sb dearly 使某人付出慘痛代價；greatly / deeply adv. 非常／深深地","adv.","dearly","Henry loves his family dearly. He’s willing to do anything for them.","原書例句"],["greatly","非常；大大地","Your advice ______ helped me make the decision.","你的建議大大幫助我做出決定。","deeply / dearly adv. 深深地","adv.","greatly","Your advice ______ helped me make the decision.","練習新編句"],["energetic","精力充沛的","Modern women are ______, ambitious and, most of all, persistent in the pursuit of their goals.","現代女性精力充沛、有企圖心，而且最重要的是，會堅持不懈地追求目標。","energy n. 精力；dynamic a. 有活力的；persistent a. 堅持不懈的","a.","energetic","Modern women are energetic, ambitious and, most of all, persistent in the pursuit of their goals.","原書例句"],["fairy","仙女；小精靈","______ are often described in folklore as tiny, mysterious creatures.","在民間傳說中，仙女常被描述成神祕的小生物。","fairies（複數）；fairy tale 童話；folklore n. 民間傳說；tiny a. 極小的","n.","Fairies","Fairies are often described in folklore as tiny, mysterious creatures.","原書例句"],["fireworks","煙火（複數）","Last night’s ______ were really impressive.","昨晚的煙火真的令人印象深刻。","set off fireworks 放煙火；firecracker n. 鞭炮；set off firecrackers 放鞭炮","n.","fireworks","Last night’s fireworks were really impressive.","原書例句"],["greenhouse","溫室","The ______ effect is raising ocean temperatures worldwide.","溫室效應正使全球海洋溫度上升。","the greenhouse effect 溫室效應","n.","greenhouse","The greenhouse effect is raising ocean temperatures worldwide.","原書例句"],["lighthouse","燈塔","The ______ cast a light onto the sea to guide the ships.","燈塔把光投向海面以引導船隻。","cast vt. 投射","n.","lighthouse","The lighthouse cast a light onto the sea to guide the ships.","原書例句"],["housekeeper","管家；女傭","Since you are so busy, you should hire a ______ to take care of your house.","既然你這麼忙，你應該雇一名管家照料房子。","housewife n. 家庭主婦；butler n. 男管家","n.","housekeeper","Since you are so busy, you should hire a housekeeper to take care of your house.","原書例句"],["hairdresser","美髮師","A ______ is one whose job is to cut, style, and color people’s hair.","美髮師的工作是替人剪髮、做造型及染髮。","haircut n. 理髮；get a haircut 理髮；hairdo / hairstyle n. 髮型；barbershop n. 理髮店；barber n. 理髮師；beauty parlor / hair salon 美髮院","n.","hairdresser","A hairdresser is one whose job is to cut, style, and color people’s hair.","原書例句"],["hatch","孵化；策劃；艙口","The hen is sitting on the eggs waiting for them to ______.","母雞正坐在蛋上等著牠們孵化。","hatches（複數）；hatch a plan / plot 策劃計畫／陰謀；Don’t count your chickens before they hatch. 別高興得太早。","vi. & vt. & n.","hatch","The hen is sitting on the eggs waiting for them to hatch.","原書例句"],["hug","擁抱","John gave his girlfriend a big ______ when they met at the airport.","約翰和女朋友在機場見面時，給了她一個大大的擁抱。","hug, hugged, hugged；give sb a big / warm hug 給某人一個大大的／溫暖的擁抱；embrace n. & vt. 擁抱","n. & vt.","hug","John gave his girlfriend a big hug when they met at the airport.","原書例句"],["kangaroo","袋鼠","Many tourists have been attacked by wild ______ recently.","最近有許多遊客遭到野生袋鼠攻擊。","kangaroos（複數）；koala n. 無尾熊","n.","kangaroos","Many tourists have been attacked by wild kangaroos recently.","原書例句"],["keyboard","鍵盤；電子琴","This computer ______ is designed to reduce wrist strain.","這個電腦鍵盤的設計是為了減少手腕的負擔。","a computer keyboard 電腦鍵盤；an electronic keyboard 電子琴；wrist n. 手腕；strain n. 拉傷／壓力","n.","keyboard","This computer keyboard is designed to reduce wrist strain.","原書例句"],["kit","成套工具；配備","When you’re at home, it’s always a good idea to have a first-aid ______ handy in case of emergency.","在家時，最好隨手備有急救箱，以防緊急狀況。","a first-aid kit 急救箱；a tool kit 工具箱；handy a. 手邊可用的","n.","kit","When you’re at home, it’s always a good idea to have a first-aid kit handy in case of emergency.","原書例句"],["lace","蕾絲；鞋帶；用帶子繫緊","Peggy’s wearing a beautiful evening gown which is trimmed with black ______.","佩姬穿著一件以黑色蕾絲裝飾的漂亮晚禮服。","be trimmed with lace 以蕾絲裝飾；a pair of shoelaces 一雙鞋帶；undone a. 鬆開的","n. & vi.","lace","Peggy’s wearing a beautiful evening gown which is trimmed with black lace.","原書例句"],["leak","漏；洩漏；漏洞","Oil was ______ out of the truck.","油正從卡車漏出來。","leaky a. 漏的；a gas leak 瓦斯洩漏","vi. & n.","leaking","Oil was leaking out of the truck.","原書例句"],["scrub","用力擦洗；擦洗","Julie was busy ______ the floor while her husband prepared dinner.","茱莉忙著刷洗地板，而她的丈夫在準備晚餐。","scrub, scrubbed, scrubbed；give the floor / table a good scrub 好好擦洗地板／桌子；mop vt. 拖地","vt. & n.","scrubbing","Julie was busy scrubbing the floor while her husband prepared dinner.","原書例句"],["scarf","圍巾","The ______ you’re wearing looks great. Where did you get it?","你戴的這條圍巾很好看。你在哪裡買的？","scarfs / scarves（複數）","n.","scarf","The scarf you’re wearing looks great. Where did you get it?","原書例句"],["pearl","珍珠","I bought this ______ necklace at a bargain price.","我以便宜的價格買了這條珍珠項鍊。","a string of pearls 一串珍珠；cast pearls before swine 明珠暗投／對牛彈琴；pearly a. 珍珠般的","n.","pearl","I bought this pearl necklace at a bargain price.","原書例句"],["pearly","珍珠般的；珍珠色的","Susan has ______ white teeth.","蘇珊有一口珍珠般潔白的牙齒。","pearly white teeth 潔白如珍珠的牙齒","a.","pearly","Susan has pearly white teeth.","原書例句"],["poster","海報","Mary put up a ______ of Madonna on the wall.","瑪麗在牆上貼了一張瑪丹娜的海報。","put up a poster 張貼海報","n.","poster","Mary put up a poster of Madonna on the wall.","原書例句"],["sausage","香腸","This restaurant is famous for its German ______ and beer.","這家餐廳以德國香腸和啤酒聞名。","—","n.","sausages","This restaurant is famous for its German sausages and beer.","原書例句"],["shovel","鏟子；用鏟子鏟","John used a ______ to shovel the snow away from his front door.","約翰用鏟子把前門的雪鏟走。","shove vt. 推；shove sb out of the way 把某人推開；spade n. 鏟子","n. & vt.","shovel","John used a shovel to shovel the snow away from his front door.","原書例句"],["spice","香料；給……加香料；增添趣味","This ______ gives the soup a stronger flavor.","這種香料讓湯的味道更濃郁。","spicy a. 辛辣的；spice up... 為……增添趣味；cinnamon n. 肉桂；Variety is the spice of life. 變化是生活的調味料。","n. & vt.","spice","This ______ gives the soup a stronger flavor.","練習新編句"],["starve","使挨餓；挨餓","All the prisoners of war here have been ______ and ill treated.","這裡所有戰俘都挨餓並受到虐待。","be starving / starved to death 餓死；starvation n. 飢餓","vt. & vi.","starved","All the prisoners of war here have been starved and ill treated.","原書例句"],["sting","螫；刺痛；螫傷","Stay away from the bees. They might ______ you.","離蜜蜂遠一點。牠們可能會螫你。","sting, stung, stung；stinger n. 螫針","vt. & vi. & n.","sting","Stay away from the bees. They might sting you.","原書例句"],["tame","馴服的；馴服","Strange to say, the wild horse became very ______ as soon as it saw me.","說也奇怪，那匹野馬一看到我就變得非常溫馴。","obedient a. 順從的；docile a. 溫馴的；wild a. 野生的","a. & vt.","tame","Strange to say, the wild horse became very tame as soon as it saw me.","原書例句"],["thirst","口渴；渴望","I need a glass of water to quench my ______.","我需要一杯水來解渴。","quench one’s thirst 解渴；thirst for sth 渴望某物；long for sth 渴望某物；thirsty a. 口渴的","n. & vi.","thirst","I need a glass of water to quench my thirst.","原書例句"],["tow","拖；牽引","All illegally parked cars are to be ______ away.","所有違規停放的車輛都將被拖走。","tow sth away 拖走某物；give sb / sth a tow 拖／拉某人或某物","vt. & n.","towed","All illegally parked cars are to be towed away.","原書例句"],["vase","花瓶","I bumped into a table and broke a ______.","我撞到桌子，打破了一個花瓶。","a vase of flowers 一瓶花","n.","vase","I bumped into a table and broke a vase.","原書例句"],["lollipop","棒棒糖","You should brush your teeth after eating the ______, Johnny.","強尼，吃完棒棒糖後你應該刷牙。","—","n.","lollipop","You should brush your teeth after eating the lollipop, Johnny.","原書例句"],["teenage","青少年的","My ______ daughter loves rock ’n’ roll.","我十幾歲的女兒很喜歡搖滾樂。","teenaged a. 青少年的；teenager n. 青少年；teen(s) n. 青少年；adolescent n. 青少年","a.","teenage","My teenage daughter loves rock ’n’ roll.","原書例句"],["tank","坦克；槽；箱","The ______ smashed through the building at a high speed.","那輛坦克高速撞穿了建築物。","a water tank 水箱；a fuel tank 燃料箱；a gas tank 汽油箱；tanker n. 油輪／油罐車","n.","tank","The tank smashed through the building at a high speed.","原書例句"],["bacteria","細菌（複數）","Handrails are covered in / with ______.","扶手上布滿了細菌。","bacterium（單數）；germ n. 細菌；virus n. 病毒","n.","bacteria","Handrails are covered in / with bacteria.","原書例句"],["bay","海灣","Polly lives in a beautiful mansion overlooking the ______.","波莉住在一棟可俯瞰海灣的漂亮豪宅裡。","keep sb at bay = keep sb at a distance 使某人保持距離；gulf n. 海灣；mansion n. 豪宅","n.","bay","Polly lives in a beautiful mansion overlooking the bay.","原書例句"],["bomb","炸彈；轟炸","The time ______ went off at 10, killing all the people around.","定時炸彈在十點爆炸，炸死周遭所有的人。","a bomb squad 拆彈小組；bomber n. 轟炸機／投彈者；bombard vt. 轟炸；mine n. 地雷；missile n. 飛彈","n. & vt.","bomb","The time bomb went off at 10, killing all the people around.","原書例句"],["cave","洞穴","The ______ was dark and scary.","那個洞穴又黑又可怕。","a cave-in 塌方／洞穴坍塌","n.","cave","The cave was dark and scary.","原書例句"],["flute","長笛","John plays the ______ very well.","約翰長笛吹得很好。","play the flute 吹長笛","n.","flute","John plays the flute very well.","原書例句"],["razor","刮鬍刀；剃刀","I bought some disposable ______ for my trip overseas.","我買了一些免洗刮鬍刀，準備出國旅行時使用。","a razor blade 刮鬍刀片；shaver n. 電動刮鬍刀；disposable a. 用完即丟的；disposable chopsticks 免洗筷","n.","razors","I bought some disposable razors for my trip overseas.","原書例句"],["blade","刀片；葉片","The razor ______ is dull, so you have to replace it with a new one.","這片刮鬍刀片鈍了，所以你得換一片新的。","razor blade 刮鬍刀片；dull a. 鈍的","n.","blade","The razor blade is dull, so you have to replace it with a new one.","原書例句"],["magnet","磁鐵","The boy picked up the nails with a ______.","那男孩用磁鐵把釘子吸起來。","magnetic a. 有磁性的；磁力的","n.","magnet","The boy picked up the nails with a magnet.","原書例句"]]};
